{'copyright': 'Copyright (c) 2020 The New York Times Company. All Rights Reserved.', 'response': {'docs': [{'abstract': 'Takashi Fujimoto, who sustained an electric shock and a minor stroke as Hurricane Sandy battered his home on Staten Island, is thankful for the “angels and heroes” who have helped him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/01/nyregion/a-changed-perspective-after-hurricane-sandy-wreaked-havoc.html', 'snippet': 'Takashi Fujimoto, who sustained an electric shock and a minor stroke as Hurricane Sandy battered his home on Staten Island, is thankful for the “angels and heroes” who have helped him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is fair to say Takashi Fujimoto has an independent streak. As an artistic young man growing up in postwar Hiroshima, Japan, during the grim years after the 1945 nuclear blast, he dreamed of leaving home to pursue his love of photography and escape the rigid expectations of what he termed a very conservative society.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/nyregion/01neediestbulldog/01neediestbulldog-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/01/nyregion/01neediestbulldog/01neediestbulldog-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/nyregion/01neediestbulldog/01neediestbulldog-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/01/nyregion/01neediestbulldog/01neediestbulldog-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt