)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spuyten Duyvil (Bronx, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Poughkeepsie (NY)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Transportation Authority', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York Metropolitan Area', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-01T13:42:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Barron and J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barron', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/208c6b3c-fa56-564c-942c-a09a64453508', 'word_count': 1675, 'uri': 'nyt://article/208c6b3c-fa56-564c-942c-a09a64453508'}, {'abstract': 'Every day from now until Christmas, the editors of T are sharing their personal gift suggestions. Today’s pick: handcrafted decks designed to thrill.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/01/holiday-the-daily-gift-natural-log-skateboards/', 'snippet': 'Every day from now until Christmas, the editors of T are sharing their personal gift suggestions. Today’s pick: handcrafted decks designed to thrill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every day from now until Christmas, the editors of T are sharing their personal gift suggestions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Holiday | The Daily Gift: Natural Log Skateboards', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-01T14:00:10+0000',