om at the David Zwirner Gallery, and her creation has become an event.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Adam Friedman emerged from the twinkling lights and reflecting water of Yayoi Kusama’s “infinity room” and groped for the right words. “Ethereal,” he said. Pause. “Calming.” Another pause. “Calming, ethereal and meditative, all at the same time.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lights, Mirrors, Instagram! #ArtSensation', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lights, Mirrors, Instagram! #ArtSensation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kusama, Yayoi', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Zwirner, David, Gallery', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-01T22:29:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Grimes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grimes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/58560cf5-ddef-5f96-9935-2766f71ab47b', 'word_count': 1118, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58560cf5-ddef-5f96-9935-2766f71ab47b'}, {'abstract': 'The New York Philharmonic, performing at Avery Fisher Hall, tried to capture Mozart’s spirit and depth during a program featuring his last three symphonies.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/02/arts/music/new-york-philharmonic-at-avery-fisher-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The New York Philharmonic, performing at Avery Fisher Hall, tried to capture Mozart’s spirit and depth during a program featuring his last three symphonies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Though Mozart wrote his final three symphonies, astonishingly, in a six-week burst in the summer of 1788, he would never have considered them a unit. It was not until long after his death that performing the three together became fashionable; it is now a commonplace.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/PHIL/PHIL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/PHIL/PHIL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/PHIL/PHIL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/PHIL/PHIL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/PHIL/PHIL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/PHIL/PHIL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/PHIL/PHIL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Three Symphonies, the Demands of Mozart', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Three Symphonies, The Demands of Mozart', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'W