tacle in the low-caste villagers’ struggle for equal rights.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/02/a-dalit-village-waits-uneasily-for-justice/', 'snippet': 'The recent acquittals of the men accused of killing 58 Dalits in Bihar are just the latest obstacle in the low-caste villagers’ struggle for equal rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The night a horde of men crossed over the nearby river and killed Mahendra Chaudhary and 57 of his villagers in the low-caste Dalit hamlet of Lakshmanpur Bathe in Bihar, he was probably having dinner with his family of six like any other day. If not dinner, he could have been cuddling his children, say his neighbors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Dalit Village Waits Uneasily for Justice', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Land Use Policies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Landlords', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nineteen Hundred Seventies', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kumar, Nitish', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bihar (India)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-02T12:39:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neyaz Farooquee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neyaz', 'midd