s/', 'snippet': 'Taking vitamin D and calcium, alone or together, failed to reduce the severity of respiratory tract infections during the winter months, according to a new study.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A randomized, placebo-controlled trial has found that vitamin D and calcium, whatever their other benefits may be, have no effect on upper respiratory tract infections. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 215, 'width': 217, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 215, 'width': 217, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vitamin D Fails to Ease Winter Coughs and Colds', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prevention: Hold the Vitamin D and Calcium', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Calcium', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Respiratory Diseases', 'rank': 2, 