ization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4748a48e-bde3-5ad5-8c1d-bde79dc3ae0e', 'word_count': 31, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4748a48e-bde3-5ad5-8c1d-bde79dc3ae0e'}, {'abstract': 'Kim Shattuck, who replaced the Pixies’ longtime bassist, Kim Deal, in July, is leaving weeks before the band begins a North American tour.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/02/pixies-bassist-to-depart-after-a-short-tenure/', 'snippet': 'Kim Shattuck, who replaced the Pixies’ longtime bassist, Kim Deal, in July, is leaving weeks before the band begins a North American tour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Another Kim has departed the Pixies. Kim Shattuck, who replaced Kim Deal, the band’s longtime bassist, in July, revealed on her Facebook page on Friday that she was leaving the band and implied that the decision was not hers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/02artsbeat-pixies/02artsbeat-pixies-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 854, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/02artsbeat-pixies/02artsbeat-pixies-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 854}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/02artsbeat-pixies/02artsbeat-pixies-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 720, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/02artsbeat-pixies/02artsbeat-pixies-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1439, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/arts/02artsbeat-pixies/02artsbeat-pixies-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height'