', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/12f50490-13b7-50a2-8ae9-b84014256d19', 'word_count': 1537, 'uri': 'nyt://article/12f50490-13b7-50a2-8ae9-b84014256d19'}, {'abstract': 'Chris Stewart, who became expendable once the Yankees signed Brian McCann to a five-year deal, will presumably back up the former Yankee Russell Martin in Pittsburgh.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/sports/baseball/yankees-trade-catcher-chris-stewart-to-the-pirates.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Stewart, who became expendable once the Yankees signed Brian McCann to a five-year deal, will presumably back up the former Yankee Russell Martin in Pittsburgh.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chris Stewart had a unique feeling in April. It was the first time he had begun a second consecutive season with the same team, working with the same pitching staff and following the instructions from the same manager and coaches. It was a good feeling, he said, but it turned out to be fleeting.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/03yankees/03yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/03yankees/03yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/03yankees/03yankees-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/03yankees/03yankees-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1391, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th