Nick Kroll (of “Kroll Show” on Comedy Central), an old Bagger pal, serving as host. Like its West Coast cousin, the Film Independent Spirit Awards, the Gothams are more of a D.I.Y. affair, full of jokes about tight budgets, short shooting schedules and other difficulties of indie filmmaking, an apparently thankless task that nonetheless inspires devotion in the room. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Expect at the Gothams', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gotham Independent Film Awards', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gandolfini, James', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kroll, Nick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Linklater, Richard', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Whitaker, Forest', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-02T19:30:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5636c6dc-bdab-5ef8-bfa3-e0aad84f44c7', 'word_count': 282, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5636c6dc-bdab-5ef8-bfa3-e0aad84f44c7'}, {'abstract': 'The show, which wrapped up on Sunday, has once again gone off without a problem. Things were different in 1929.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/automobiles/autoshow/the-great-los-angeles-auto-show-fire-of-1929.html', 'snippet': 'The show, which wrapped up on Sunday, has once again gone off without a problem. Things were different in 1929.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sunday brought about the end of another chapter in the history of the Los Angeles Auto Show, an event that, aside from 1940 to 1951, has showed off new cars since 1907. This year in the hallway between the two cavernous rooms glinting with new automobiles, there was a long display about the history of the show, bringing to light a bit of trivia.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/automobiles/03FIRE-LATpic/03FIRE-LATpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 242, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/03/automobiles/03FIRE-LATpic/03FIRE-LATpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 242}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/automobiles/03FIRE-LATpic/03FIRE-LATpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 970, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/automobiles/03FIRE-LATpic/03FIRE-LATpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 970, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/automobiles/03FIRE-LATpic/03FIRE-LATpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/03/automobiles/03FIRE-LATpic/03FIRE-LATpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/automobiles/03FIRE-LATpic/03FIRE-LATpic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Great Los Angeles Auto Sho