ount': 187, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9763b875-affa-5869-821a-c6bead9ed92c'}, {'abstract': 'Cam Talbot, who started over a healthy Henrik Lundqvist, allowed four goals in 29 shots against Winnipeg and saw his record fall to 6-2.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/sports/hockey/talbot-to-start-as-rangers-play-down-any-goalie-controversy.html', 'snippet': 'Cam Talbot, who started over a healthy Henrik Lundqvist, allowed four goals in 29 shots against Winnipeg and saw his record fall to 6-2.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Rangers’ goaltender controversy ended almost as quickly as it began. On Monday morning, Coach Alain Vigneault surprisingly named the first-year sensation Cam Talbot to start against the Winnipeg Jets on Monday night at Madison Square Garden. The decision meant a healthy Henrik Lundqvist would sit out a second straight game — which had not happened since February 2011.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/sub-yRANGERS/sub-yRANGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/sub-yRANGERS/sub-yRANGERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/sub-yRANGERS/sub-yRANGERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/sub-yRANGERS/sub-yRANGERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1437, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/sub-yRANGERS/sub-yRANGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/sub-yRANGERS/sub-yRANGERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/sub-yRANGERS/sub-yRANGERS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Lundqvist Sits Again, a Hot Hand Turns Cool', 'kicker': 'Jets 5, Rangers 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Lundqvist Sits Again, A Hot Hand Turns Cool', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Jeff Z', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Talbot, Cam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lundqvist, Henrik', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Winnipeg Jets', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-02T20:26:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/339c548a-4358-5419-a018-ba8220aecb8a', 'word_count': 773, 'uri': 'nyt://article/339c548a-4358-5419-a018-ba8220aecb8a'}, {'abstract': 'What should the church’s liberal wing hope for from the new pontificate?', 'web_url': 'https://douthat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/02/liberal-catholics-in-the-age-of-francis/', 'snippet': 'What should the church’s liberal wing hope for from the new pontificate?', 'lead_paragraph': 'My Sunday column discussed what Catholics on the political right should make of Pope Francis’s latest exhortation, and how they should respond to a papacy that has been emphasizing the church’s social teaching in language that Catholics with free-market views might not necessarily be eager to embrace. The other, equally-interesting question, of course is how Catholics of a more liberal persuasion (politically and theologically) should respond to Francis — or, perhaps more aptly, what they should be looking for, hoping for, and working toward in a pontificate whose tone they mostly find congenial, but whose substance has included reaffirmations of Catholic teaching on some of the culture-war issues dividing left and right.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Liberal Catholics in the Age of Francis', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Celibacy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Priests', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Benedict XVI', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Francis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jesus Christ', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-02T20:29:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85ee11f8-28ed-56e4-b509-7a8695abee57', 'word_count': 1240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85ee11f8-28ed-56e4-b509-7a8695abee57'}, {'abstract': 'Microsoft said it was pleased to receive the approval and it looked “forward to the date when our partners at Nokia will become members of the Microsoft family.”', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/02/justice-department-approves-microsoft-deal/', 'snippet': 'Microsoft said it was pleased to receive the approval and it looked “forward to the date when our partners at Nokia will become members of the Microsoft family.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE — Microsoft got closer on Monday to completing the most significant deal in the company’s history, its $7.2 billion acquisition of Nokia’s mobile handset and services business.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/business/02bits-msoft/02bits-msoft-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/02/business/02bits-msoft/02bits-msoft-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/business/02bits-msoft/02bits-msoft-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/business/02bits-msoft/02bits-msoft-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1436, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/02/business/02bits-msoft/02bits-msoft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/02/business/02bits-msoft/02bits-msoft-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thu