ion': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d0cf0877-3379-534e-9d0b-d202a95b8a1b', 'word_count': 770, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0cf0877-3379-534e-9d0b-d202a95b8a1b'}, {'abstract': 'The United States Supreme Court will let stand a decision that the companies must collect sales taxes despite the lack of a physical presence in the state.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/business/new-york-ruling-on-sales-tax-collection-by-online-retailers-will-stand.html', 'snippet': 'The United States Supreme Court will let stand a decision that the companies must collect sales taxes despite the lack of a physical presence in the state.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The United States Supreme Court on Monday let stand a ruling from New York’s highest court requiring Internet retailers to collect sales taxes even if they have no physical presence in the state.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/business/Bizcourt/Bizcourt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 326, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/03/business/Bizcourt/Bizcourt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 326}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/business/Bizcourt/Bizcourt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 557, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/business/Bizcourt/Bizcourt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1114, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/business/Bizcourt/Bizcourt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75