ticle/98ee70f1-2a0c-5b91-bd43-efa8e644cd33'}, {'abstract': 'The Hartman Group, which represents such hit shows as “Wicked” and “Rock of Ages,” will close in January.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/02/veteran-broadway-press-agent-to-close-up-shop/', 'snippet': 'The Hartman Group, which represents such hit shows as “Wicked” and “Rock of Ages,” will close in January.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The veteran Broadway press agent Michael Hartman announced on Monday that he was closing his company, the Hartman Group, on Jan. 5, leaving his account executives to quickly find new agencies for, among other shows, the blockbuster “Wicked,” the fan favorite “Rock of Ages,” and the coming musicals “Rocky,” “If/Then,” “The Last Ship” (Sting’s Broadway debut as a composer) and “Houdini” (starring Tony Award winner Hugh Jackman).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Veteran Broadway Press Agent to Close Up Shop', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hartman, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Scott (1957- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-02T23:45:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e6a7c12-451d-5f6d-8122-ea7e2011593a', 'word_count': 591, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e6a7c12-451d-5f6d-8122-ea7e2011593a'}, {'abstract': 'Each of these four top-notch designers creates work that will appeal to a highly distinct female persona.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2