dio announcer for Auburn football, conveyed energy and emotion in making the two greatest calls of his career during Auburn’s stunning wins over Georgia and Alabama.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/sports/ncaafootball/auburn-announcer-has-the-call-of-a-lifetime-twice-in-one-month.html', 'snippet': 'Rod Bramblett, the radio announcer for Auburn football, conveyed energy and emotion in making the two greatest calls of his career during Auburn’s stunning wins over Georgia and Alabama.', 'lead_paragraph': 'College football on radio is no place for subdued restraint. Announcers are oftentimes loud, excitable, and biased. Great, decisive, game-ending plays can be cues to go wild.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/jp-yAUBURN/jp-yAUBURN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/jp-yAUBURN/jp-yAUBURN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/jp-yAUBURN/jp-yAUBURN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 635, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/jp-yAUBURN/jp-yAUBURN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 1254, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/jp-yAUBURN/jp-yAUBURN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/03/sports/jp-yAUBURN/jp-yAUBURN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth'