ean Union and the West.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/opinion/a-moment-of-peril-in-kiev.html', 'snippet': 'Russia must understand Ukrainians’ wish for stronger ties with the European Union and the West.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kiev’s Independence Square has been seized by protesters furious with Viktor Yanukovich, Ukraine’s president, because he has decided against signing a trade deal with the European Union — a deal that many ordinary citizens saw as critically important to their economic future. It is not immediately clear what Mr. Yanukovich can do, short of changing his mind and signing a deal. But the protests could well get bigger and more violent. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Moment of Peril in Kiev', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Moment of Peril in Kiev', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yanukovich, Viktor F', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kiev (Ukraine)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-03T02:37:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bb907a2-0906-51b9-940f-da93654f56b9', 'wo