troopers to a special fleet to catch cellphone texters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pileup of grim fatality data about the risks of distracted driving has prompted New York State to assign highway troopers to a special fleet of 32 CITE vehicles, for Concealed Identity Traffic Enforcement, designed to catch cellphone texters as they tap away. These are nondescript gray S.U.V.’s that ride higher than normal so officers can peer down into vehicles moving suspiciously in the hands (or nonhands) of drivers eyeing and manipulating their electronic-message devices. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stealth S.U.V.’s', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stealth S.U.V.&#8217;s ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Driver Distraction and Fatigue', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Text Messaging', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cellular Telephones', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-03T02:45:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4a3ed8a-b7ff-5bc6-abb0-43e107f59915', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4a3ed8a-b7ff-5bc6-abb0-43e107f59915'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the day for Tuesday, December 3, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-tuesday-december-3-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for