: 'This week’s In Performance video features a scene with Peter Bradbury as Ebenezer Scrooge in Patrick Barlow’s new adaptation of Charles Dickens’s “Christmas Carol.” The show, directed by Joe Calarco, continues through Jan. 4 at the Theater at St. Clement’s.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Performance: Peter Bradbury of ‘A Christmas Carol’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barlow, Patrick', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bradbury, Peter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dickens, Charles', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Theater at St Clement's Church", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-03T13:00:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bc996526-cac1-5a7a-b412-df2b105f3097', 'word_count': 106, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bc996526-cac1-5a7a-b412-df2b105f3097'}, {'abstract': 'Nongovernmental organizations have pushed to get homeless people in the city registered to vote in this year’s state assembly elections.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/homeless-in-delhi-get-chance-to-exercise-voting-rights/', 'snippet': 'Nongovernmental organizations have pushed to get homeless people in the city registered to vote in this year’s state assembly elections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — On a hazy Tuesday morning at a homeless shelter, Durga Dayal, 27, showed me his voter identity card with great elation. As I sat looking at h