likely to perform the best in the next three weeks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/04/sports/football/fantasy-football-player-picks-for-the-playoffs.html', 'snippet': 'As the fantasy playoffs start this week, owners will sift through 13 weeks of statistics to pinpoint players who are likely to perform the best in the next three weeks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is the best time of the year to be a fantasy football analyst. The fantasy playoffs start this week for many owners and we have a full 13 weeks of statistics to sift through as we try to pinpoint the players who will perform the best in the next three crucial weeks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/04fantasy1/04fantasy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/04fantasy1/04fantasy1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/04fantasy1/04fantasy1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/04fantasy1/04fantasy1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/04fantasy1/04fantasy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/04fantasy1/04fantasy1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None