'abstract': 'Of those who applied and were found eligible for the Medicaid or CHIP, slightly more than half were in states that have decided to expand Medicaid, as permitted under the Affordable Care Act, while 48 percent were in states that have not expanded Medicaid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/news/affordable-care-act/2013/12/03/october-medicaid-applications-far-outpace-enrollment-through-exchanges/', 'snippet': 'Of those who applied and were found eligible for the Medicaid or CHIP, slightly more than half were in states that have decided to expand Medicaid, as permitted under the Affordable Care Act, while 48 percent were in states that have not expanded ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Obama administration said Tuesday that 1.46 million people had applied and been found eligible for Medicaid or the Children’s Health Insurance Program in October, far more than had selected a private health plan in the new insurance marketplaces.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'October Medicaid Applications Far Outpace Enrollment Through Exchanges', 'kicker': 'In Practice', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-03T17:48:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Pear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pear', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/106a0cba-cd1c-5119-abe3-25e657e3db06', 'word_count': 364, 'uri': 'nyt://article/106a0cba-cd1c-5119-abe3-25e657e3db06'}, {'abstract': 'Most studies say that braking function returns to normal four weeks after right knee arthroscopy, nine weeks after surgery for an ankle fracture, and six weeks after the patient can walk unencumbered after a fracture of a major lower-body bone.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/when-is-it-safe-to-drive-after-breaking-a-bone/', 'snippet': 'Most studies say that braking function returns to normal four weeks after right knee arthroscopy, nine weeks after surgery for an ankle fracture, and six weeks after the patient can walk unencumbered after a fracture of a major lower-body bone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hands on the steering wheel, one foot toggling between brake and pedal, head twisting to check mirrors. Consider the many bones and joints you must engage before you even turn on a car’s ignition, among them the fingers, wrist, forearm, elbow, shoulder, neck, heel, ankle and leg.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/health/28well_leg/28well_leg-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/28/health/28well_leg/28well_leg-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/health/28well_leg/28well_leg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 565, 'width': 849, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/health/28well_leg/28well_leg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 565, 'width': 849, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/28/health/28well_leg/28well_leg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/11/28/health/28well_leg/28well_leg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'