ed as an indication of the recovery’s staying power.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/04/business/out-of-a-lull-automakers-post-strong-us-sales-in-november.html', 'snippet': 'The sales increase, after a slowing in September and October, was being closely watched as an indication of the recovery’s staying power.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sales over the Thanksgiving weekend may have been a disappointment for the nation’s retailers, but they were a boon for automakers, lifting their sales in the United States for November to the best rate since before the recession.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Out of the Doldrums, Automakers Post Strong U.S. Sales', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Out of the Doldrums, Automakers Post Strong U.S. Sales', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Motors', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chrysler Group LLC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toyota Motor Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-03T19:52:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jaclyn Trop', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jaclyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Trop', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0786aa6c-622d-5e7a-ba93-a3bf66b12935', 'word_count': 827, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0786aa6c-622d-5e7a-ba93-a3bf66b12935'}, {'abstr