eavily on cheese, salt and crunch (and warm smiles).', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE HARDEST-WORKING WOMAN in the food business one recent night was the host of Charlie Bird, in SoHo. Armed with nothing but good cheer and a smile that could stop a war, she had the unenviable job of preventing an uprising in a waiting area by the door that might comfortably hold three people if they were very skinny and could survive for minutes at a time without breathing. There were around 10 of us. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/dining/04REST_395/04REST_395-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/04/dining/04REST_395/04REST_395-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/dining/04REST_395/04REST_395-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/dining/04REST_395/04REST_395-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/dining/04REST_395/04REST_395-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/04/dining/04REST_395/04REST_395-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/dining/04REST_395/04REST_395-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Relaxed Air, but Attention Must Be Paid', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Relaxed Air, but Attention Must Be Paid', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Charlie Bird (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'SoHo (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-03T21:33:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pete Wells', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pete', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wells', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/377e07d5-efb7-56ee-9d13-b1d47ef72a44', 'word_count': 1055, 'uri': 'nyt://article/377e07d5-efb7-56ee-9d13-b1d47ef72a44'}, {'abstract': 'The New York Film Critics Circle gave three awards to the David O. Russell film, though “12 Years a Slave” won for best direction.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/03/american-hustle-makes-a-showing-with-critics-circle/', 'snippet': 'The New York Film Critics Circle gave three awards to the David O. Russell film, though “12 Years a Slave” won for best direction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The late-arriving “American Hustle,” which reunites David O. Russell with much of his casts from “The Fighter” and “Silver Linings Playbook,” was the surprise winner with the New York Film Critics Circle, which announced its year-end picks on Tuesday. The film, set loosely around the 1970s Abscam scandal, took best feature, best screenplay (for Mr. Russell and Eric Singer) and best supporting actress, for Jennifer Lawrence. It is among the final entries in the very tight Oscar race this season and beat out expected competitors like “12 Years a Slave,” “Nebraska” and “Inside Llewyn Davis.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/arts/hustle/hustle-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/03/arts/hustle/hustle-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/arts/hustle/hustle-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/arts/hustle/hustle-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1195, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/arts/hustle/hustle-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/03/arts/hustle/hustle-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/03/arts/hustle/hustle-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘American Hustle’ Makes a Showing With Critics Circle', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blanchett, Cate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coogler, Ryan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'v