a'}, {'abstract': 'The court heard arguments Tuesday in a rabbi’s case against Northwest Airlines, which revoked his membership in its frequent flier program. A federal law limits the kind of suits travelers may file.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/04/us/politics/supreme-court-considers-frequent-flier-contracts.html', 'snippet': 'The court heard arguments Tuesday in a rabbi’s case against Northwest Airlines, which revoked his membership in its frequent flier program. A federal law limits the kind of suits travelers may file.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Rabbi S. Binyomin Ginsberg used to fly often enough on Northwest Airlines that he achieved Platinum Elite status, the highest level. But the airline revoked his membership in its frequent flier program in June 2008, saying that he had abused it by making too many complaints and by booking himself on full flights in the hope of being bumped.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/us/SCOTUS/SCOTUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/04/us/SCOTUS/SCOTUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/us/SCOTUS/SCOTUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/us/SCOTUS/SCOTUS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1419, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/us/SCOTUS/SCOTUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75