 summer afternoon in movie form. This is the third feature from the writer and director Laura Colella, who has shot it in and around her own well-loved, multifamily Victorian and the house next door. Her neighbors play the film’s overlapping, underdressed group of friends and family. This micro-indie movie is partly about a taciturn, home-schooled teenager, Curtis (subtly played by Jonah Parker), coming out of his shell, but it’s mostly about hanging out.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/arts/sub04BREAKFAST/sub04BREAKFAST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/04/arts/sub04BREAKFAST/sub04BREAKFAST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/arts/sub04BREAKFAST/sub04BREAKFAST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/arts/sub04BREAKFAST/sub04BREAKFAST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1310, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/arts/sub04BREAKFAST/sub04BREAKFAST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/04/arts/sub04BREAKFAST/sub04BREAKFAST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/arts/sub04BREAKFAST/sub04BREAKFAST-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height'