riends, family and journalists attended the funeral on Tuesday of Peter W. Kaplan, the former editor of The New York Observer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/04/nyregion/at-peter-kaplans-funeral-mourning-the-master-of-the-masters.html', 'snippet': 'About 600 friends, family and journalists attended the funeral on Tuesday of Peter W. Kaplan, the former editor of The New York Observer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LARCHMONT, N.Y. — Manhattan publishing took a very sad holiday on Tuesday. Many of its better-known practitioners traveled by train, car and, in some cases, chartered bus, to Larchmont Temple in Westchester County to say farewell to one of their heroes, Peter W. Kaplan. Mr. Kaplan died last Friday of lymphoma.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/30/nyregion/kaplan-obit/kaplan-obit-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/11/30/nyregion/kaplan-obit/kaplan-obit-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/30/nyregion/kaplan-obit/kaplan-obit-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/30/nyregion/kaplan-obit/kaplan-obit-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1314, 'width': 1949, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/11/30/nyregion/kaplan-obit/kaplan-obit-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/