near completion on a seven-year, $153 million deal for center fielder Jacoby Ellsbury.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/04/sports/baseball/yankees-and-jacoby-ellsbury-near-seven-year-deal.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees on Tuesday night were near completion on a seven-year, $153 million deal for center fielder Jacoby Ellsbury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the Yankees signed Johnny Damon away from the Boston Red Sox in 2006 — two years after he helped them beat the Yankees and win the World Series — it was a coup. Damon provided the Yankees with speed on the bases and home run power from the left side of the plate, and he helped them win a championship in 2009.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/baseball/04baseball-1/04baseball-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 413, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/baseball/04baseball-1/04baseball-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 413}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/baseball/04baseball-1/04baseball-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 704, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/baseball/04baseball-1/04baseball-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1408, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/baseball/04baseball-1/04baseball-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/04/sports/baseball/04bas