gs.nytimes.com/2013/12/04/listen-up-a-new-voice-for-the-girl-pop-revolution/', 'snippet': 'Femme, a 25-year-old from London whose buoyant tunes evoke the punchier shades of girl pop’s past, arrives stateside.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s safe to say, in the wake of the success of artists like Lorde and Icona Pop, that we’re currently in the midst of a girl-pop revolution, and hot on the heels of this trend is Femme, a 25-year-old from London who cites her inspirations as a “proper mishmash” of Motown and Destiny’s Child. “I only started messing around with music when I was 16,” she said yesterday while waiting for a flight to New York, where she performs tonight at the Mercury Lounge, the second stop on her debut United States tour. “For me, making music was always just for fun.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Listen Up | A New Voice for the Girl-Pop Revolution', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-04T22:58:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rob Ledonne', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ledonne', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a36963b5-8b6f-5891-bc27-24cd1c17cb13', 'word_count': 228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a36963b5-8b6f-5891-bc27-24cd1c17cb13'}, {'abstract': 'Armed with an Off Broadway budget, an actor wonders: What would Barbra buy?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/05/fashion/-Shopping-With-actor-Michael-Urie-Encounters.html', 'snippet': 'Armed with an Off Broadway budget, an actor wonders: What would Barbra buy?', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a recent Saturday morning, the actor Michael Urie was part of the throng filtering past the ticket takers in the opening hours of the Pier Antique Show on the West Side of Manhattan. The reed-thin Mr. Urie, who is around six feet tall (“I say 5-11, so not to get typecast as tall”) seemed to feel at home among the sharp-eyed shoppers, being a frequent visitor to flea markets and vintage clothing stores.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/fashion/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN/05zENCOUNTERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/05/fashion/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN/05zENCOUNTERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/fashion/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN/05zENCOUNTERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/fashion/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN/05zENCOUNTERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/fashion/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/05/fashion/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/fashion/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN/05ENCOUNTERS_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Michael Urie: Lesson