rica and JPMorgan Chase missed goals that aimed to eliminate mistakes, misinformation and lengthy delays from the process of granting loan modifications.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three of the nation’s largest mortgage lenders are still failing to comply with key requirements of a national settlement over mortgage abuses, according to a new report that suggests that some borrowers are still trapped in a tangle of red tape and errors as they try to save their homes from foreclosure.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Banks Fail to Comply With Parts of Mortgage Settlement, Report Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Banks Fail to Comply With Parts of Mortgage Settlement, Report Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dewan, Shaila K', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreclosures', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Joseph A Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of America Corporation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ally Financial Inc', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citigroup Inc', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-05T02:52:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shaila Dewan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shaila', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dewan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}],