 Henry Purcell.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The vocal ensemble Tenet and the group of chamber players known as the Sebastians share interests that range from early music to modern works — and a number of performers who work with both groups. The two recently joined forces for two concerts in celebration of St. Cecilia, at the Church of St. Luke in the Fields in Greenwich Village and at Connecticut College. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Performance: Tenet and the Sebastians', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Purcell, Henry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-05T16:13:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel McDermon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McDermon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/01a805cd-b193-50e4-9a22-fd4b189c50c9', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/01a805cd-b193-50e4-9a22-fd4b189c50c9'}, {'abstract': 'Following criticism over its all-male board of directors, the social networking company has added the former chief executive of Pearson to the board.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/05/twitter-appoints-marjorie-scardino-as-first-female-board-member/', 'snippet': 'Following criticism over its all-male board of directors, the social networking company has added the former chief executive of Pearson to the board.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Twitter announced on Thursday that it had added the former publishing executive Marjorie M. Scardino to its eight-member board of directors — the first woman to serve in such a role at the high-profile social networking compan