tions Security Council voted to authorize African Union and French military forces to deploy to protect civilians.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reports From the Central African Republic’s ‘Darkest Days’', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seleka', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central African Republic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-05T18:01:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1267fbd9-2277-5d35-9c8b-22cc53c2944b', 'word_count': 820, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1267fbd9-2277-5d35-9c8b-22cc53c2944b'}, {'abstract': 'They can’t let go of Obamacare doom.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/05/on-the-right-it-will-always-be-october/', 'snippet': 'They can’t let go of Obamacare doom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For almost two months, the debacle of healthcare.gov allowed conservatives to live the life they always wanted. Health reform was a dismal failure; Obama would go down in history as a laughingstock; government can’t do anything; viva Ayn Rand!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On the Right, It Will Always Be October', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-05T18:14:58+0000', 'document_type': '