use, John A. Boehner of Ohio, to take up legislation on the issue.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Coalition of Evangelical Churches Seeks Prayers for Boehner on Immigration', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prayers and Prayer Books', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Evangelical Immigration Table', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-05T19:24:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1980523-7aff-5327-912a-a43cbcf25834', 'word_count': 318, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1980523-7aff-5327-912a-a43cbcf25834'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Mazzie will play the role of the diva Helen Sinclair in the stage adaptation of Woody Allen’s 1994 film.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/05/marin-mazzie-to-star-in-bullets-over-broadway/', 'snippet': 'Ms. Mazzie will play the role of the diva Helen Sinclair in the stage adaptation of Woody Allen’s 1994 film.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Go, gentle Scorpio, go — your Pisces wishes you every happy return,” cooed Helen Sinclair, the self-dramatizing diva who had all the best lines in Woody Allen’s 1994 period comedy “Bullets Over Broadway.” Dianne Wiest won a supporting actress Academy Award as the aging Helen, and the character is once again generating buzz as a musical adaptation of “Bullets” prepares to start performances on Broadway this spring. The front-runner for the role has been an open secret for months — “don’t speak!” as Helen would say — but the producers finally confirmed on Thursday that, indeed, three-time Tony Award nominee Marin Mazzie would star as Helen.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/arts/05artsbeat-bullets/05artsbeat-bullets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 806, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/05/arts/05artsbeat-bullets/05artsbeat-bullets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 806}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/arts/05artsbeat-bullets/05artsbeat-bullets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 763, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/arts/05artsbeat-bullets/05artsbeat-bullets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1288, 'width': 959, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/arts/05artsbeat-bullets/05artsbeat-bullets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/05/arts/05artsbeat-bullets/05artsbeat-bullets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/05/arts/05artsbeat-bullets/05artsbeat-bullets-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumb