aw student, lived briefly with his father’s half brother, contradicting their statement in 2011, after the uncle was charged with drunken driving.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/us/politics/obama-now-says-he-did-meet-his-uncle.html', 'snippet': 'White House officials said President Obama, as a law student, lived briefly with his father’s half brother, contradicting their statement in 2011, after the uncle was charged with drunken driving.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — White House officials on Thursday abruptly changed their story about whether President Obama had ever met his father’s half brother, a Boston man who faced deportation to Kenya after a drunken-driving arrest in 2011.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Reversal, White House Says Obama Did Meet Uncle', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Reversal, White House Says Obama Did Meet Uncle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Onyango', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drunken and Reckless Driving', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kenya', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-05T22:16:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d773f18c-14ee-513d-8b80-01824b016bcd', 'word_count': 504, 'uri': 'n