the world.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/05/mandela-lives/', 'snippet': 'There have been great freedom-fighters and dissidents, but few who made the transition to power as well as Nelson Mandela. He was a leader not just for South Africa, but for the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My favorite fact about Nelson Mandela is that he invited one of his white jailers, who had helped imprison him for 27 years, to his inauguration as South Africa’s president. It was a sign of the magnanimity, warmth and absolute lack of vindictiveness that marked Mandela.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mandela Lives', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-05T23:06:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kristof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kristof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a47dc44f-682e-5527-9dc2-e39877e21189', 'word_count': 605, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a47dc44f-682e-5527-9dc2-e39877e21189'}, {'abstract': 'Nelson Mandela, the leading emancipator of South Africa and its first black president, died on Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/01/01/world/africa/mandela-obit-photos.html', 'snippet': 'Nelson Mandela, the leading emancipator of South Africa and its first black president, died on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nelson Mandela, the leading emancipator of South Africa and its first black president, died on Thursday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/26/world/africa/20120726-MANDELA-slide-UC2D/20120726-MANDELA-sli