if you’re not in Miami Beach right now.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/05/the-insider-thea-westreich-on-what-not-to-miss-at-art-basel-in-miami-beach/', 'snippet': 'The art adviser shares her tips on essential booths to visit at the fair this weekend, which are well worth paying attention to even if you’re not in Miami Beach right now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If anyone should have a polished game plan for how to tackle the opening of an art fair, it’s an art adviser, whose entire professional livelihood is constructed around building collections for private clients. The wife-and-husband duo of Thea Westreich and Ethan Wagner have spent more than 30 years working, as Thea Westreich Art Advisory Services, on behalf of some of the world’s most intrepid collectors, often establishing markets of new and challenging genres, like living-room-unfriendly video art. They are also big collectors themselves, not only of art but also of books: the library in their SoHo loft has more than 13,000 volumes by and about artists.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Insider | Thea Westreich on What Not to Miss at Art Basel in Miami Beach', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art Basel Miami Beach', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-05T23:46:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kevin McGarry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kevin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGarry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/faa5741a-762a-5db7-a682-17afb36c9383', 'word_count': 526, 'uri': 'nyt://article/faa5741a-762a-5db7-a682-17afb36c9383'}, {'abstract': 'An annual tribute is the subject of the documentary “All the Way Through Evening.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/movies/mimi-stern-wolfe-in-all-the-way-through-evening.html', 'snippet': 'An annual tribute is the subject of the documentary “All the Way Through Evening.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Seeking a bittersweet rhyme between vocal performances and talking-head recollections, “All the Way Through Evening” is a very modest memorial to New York City musicians cut down by AIDS in the 1980s and early 1990s.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_ALLTHROUGHNIGHT_SPAN/ALLTHROUGHNIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_ALLTHROUGHNIGHT_SPAN/ALLTHROUGHNIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_ALLTHROUGHNIGHT_SPAN/ALLTHROUGHNIGHT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_ALLTHROUGHNIGHT_SPAN/ALLTHROUGHNIGHT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_ALLTHROUGHNIGHT_SPAN/06RDP_ALLTHROUGHNIGHT_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_ALLTHROUGHNIGHT_SPAN/06RDP_ALLTHROUGHNIGHT_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, 