 part medical science fiction and part puzzle film. Ethan’s fragmented self-narrative is linked to its traumatic cause, so solving the mystery at the center of the film is satisfying. This is not the case in some puzzle films (“Memento,” “Upstream Color”), in which an elaborate construction distracts from a standard crime or romance plot at the core.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 335, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 335}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 572, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1145, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN/06RDP_IMPLANT_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop