ing guarded celebration among immigrants’ advocates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/nyregion/city-increases-its-resistance-to-federal-entreaties-on-foreign-born-detainees.html', 'snippet': 'Laws passed by the City Council have sought to restrict prisoner transfer agreements with federal authorities, prompting guarded celebration among immigrants’ advocates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For years, New York City correction officials routinely provided federal immigration authorities with information about foreign-born detainees in their custody. The city, in response to federal requests, would transfer many of those detainees into federal custody, often leading to their deportation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York City Increases Its Resistance to Federal Entreaties on Foreign-Born Detainees', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'City Increases Its Resistance to Federal Entreaties on Foreign-Born Detainees', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Semple, Kirk', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration Detention', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deportation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'City Councils', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-06T02:38:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kirk Semple', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kirk', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Semple', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f58efe8c-1038-59e9-8909-0acf69653214', 'word_count': 6