t://interactive/10bad6cb-0310-5205-ad97-6044279380d6'}, {'abstract': 'Rufino Garcia’s truck is not just one of the few remnants of 5Pointz, New York graffiti’s most venerable institution, it is perhaps the most visible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/nyregion/at-a-whitewashed-queens-warehouse-an-unlikely-apostle-0f-graffiti-art.html', 'snippet': 'Rufino Garcia’s truck is not just one of the few remnants of 5Pointz, New York graffiti’s most venerable institution, it is perhaps the most visible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rufino Garcia hated graffiti. He hated it so much that, for years, he carried a bucket of white paint and a rolling brush in the cab of his delivery truck, to instantly cover the spray-painted signatures that seemed to sprout like weeds on the vehicle’s flanks overnight.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/nyregion/5pointz/5pointz-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/06/nyregion/5pointz/5pointz-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/nyregion/5pointz/5pointz-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/nyregion/5pointz/5pointz-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/nyregion/5pointz/5pointz-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumb