'abstract': 'With his legal status resolved and final ballots due Monday, many involved in the voting process say Jameis Winston is likely to become the second freshman to win the Heisman Trophy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/sports/football/voters-signal-a-probable-heisman-victory-for-florida-states-jameis-winston.html', 'snippet': 'With his legal status resolved and final ballots due Monday, many involved in the voting process say Jameis Winston is likely to become the second freshman to win the Heisman Trophy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Until three week ago, Jameis Winston appeared to be the perfect Heisman Trophy candidate. He was a quarterback with gaudy statistics, and his Florida State Seminoles were undefeated and contending for the national title. Better, he was only a redshirt freshman and, as a bonus, Winston boasted a catchy nickname, Famous Jameis.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-HEISMAN/CITY-JP-HEISMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 787, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-HEISMAN/CITY-JP-HEISMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 787}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-HEISMAN/CITY-JP-HEISMAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 781, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-HEISMAN/CITY-JP-HEISMAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1561, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CIT