s into the melancholy in many of the hits that Mr. Bacharach wrote with Hal David.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/theater/reviews/whats-it-all-about-at-new-york-theater-workshop.html', 'snippet': '“What’s It All About? Bacharach Reimagined,” a musical revue at New York Theater Workshop, digs into the melancholy in many of the hits that Mr. Bacharach wrote with Hal David.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What the world does not need now, many theatergoers would agree, is another jukebox musical manufactured to supply baby boomers with a sweet rush of synthetic nostalgia. “What’s It All About?” might almost be the plaintive cry of a visitor transported from the middle of the last century, wondering when recycled pop hits became the standard scores for Broadway shows. In fact, it’s the title of a new revue devoted to the music of Burt Bacharach that opened on Thursday night at New York Theater Workshop. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06BACHARACH_SPAN/06BACHARACH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06BACHARACH_SPAN/06BACHARACH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06BACHARACH_SPAN/06BACHARACH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/06BACHARACH_SPAN/06BACHARACH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/