ed in the negotiations said on Thursday night.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'City Agrees on Access to Taxis for Disabled', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'City Agrees On Access To Taxis For Disabled', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxicabs and Taxicab Drivers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disabilities', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AMERICANS WITH DISABILITIES ACT', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-06T04:44:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser and Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd590357-41e1-52cd-ace0-5d01c879fb43', 'word_count': 318, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd590357-41e1-52cd-ace0-5d01c879fb43'}, {'abstract': 'Sporting Kansas City and Real Salt Lake, which will meet in the championship game of Major League Soccer on Saturday, have a history of hard feelings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/sports/soccer/mls-final-is-only-the-latest-collision-between-kansas-city-and-salt-lake.html', 'snippet': 'Sporting Kansas City and Real Salt Lake, which will meet in the championship game of Major League Soccer on Saturday, have a history of hard feelings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KANSAS CITY, Mo. — Kei Kamara, a Sporting Kansas City striker, trotted upfield, his eyes locked on the high-flying ball headed in his direction. As it seemed to be sailing way over his head, Kamara peeked to his left. In an instant, he was lying twisted on the field, gasping for air.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'M.L.S. Final Is Only the Latest Collision Between Kansas City and Salt Lake', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'M.L.S. Final Is Only the Latest Collision Between Kansas City and Salt Lake', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sporting Kansas City (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Real Salt Lake (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-06T04:50:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Eligon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eligon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50c1b146-7422-5db8-a0b4-78917b478b61', 'word_count': 639, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50c1b146-7422-5db8-a0b4-78917b478b61'}, {'abstract': 'The arrival of winter brings enchanted, icy interiors and ethereal fashions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/t-magazine/wintery-solace.html', 'snippet': 'The arrival of winter brings enchanted, icy interiors and ethereal fashions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the advent of the snowy season, the mystical serenity of an ice-cloaked world is inspiring the creation of enchanted interiors and ethereal designs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wintery Solace', 'kicker': 'In the Air', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'na