t://article/9a87e11c-adb9-5ced-b4fa-ea7bc5217cb1'}, {'abstract': 'The Knicks may be less woeful than their New York rivals, but they have a long way to go to match the 1990s teams that were sometimes exasperating but always exhilarating.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/sports/basketball/longing-for-the-days-when-the-knicks-electrified-a-city.html', 'snippet': 'The Knicks may be less woeful than their New York rivals, but they have a long way to go to match the 1990s teams that were sometimes exasperating but always exhilarating.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Back when the Knicks were winning year after year — they made the playoffs for 14 straight seasons, like clockwork — it was easy to be a fan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-NETS-1/CITY-JP-NETS-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-NETS-1/CITY-JP-NETS-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-NETS-1/CITY-JP-NETS-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-NETS-1/CITY-JP-NETS-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-NETS-1/CITY-JP-NETS-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/06/sports/CITY-JP-NETS-1/CITY-JP-NETS-1