art house director, Jia Zhangke, may not be shown in Taiwan after failing to get released in mainland China.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/taiwan-may-miss-out-on-jia-zhangkes-a-touch-of-sin/', 'snippet': 'A controversial new work by China’s most famous art house director, Jia Zhangke, may not be shown in Taiwan after failing to get released in mainland China.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is still no sign that “A Touch of Sin,” a controversial new film by China’s most famous art house director, Jia Zhangke, will be shown in Chinese theaters anytime soon. But fans thinking of seeing the film in Taiwan might end up disappointed, too. It has yet to be approved for release there under a quota system that allows 10 mainland movies to be shown each year in the island’s theaters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Taiwan May Miss Out on Jia Zhangke’s ‘A Touch of Sin’', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cannes International Film Festival', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Festivals', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uighurs (Chinese Ethnic Group)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jia Zhang Ke', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kadeer, Rebiya', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zhao Liang', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Taipei (Taiwan)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'n