 hourly earnings among the labor force for private employers both grew last month, gains that could translate into increased consumer spending.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s some good news in this good-news jobs report: Earnings climbed last month. That means that while many more Americans are finding jobs, the ones that are already working got a boost, too.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Hours, More Earnings', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Hours and Earnings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Working Hours', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-06T15:27:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Annie Lowrey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Annie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lowrey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba137e9a-aade-512d-9827-8a8f3a729fea', 'word_count': 240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba137e9a-aade-512d-9827-8a8f3a729fea'}, {'abstract': 'Oscar Isaac, star of “Inside Llewyn Davis,” explains why he worried that he would be “the one guy to ruin the Coen brothers’ movie.”', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/30-takes-of-one-song-no-sweat-for-llewyns-star/', 'snippet': 'Oscar Isaac, star of “Inside Llewyn Davis,” explains why he worried that he would be “the one guy to ruin the Coen brothers’ movie.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 12:37 p.m. | Michael B. Jordan is not the only actor this season whose life changed thanks to one film. “On a practical level, as soon as Joel and Ethan cast me, the doors opened up for more parts,” said Oscar Isaac, the star of the Coen brothers’ “Inside Llewyn Davis,” which opens on Friday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/oscarisaac/oscarisaac-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/oscarisaac/oscarisaac-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/oscarisaac/oscarisaac-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/oscarisaac/oscarisaac-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/oscarisaac/oscarisaac-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/oscarisaac/oscarisaac-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/arts/oscarisaac/oscarisaac-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '30 Takes of One Song? No Sweat for ‘Llewyn’s’ Star', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'r