ily-gift-kaikado-canister/', 'snippet': 'Every day from now until Christmas, the editors of T are sharing their personal gift suggestions. Today’s pick: handmade goods from Japan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every day from now until Christmas, the editors of T are sharing their personal gift suggestions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Holiday | The Daily Gift: Kaikado Canister', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-06T16:30:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Li', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Li', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e429bf11-a5ac-5991-bee9-e9b738b6562e', 'word_count': 101, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e429bf11-a5ac-5991-bee9-e9b738b6562e'}, {'abstract': 'The billionaire collector and philanthropist shared some details about the art museum he is planning to open in Los Angeles next year.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/eli-broad-at-art-basel-in-miami-focuses-on-los-angeles/', 'snippet': 'The billionaire collector and philanthropist shared some details about the art museum he is planning to open in Los Angeles next year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The billionaire collector and philanthropist Eli Broad picked up an early John Baldessari work at the Dominique Lévy gallery on the first day of the giant Art Basel art fair in Miami. But over lunch at the Setai Hotel on Thursday afternoon, he was much more interested in talking about what may be his Baldessari’s newest home: the $140 million contemporary art museum that Mr. Broad and his wife, Edythe, are building on Grand Avenue in downtown Los Angeles. The architectural team of Elizabeth Diller and Ricardo Scofidio were on hand to show off the work in progress, which is scheduled for completion in the fall of 2014. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/07/arts/07BROAD1/07BROAD1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 496, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/07/arts/07BROAD1/07BROAD1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 496}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/07/arts/07BROAD1/07BROAD1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 847, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/07/arts/07BROAD1/07BROAD1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 992, 'width': 1199, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/07/arts/07BROAD1/07BROAD1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/07/arts/07BROAD1/07BROAD1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/07/arts/07BROAD1/07BROAD1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Eli Broad, at Art Basel in Miami, Focuses on Los Angeles', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art Basel Miami