'abstract': 'Greg Berlanti’s “Arrow” has found a formula for success and now he’s working another superhero show, about the Flash.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/08/arts/television/with-arrow-greg-berlanti-finds-a-formula-for-success.html', 'snippet': 'Greg Berlanti’s “Arrow” has found a formula for success and now he’s working another superhero show, about the Flash.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VANCOUVER, British Columbia — Greg Berlanti, watching from a distance, couldn’t stop smiling as he sidled up to members of his creative team on the set here of “Arrow” — his second-season CW network adaptation of the “Green Arrow” comic book character — gushing like the adolescent fanboy he used to be.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/arts/08BERLANTI2_SPAN/08BERLANTI2_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/08/arts/08BERLANTI2_SPAN/08BERLANTI2_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/arts/08BERLANTI2_SPAN/08BERLANTI2_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/arts/08BERLANTI2_SPAN/08BERLANTI2_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/arts/08BERLANTI2_SPAN/08BERLANTI2_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/08/ar