with-silence/', 'snippet': 'Moms Demand Action for Gun Sense has a new ad timed to the Newtown anniversary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The shock of the gun massacre of 20 schoolchildren and six adults last Dec. 14 in Newtown, Conn., has largely dissipated in Congress, which proved unresponsive to proposals for stronger gun safety. But the shock remains for a nationwide group of alarmed mothers organized after the carnage, who are taking to the air waves with the message that a ritual moment of silence to honor the victims on the anniversary\xa0is hardly enough. “With 26 more school shootings since that day, ask yourself: Is silence what America needs right now?” the new ad entreats as an intruder masked in black approaches a schoolhouse door.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'You Can’t Fight Guns With Silence', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Watts, Shannon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-06T18:12:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Francis X. Clines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Francis', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Clines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c7750d8-5235-58a4-8264-ab10715c8e41', 'word_count': 439, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c7750d8-5235-58a4-8264-ab10715c8e41'}, {'abstract': 'Book the ultimate experience, like following in your ancestors’ footsteps (literally) or dining at every top restaurant in the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/11/04/t-magazine/t-magazine-gift-guide-travel.html', 'snippet': '