06159'}, {'abstract': 'Our question: With a thought to not making the holiday too-too material, how do you hold down the gift-giving, particularly when the children are little?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/booming/materially-speaking-oh-christmas-tree.html', 'snippet': 'Our question: With a thought to not making the holiday too-too material, how do you hold down the gift-giving, particularly when the children are little?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Looking back on it, I blame the Christmas tree for any material excesses we might be guilty of. We are not that sort of people, I promise. We drive secondhand cars. Most of the front half of the house hasn’t been renovated in the 30 years we’ve lived here. We pay cash.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/booming/06parent-booming-gifts2/06parent-booming-gifts2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/06/booming/06parent-booming-gifts2/06parent-booming-gifts2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/booming/06parent-booming-gifts2/06parent-booming-gifts2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/booming/06parent-booming-gifts2/06parent-booming-gifts2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1632, 'width': 1224, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/06/booming/06parent-booming-gifts2/06parent-booming-gifts2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_na