f468e023a59'}, {'abstract': 'The Minsky Sisters are not related to the Minsky brothers or to Minsky anything, and they aren’t sisters. They are a theatrical figment on which floats an act.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/08/nyregion/a-tap-dancing-act-by-the-minsky-sisters.html', 'snippet': 'The Minsky Sisters are not related to the Minsky brothers or to Minsky anything, and they aren’t sisters. They are a theatrical figment on which floats an act.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Minsky Sisters went on after the appetizer, which was not a bad time. The music began: “Sugar Foot Stomp.” Then them: tap, tap, tappity-tap-tap. They did time steps, wings, paradiddles — spanking the floor.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/nyregion/08MINSKY_SPAN/08MINSKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/08/nyregion/08MINSKY_SPAN/08MINSKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/nyregion/08MINSKY_SPAN/08MINSKY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/nyregion/08MINSKY_SPAN/08MINSKY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/nyregion/08MINSKY_SPAN/08MINSKY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/08/nyregion/08MINSKY_SPAN/08MINSKY_SPAN-thumbS