s, who had vanished from the ancient Aramaic-speaking town of Maaloula, said they had left with rebels to escape shelling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/07/world/middleeast/nuns-missing-in-syria.html', 'snippet': 'The nuns, who had vanished from the ancient Aramaic-speaking town of Maaloula, said they had left with rebels to escape shelling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — A group of nuns who vanished recently from the ancient Aramaic-speaking Syrian town of Maaloula resurfaced on Friday in a video, saying that they had left with rebels to escape shelling in the area and were safe inside a villa in a nearby rebel-held town.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nuns, Missing in Syria, Resurface in Video', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nuns, Missing in Syria, Resurface in Video', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Free Syrian Army', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuns', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-06T20:25:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Barnard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ade700bc-a90c-5850-acb5-1dfb3f671ad4', 'word_count': 796, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ade700bc-a90c-5850-acb5-1dfb3f671ad4'}, {'abstract': 'Six years after retiring, the ballerina Alessandra Ferri is back onstage dancing in Martha Clarke’s production of “Chéri.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/08/arts/music/alessan