count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/02ccfcbe-bd06-5822-a12d-94aab6923933'}, {'abstract': 'The curator at the just-opened Pérez Art Museum Miami (and a native Miamian) offers her tips on navigating the town during fair week.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/06/the-insider-katerina-llanes-of-the-prez-art-museum-miami-on-how-to-navigate-basel/', 'snippet': 'The curator at the just-opened Pérez Art Museum Miami (and a native Miamian) offers her tips on navigating the town during fair week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A not-for-tourists guide to Art Basel in Miami Beach might sound like an oxymoron. But it’s never a bad idea to ask a local for her advice on where to sniff out the best in art and fun. Katerina Llanes is a native Miamian who just moved back to the Magic City after a stint in Los Angeles, where she was a curator for MOCAtv. Her new post is Time-Based Arts Coordinator at the just-opened Perez Art Museum Miami (PAMM), which has been playing host to the hordes all week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Insider | Katerina Llanes of the Pérez Art Museum Miami on How to Navigate Basel', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art Basel Miami Beach', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Miami Beach (Fla)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-06T23:18:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kevin McGarry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kevin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGarry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0062e408-1a2c-50c3-982c-a418bcf15bf3', 'word_count': 328, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0062e408