nnual basis, $450,000.\xa0 ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Former Ohio State President Returns to West Virginia', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Education', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Former Ohio State President Returns to West Virginia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gee, E Gordon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'West Virginia University', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ohio State University', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-07T04:40:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tamar Lewin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tamar', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lewin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ca81798-042f-5b82-89ab-79714379ae11', 'word_count': 92, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ca81798-042f-5b82-89ab-79714379ae11'}, {'abstract': 'A blaze that killed seven at a garment factory, and the subsequent outrage, exposed a complicated, and at times tense, cohabitation of Italian residents and Chinese migrants.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/08/world/europe/deadly-factory-fire-bares-racial-tensions-in-italy.html', 'snippet': 'A blaze that killed seven at a garment factory, and the subsequent outrage, exposed a complicated, and at times tense, cohabitation of Italian residents and Chinese migrants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PRATO, Italy — Dozens of bouquets block the entrance to the Teresa Moda outlet and factory where seven Chinese workers died last Sunday in a fire that swept through the establishment where they worked and lived. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'p