will be played at Michigan Stadium on Jan. 1. Yankee Stadium will host two Rangers games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The N.H.L.’s new custom-made Ice Truck will arrive Thursday in Ann Arbor to begin the official takeover of Michigan Stadium for the Jan. 1 Winter Classic. The Detroit Red Wings and the Toronto Maple Leafs are expected to play that game before 105,000 fans, the largest crowd at a hockey game.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/sports/hockey/08slapshot/08slapshot-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/08/sports/hockey/08slapshot/08slapshot-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/sports/hockey/08slapshot/08slapshot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/sports/hockey/08slapshot/08slapshot-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1392, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/sports/hockey/08slapshot/08slapshot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/08/sports/hockey/08slapshot/08slapshot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/sports/hockey/08slapshot/08slapshot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'c