web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/08/us/a-holiday-gift-guide-to-a-library-of-books-with-local-connections.html', 'snippet': 'This year’s Texas-related books include the biography of a football star (Bulldog Turner), a study of a filmmaker (Wes Anderson) and an Austin bartender’s cocktail guide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As any book-loving Texan can tell you, the volumes most often given during the holiday season fall largely into three familiar categories: kitsch like “Stupid Texas: Idiots in the Lone Star State” (2010), coffee-table books featuring wildflowers or West Texas vistas, and the latest takes on the Kennedy assassination. But if you’re aiming for something a little more original, here is a selection of recently published Texas-flavored books to satisfy even the most idiosyncratic personality on your shopping list. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '33B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/us/Culture/Culture-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/08/us/Culture/Culture-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 864}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/us/Culture/Culture-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 711, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/us/Culture/Culture-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1422, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/08/us/Culture/Culture-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'th