an also helped distance him from the United States, with which he has had sharp disagreements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Amid highly public tensions with the United States over a long-term security deal, Afghanistan’s president looked to forge closer ties with neighboring Iran, agreeing in principle to start negotiating an economic and security “pact of friendship,” Afghan officials said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Afghan Leader Agrees to Talks on Closer Iran Ties', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Karzai, Hamid', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rouhani, Hassan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-09T00:42:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alissa J. Rubin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alissa', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Rubin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5075efaa-1d93-5afc-a191-ccad983de74a', 'word_count': 663, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5075efaa-1d93-5afc-a191-ccad983de74a'}, {'abstract': 'Mark K. Levitan, Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg’s director of poverty research, changed the way the city counts its needy, bringing millions out of the statistical shadows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/09/nyregion/with-new-formula-an-official-helped-unmask-the-face-of-poverty-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Mark K. Levitan, Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg’s director of poverty research, changed the way the city counts its needy, bringing millions out of the statistical shadows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over and over again, Mayor-elect Bill de Blasio has hammered it home: Forty-six percent of New Yorkers are poor or nearly poor. It is his mantra, the figure he holds up as proof that Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg has failed nearly half of his citizens.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/09/nyregion/WORKING/WORKING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/09/nyregion/WORKING/WORKING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/09/nyregion/WORKING/WORKING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/09/nyregion/WORKING/WORKING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1355, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/09/nyregion/WORKING/WORKING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/09/nyregion/WORKING/WORKING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/09/nyregion/WORKING/WORKING-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': 