-8a54e137f222'}, {'abstract': 'The new cable channel El Rey Network selects agencies, and WPP is merging two tech units, 24/7 Media and Xaxis, for a unified programmatic advertising platform.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/09/business/media/accounts-and-people-of-note-in-the-advertising-industry.html', 'snippet': 'The new cable channel El Rey Network selects agencies, and WPP is merging two tech units, 24/7 Media and Xaxis, for a unified programmatic advertising platform.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Adelman, executive director of Mindshare New York, part of the Mindshare division of GroupM, was named Chicago office lead. He succeeds Mary Carpenter, who takes a new role, overseeing a new performance marketing practice for Mindshare in North America. GroupM is owned by WPP.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Accounts and People of Note in the Advertising Industry', 'kicker': 'Webdenda', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Relations and Publicity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-09T18:22:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6dc25ce-4a1b-53f6-b756-d6e275f6fb5a', 'word_count': 777, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6dc25ce-4a1b-53f6-b756-d6e275f6fb5a'}, {'abstract': 'On the 50th anniversary of a groundbreaking marriage, another initiative to help artists use technology as a tool.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/09/art-and-technology-together-again-at-los-angeles-county-museum-of-art/', 'snippet': 'On the 50th anniversary of a groundbreaking marriage, another initiative to help artists use technology as a tool.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 1966, Maurice Tuchman, a curator at the Los Angeles County Museum of Art, looked around at the technological fields blossoming in his city and at the growing number of artists interested in technology and decided to help put the two worlds together. The program he created, Art and Technology, was a brief but highly influential experiment in cross-pollination, placing artists like Robert Irwin and James Turrell, for example, at the Garrett Corporation, an aerospace company, to conduct research into perception.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Art and Technology, Together Again, at Los Angeles County Museum of Art', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Govan, Michael', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles County Museum of Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-09T18:32:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randy Kennedy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kennedy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1ffcad4-2e48-53fd-812f-b7378cd5f22b', 'word_count': 303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1ffcad4-2e48-53fd-812f-b7378cd5f22b'}, {'abstract': 'When are disclaimers and warning labels adequate?', 'web_url