ager to hear about his group’s conservation work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’VE been fortunate when it comes to travel. I’ve seen so much of the world and have met many interesting people. But like all frequent travelers, I have had my share of strange encounters. I once had a seatmate who would remove a small wad of tissue paper from his mouth, fastidiously wipe his fingernails, and then pop the tissue back into his mouth. He did it for the flight’s duration, and it was really quite unnerving.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/business/Flier/Flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/10/business/Flier/Flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/business/Flier/Flier-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/business/Flier/Flier-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1310, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/business/Flier/Flier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/10/business/Flier/Flier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/business/Flier/Flier-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Enjoys Fellow Travelers, Even if They Have Flippers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Enjoys Fellow Travelers, Even if They Have Flippers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Travel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Animal Abuse, Rights and Welfare', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Born Free Foundation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-09T21:12:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Will Travers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Will', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Travers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c41aca7-af4f-53da-a7e0-06b7458227bd', 'word_count': 581, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c41aca7-af4f-53da-a7e0-06b7458227bd'}, {'abstract': 'Noche Flamenca and its star, Soledad Barrio, are exploring the fiery, expressive nature of flamenco dancing at the Joyce Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/10/arts/dance/soledad-barrio-noche-flamenca-at-the-joyce-theater.html', 'snippet': 'Noche Flamenca and its star, Soledad Barrio, are exploring the fiery, expressive nature of flamenco dancing at the Joyce Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The program that Noche Flamenca is presenting at the Joyce Theater through Sunday is nearly the same as the one this exemplary flamenco troupe presented at the Cherry Lane Theater in 2010. The Joyce, where the company has performed since 2011, is less intimate than the Cherry Lane but holds more than twice as many seats. That size allows more people to experience a solo by the company’s star, Soledad Barrio. And encountering Ms. Barrio is an expe