e mysterious apartment of a mysterious man.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/10/arts/design/elmgreen-dragsets-tomorrow-at-victoria-albert-museum.html', 'snippet': 'The artistic team Elmgreen & Dragset’s current installation at the Victoria & Albert Museum in London takes visitors into the mysterious apartment of a mysterious man.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — For a while, you forget that you are deep inside the galleries of the Victoria & Albert Museum. There’s the unmade bed with fancy sheets and the sound of running water from behind a closed door. A cigar sits in a custom-made ashtray. Books by Ruskin and Foucault line an aesthete’s shelves. The scene, you soon learn, is part of the latest installation by the cross-disciplinary artists Michael Elmgreen and Ingar Dragset.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/arts/DUO/DUO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/10/arts/DUO/DUO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/arts/DUO/DUO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/arts/DUO/DUO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1328, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/arts/DUO/DUO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/10/arts/DUO/DUO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidt