ntation at a tiny camp of Ukrainian protesters was an example of the seesaw struggle with the police for control of strategic areas in Kiev.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/10/world/europe/ukrainian-protesters-struggle-to-keep-police-and-cold-at-bay.html', 'snippet': 'A confrontation at a tiny camp of Ukrainian protesters was an example of the seesaw struggle with the police for control of strategic areas in Kiev.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIEV, Ukraine — Aleksandr Kvashenko looked up from making sandwiches in his tent encampment to realize that he had suddenly been encircled by hundreds of riot police officers. The camp’s usual contingent of burly men had sallied out to a nearby street as security forces began confronting protesters. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/world/10ukrainescene/10ukrainescene-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/10/world/10ukrainescene/10ukrainescene-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/world/10ukrainescene/10ukrainescene-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/world/10ukrainescene/10ukrainescene-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/world/10ukrainescene/10ukrainescene-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/10/world/10ukraines