imes.com/2013/12/10/us/politics/more-dysfunction-in-washington-blame-geography.html', 'snippet': 'A deal on the budget may be harder for President Obama than it was for his predecessors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'House and Senate negotiators are nearing a modest budget deal to break the cycle of periodic fiscal crises that both parties say have hampered the economy. But for President Obama, the “grand bargain” remains elusive. That wasn’t always the case for Democratic presidents. In fact, some found it much easier to cut deals with Republican legislators.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Dysfunction in Washington? Blame Geography.', 'kicker': 'Video', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidents and Presidency (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-10T16:35:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Tanenhaus', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tanenhaus', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1628e362-b175-5ca5-b40b-edd8816f6767', 'word_count': 239, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1628e362-b175-5ca5-b40b-edd8816f6767'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Lavin will play an actress who goes to pieces in Mr. Silver’s latest work, “Too Much Sun,” at the Vineyard Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/10/linda-lavin-to-star-in-new-nicky-silver-play/', 'snippet': 'Ms. Lavin will play an actress who goes to pieces in Mr. Silver’s latest work, “Too Much Sun,” at the Vineyard Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The team responsible for “The Lyons” — the playwright Nicky Silver, the actress Linda Lavin and the director Mark Brokaw — will reconvene this spring at the Vineyard Theater, where “The Lyons” ran before moving to Broadway in 2012, for Mr. Silver’s latest work, “Too Much Sun.” Previews begin on May 1; the play opens on May 20.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/theater/10lavin/10lavin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/10/theater/10lavin/10lavin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 728}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/theater/10lavin/10lavin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 845, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/theater/10lavin/10lavin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1355, 'width': 1117, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/theater/10lavin/10lavin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/10/theater/10lavin/10lavin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/theater/10lavin/10lavin-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Linda Lavin to Star in New Nicky Silver Play', 'kicker': 'ArtsB