l screenplay.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/10/tough-competition-for-original-scripts-and-cover-songs/', 'snippet': 'There are nearly two dozen contenders for best original screenplay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The conventional wisdom in Hollywood is that the only films to find surefire success at the box office are remakes and sequels, and this year has seen precious few exceptions. Buzzfeed helpfully ranks the top 15 original films, starting with the Oscar contender “Gravity” — the only original story in the Top 10 grosses of the year — and ending with another Oscar hopeful, “Prisoners” (the 50th-highest grosser).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tough Competition for Original Scripts (and Cover Songs)', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Isaac, Oscar', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-10T19:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/467a774b-8ade-5d98-85e8-8bba8a77bea9', 'word_count': 245, 'uri': 'nyt://article/467a774b-8ade-5d98-85e8-8bba8a77bea9'}, {'abstract': 'In this lesson students and teachers can follow the evolution of Nelson Mandela in archival articles from The New York Times, from his early years as a jailed dissident in apartheid South Africa to his death last week at the age of 95.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/10/from-rebel-to-statesman-teaching-about-the-life-of-nelson-mandela/', 'snippet': 'In this lesson students and teachers can follow the evolution of Nelson Mandela in archival articles from The New York Times, from his early years as a jailed dissident in apartheid South Africa to his death last week at the age of 95.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What makes a leader great, and when exactly does the transformation take place? In this lesson students and teachers can follow the evolution of Nelson Mandela in archival articles from The New York Times, from his early years as a jailed dissident in apartheid South Africa to his death last week at the age of 95. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Rebel to Statesman: Teaching About the Life of Nelson Mandela', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-10T19:06:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Marshall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Marshall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/08fe0373-5495-55f7-82c2-a0f4c9d96822', 'word_count': 2261, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08fe0373-5495-55f7-82c2-a0f4c9d96822'}, {'abstract': 'The addition of the free agent Curtis Granderson does not hide the question marks the team faces. “I think we’re still building,” said Jeff Wilpon, the team’s chief operating officer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/sports/baseball/wilpon-says-mets-have-a-long-way-to-go.html', 'snippet': 'The addition of the free agent Curtis Granderson does not hide the question marks the team faces. “I think we’re still building,” said Jeff Wilpon, the team’s chief operating officer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAKE BUENA VISTA, Fla. — It was supposed to be a triumphant moment for the Mets, Curtis Granderson onstage smiling for photographs, holding his new, pinstriped No. 3 jersey, flanked by Jeff Wilpon and Sandy Alderson. Granderson was the biggest free-agent signing of Alderson’s tenure as the general manager. He was the newest face of the franchise, the cleanup hitter to team with David Wright.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wilpon Says Mets Have ‘a Long Way to Go’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jeff Wilpon Says Mets Have ‘a Long Way to Go’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Granderson, Curtis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-10T19:14:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Rohan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/54150c4d-32ff-5890-9c46-5b486858f115', 'word_count': 581, 'uri': 'nyt://article/54150c4d-32ff-5890-9c46-5b486858f115'}, {'abstract': 'A roundup of surveillance-related articles from all over.', 'web_url': 'https://publiceditor.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/10/snowden-for-person-of-the-year-and-coverage-of-a-story-that-just-wont-quit/', 'snippet': 'A roundup of surveillance-related articles from all over.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some stories have legs: They just keep coming; they don’t fade away.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Snowden for Person of the Year, and Coverage of a Story That Just Won’t Quit', 'kicker': 'The Public Editor&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens