h Revenue Growth Is Slowing, States See More Budget Stability, Report Finds', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Though Revenue Growth Is Slowing, States See More Budget Stability, Report Finds', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lyman, Rick', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Assn of State Budget Officers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rockefeller, Nelson A, Institute of Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-10T19:27:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Lyman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lyman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aba170b2-7e08-54f9-aa87-7a00a0236d90', 'word_count': 815, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aba170b2-7e08-54f9-aa87-7a00a0236d90'}, {'abstract': 'In a rare gathering, scores of leaders from around the world came together to pay tribute to Nelson Mandela at a national memorial service.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/africa/100000002594945/world-leaders-mourn-nelson-mandela.html', 'snippet': 'In a rare gathering, scores of leaders from around the world came together to pay tribute to Nelson Mandela at a national memorial service.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a rare gathering, scores of leaders from around the world came together to pay tribute to Nelson Mandela at a national memorial service.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',