rth. It is presented as a massive print book with QR codes.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/10/interview-with-kevin-kelly-author-of-cool-tools/', 'snippet': 'Kevin Kelly’s latest book, “Cool Tools,” is intended to be a compendium of the greatest tools on earth. It is presented as a massive print book with QR codes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kevin Kelly is the former editor of Wired magazine and author of several books, including “What Technology Wants,” which explores the similarities of technology and organisms. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/technology/bits-cooltools2/bits-cooltools2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/technology/bits-cooltools2/bits-cooltools2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/technology/bits-cooltools2/bits-cooltools2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/10/technology/bits-cooltools2/bits-cooltools2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/10/technology/bits-cooltools2/bits-cooltools2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Interview With Kevin Kelly, Author of ‘Cool Tools’', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subjec