, {'abstract': 'Mr. Waldon, one of the few Warhol Superstars who had acting experience, starred in “Lonesome Cowboys” and “Blue Movie.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/movies/louis-waldon-actor-in-warhol-films-dies-at-78.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Waldon, one of the few Warhol Superstars who had acting experience, starred in “Lonesome Cowboys” and “Blue Movie.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Louis Waldon, an actor who appeared in several Andy Warhol films including “Lonesome Cowboys” and “Blue Movie,” which the authorities seized for obscenity shortly after it was released, died on Friday in Los Angeles. He was 78. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/WALDON-obit/WALDON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/WALDON-obit/WALDON-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 833}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/WALDON-obit/WALDON-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/WALDON-obit/WALDON-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1475, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/WALDON-obit/WALDON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/WALDON-obit/WALDON-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'cap