002, I told him that it was nothing personal but I would soon be suing him, just as I had sued several Los Angeles police chiefs before him. That was my job as a civil rights lawyer, and at that time, we had a rogue police force that refused civilian control, rejected court orders, abused people of color and acted with terrifying impunity.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/opinion/1211OPEDstafford/1211OPEDstafford-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 488, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/11/opinion/1211OPEDstafford/1211OPEDstafford-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 488}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/opinion/1211OPEDstafford/1211OPEDstafford-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/opinion/1211OPEDstafford/1211OPEDstafford-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1341, 'width': 1648, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/opinion/1211OPEDstafford/1211OPEDstafford-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/11/opinion/1211OPEDstafford/1211OPEDstafford-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/opinion/1211OPEDstafford/1211OPEDstafford-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hail to the Police Chief', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hail to the Police Chief', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bratton, William J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rice, Connie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Minorities', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-11T01:27:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Connie Rice', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Connie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rice', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/161f5fd9-c529-5618-9ddc-fc1be0f9ed07', 'word_count': 933, 'uri': 'nyt://article/161f5fd9-c529-5618-9ddc-fc1be0f9ed07'}, {'abstract': 'Too many girls and minorities are being held back from success in science, technology and engineering fields.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/opinion/too-few-girls-and-minorities-study-tech-subjects.html', 'snippet': 'Too many girls and minorities are being held back from success in science, technology and engineering fields.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A big reason America is falling behind other countries in science and math is that we have effectively written off a huge chunk of our population as uninterested in those fields or incapable of su