gher rate because Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg has asked the City Council to reinstate the measure.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/nyregion/expiration-of-hotel-room-tax-rate-in-new-york-city-causes-confusion.html', 'snippet': 'Though the law that raised the tax rate expired on Nov. 30, many hotels are still collecting the higher rate because Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg has asked the City Council to reinstate the measure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City can be an expensive place for out-of-towners seeking a bed for the night. But those visitors have unknowingly paid thousands of dollars more in hotel taxes than they should have because of confusion caused by City Hall.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Expiration of Hotel Room-Tax Rate in New York City Causes Confusion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Expiration Of Tax Rate Leads Hotels To Overcharge', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGeehan, Patrick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sales and Excise Taxes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City Council (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brewer, Gale A', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-11T02:14:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 