ue': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-11T02:14:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheryl Gay Stolberg and Allison Kopicki', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheryl', 'middlename': 'Gay', 'lastname': 'Stolberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Allison', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kopicki', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d331a92c-330e-5e54-9ea2-7916ef063d0a', 'word_count': 870, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d331a92c-330e-5e54-9ea2-7916ef063d0a'}, {'abstract': 'Since 2008, Manhattan Beach, just east of Brighton Beach, has had two civic groups, mostly notable for their feuding over issues like zoning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/nyregion/brooklyn-beach-community-changes-and-angrily-divides.html', 'snippet': 'Since 2008, Manhattan Beach, just east of Brighton Beach, has had two civic groups, mostly notable for their feuding over issues like zoning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Living on the same mansion-lined streets, they have denounced each other by email and by insinuation. Meeting in the same elementary school auditorium, they have clashed over barbecue grills and traffic lights. Sharing a private safety patrol, they have come to blows.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/nyregion/BEACH/BEACH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/11/nyregion/BEACH/BEACH-articleLarge.jpg', 