57th Street without drawing the attention of the store’s staff, the police said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/nyregion/40000-crocodile-jacket-is-stolen-from-zilli-in-manhattan.html', 'snippet': 'A man and a woman stole the jacket from Zilli on East 57th Street without drawing the attention of the store’s staff, the police said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At a men’s clothing store called Zilli on East 57th Street, the holiday shopper with exotic tastes and a spare $50,000 will find Astrakhan fur coats and jackets made of python — with interchangeable collars of beaver, ermine or mink. But, while you will find deerskin vests and a black chinchilla bedspread at Zilli this week, missing from the racks is a certain jacket of brown Australian crocodile. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/nyregion/JACKET/JACKET-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 319, 'width': 479, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/nyregion/JACKET/JACKET-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 319, 'width': 479, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/nyregion/JACKET/JACKET-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/11/nyregion/JACKET/JACKET-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/nyregion/JACKET/JACKET-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '$40,000 Crocodile Jacket Is Stolen From Men’s Store i