ractive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/876f9437-0923-591f-a453-99d8607e5a7c', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/876f9437-0923-591f-a453-99d8607e5a7c'}, {'abstract': 'Coach Mike Woodson assembled a new starting five, his eighth of the season, but the Knicks’ loss featured the same problems: poor defense, poor shooting and poor decisions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/sports/basketball/knicks-shake-up-fails-to-rattle-irving.html', 'snippet': 'Coach Mike Woodson assembled a new starting five, his eighth of the season, but the Knicks’ loss featured the same problems: poor defense, poor shooting and poor decisions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CLEVELAND — The Knicks lost any sense of stability long ago. Cracks formed when Tyson Chandler broke his right leg during the team’s fourth game of the season, and the season has been a patchwork quilt ever since — a ragged, ripping-at-the-seams patchwork quilt.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/11/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 700, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1401, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/11/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/sports/KNICKS/KNICKS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Knicks Talk Good Game but Don’t Play It', 'kicker': 'Cavaliers 109, Knicks 94', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Knicks Talk Good Game but Don’t Play It', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Cavaliers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woodson, Mike', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ANTHONY, CARMELO', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-11T03:38:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Cacciola', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cacciola', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c1f569b-f91d-521a-8ee8-b54b723f24b8', 'word_count': 859, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c1f569b-f91d-521a-8ee8-b54b723f24b8'}, {'abstract': 'The ascent of Matteo Renzi, the charismatic young mayor of Florence, has jolted the Italian political landscape.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/world/europe/rise-of-young-leaders-signals-a-mandate-for-political-change-in-italy.html', 'snippet': 'The ascent of Matteo Renzi, the charismatic young mayor of Florence, has jolted the Italian political landscape.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — For all its melodrama and theatrics, Italian politics is often defined by what does not happen. The Italian Parliament has been deadlocked on major changes for years, unable or unwilling to enact bills to overhaul the political system or unshackle the economy, which has barely grown in two decades.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rise of Young Leaders Signals a Mandate for Political Change in Italy', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rise of Young Leaders Signals a Mandate for Political Change in Italy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Renzi, Matteo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grillo, Beppe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Five Star Movement (Italy)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party (Italy)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-11T03:44:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Yardley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yardley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b1127d3-24a8-5063-bd75-c77b2f192e65', 'word_count': 867, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b1127d3-24a8-5063-bd75-c77b2f192e65'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Hall was distinguished by his simplicity of style and a warm, lush sound.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/arts/music/jim-hall-jazz-guitarist-dies-at-83.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Hall was distinguished by his simplicity of style and a warm, lush sound.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jim Hall, a jazz guitarist who for more than 50 years was admired by critics, aficionados and especially his fellow musicians for his impeccable technique and the warmth and subtlety of his playing, died on Tuesday at his home in Greenwich Village. He was 83.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/HALL-obit/HALL-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/HALL-obit/HALL-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/HALL-obit/HALL-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/HALL-obit/HALL-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/HALL-obit/HALL-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/HALL-obit/HALL-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/arts/HALL-obit/HALL-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jim Hall, Master Jazz Guitarist Who Played With the Greats, Dies at 83', 'kicker': None, 'cont