shield law in the case of the James E. Holmes, who is accused of killing 12 people in an Aurora, Colo., movie theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/business/media/new-york-court-wont-order-fox-reporter-to-testify-shoring-up-state-shield-law.html', 'snippet': 'New York’s Court of Appeals buttressed the state’s shield law in the case of the James E. Holmes, who is accused of killing 12 people in an Aurora, Colo., movie theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A New York State shield law protecting journalists was bolstered Tuesday when the state’s highest court refused to require a Fox News reporter to return to Colorado to testify in the case of James E. Holmes, the man accused of shooting 12 people in July 2012 in a movie theater in Aurora, Colo.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/business/WINTER/WINTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/11/business/WINTER/WINTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/business/WINTER/WINTER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/business/WINTER/WINTER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/11/business/WINTER/WINTER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/11/business/WINTER/WINTER-thumbS