nd Soros Fund executive and a co-founder of the Promontory Financial Group, will join the board as an independent director.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Citigroup announced on Wednesday that Duncan P. Hennes, a longtime financial executive, would join its board. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Citigroup Names New Board Member', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': "Citi's Board", 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citigroup Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-11T15:04:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dealbook', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dealbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db514ec6-1442-55bd-b8ce-d867785be9f4', 'word_count': 199, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db514ec6-1442-55bd-b8ce-d867785be9f4'}, {'abstract': 'Expressing outrage, South Africa’s deaf-advocacy group said the man responsible for providing interpretation at the memorial on Tuesday was a fake.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/world/africa/interpreter-at-mandela-service-said-to-be-an-imposter.html', 'snippet': 'Expressing outrage, South Africa’s deaf-advocacy group said the man responsible for providing interpretation at the memorial on Tuesday was a fake.', 'lead_paragraph': 'QUNU, South Africa — He stood with a deadpan expression just inches from President Obama and other world leaders speaking at Nelson Mandela’s memorial, dressed in a dark suit, with a blue security lanyard bearing the words “state funeral” draped around his neck, flapping his arms and gesticulating in what was supposed to be sign language for the deaf.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/interpreter/interpreter-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 299, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/12/world/interpreter/interpreter-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 299}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/interpreter/interpreter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 510, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/interpreter/interpreter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1019, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/interpreter/interpreter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/12/world/interpreter/interpreter-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/interpreter/interpreter-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Interpreter at Memorial Service Said to Have Been an Impostor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Interpreter at Memorial Service Said to Have Been an Impostor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mandela, Nelson', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value':