, 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/11/two-hirst-dot-works-are-stolen-in-london/', 'snippet': 'The police said that two prints signed by Damien Hirst had been stolen from a London art gallery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Two signed prints by Damien Hirst were stolen early Monday from a west London art gallery, the police said Wednesday. The two prints, part of Mr. Hirst’s series of multicolored dot artworks, were estimated by the manager of the Exhibitionist Gallery to be worth about $54,000. The larger of the two, Pyronin Y, measures 40 inches by 46 inches and was produced in 2005; the smaller one, Oleoylsarcosine, is 26 inches by 35 inches and dates from 2008.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Hirst Dot Works Are Stolen in London', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hirst, Damien', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-11T18:15:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Erlanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8506821-89bd-5e19-95ce-ca04aff10482', 'word_count': 211, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8506821-89bd-5e19-95ce-ca04aff10482'}, {'abstract': 'Guillaume Henry’s revival of the venerable house of Carven has given the label a youthful new look; now in SoHo. One-of-a-kind ear cuffs; new e-commerce; and more shopping news.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/fashion/Carven-Opens-a-Store-in-Soho-One-of-a-Kind-Ear-Cuffs-New-From-E-Commerce-and-More-Shopping-News.html', 'snippet': 'Guillaume Henry’s revival of the venerable house of Carven has given the label a youthful new look; now in SoHo. One-of-a-kind ear cuffs; new e-commerce; and more shopping news.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the short four and a half years since Guillaume Henry set out to revive the venerable house of Carven, he has given the label a youthful new look, with the kind of flirty and flattering designs a cool young French girl would want to wear. There are 16 stores worldwide, including, now, its first in the United States, just opened in SoHo. For the new store, which was designed in collaboration with the architect Eric Chevalier, Mr. Henry (above right) was after something familiar and approachable, like a train station, perhaps, or an old theater. Along the wall as you enter the shop, there’s a long black leather bench made for Carven by the design house Domeau & Pérès. The plywood flooring is dyed red, and overhead, a captivating light installation gives the space a cheerful ambience.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/fashion/12BROWSESTORE_SPAN/12zBROWSE1A-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/12/fashion/12BROWSESTORE_SPAN/12zBROWSE1A-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/fashion/12BROWSESTORE_SPAN/12zBROWSE1A-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/fashion/12BROWSESTORE_SPAN/12zBROWSE1A-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy