, 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c2846df2-a58f-52fd-9028-451dd9d6d640', 'word_count': 310, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c2846df2-a58f-52fd-9028-451dd9d6d640'}, {'abstract': 'Kathleen Edwards, Beth Orton, Nick Lowe, Glen Hansard and Amos Lee were among the artists joining Calexico at the Beacon Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/arts/music/iron-and-wine-calexico-and-others-at-wfuvs-holiday-cheer.html', 'snippet': 'Kathleen Edwards, Beth Orton, Nick Lowe, Glen Hansard and Amos Lee were among the artists joining Calexico at the Beacon Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2005, the songwriter Sam Beam, who records as Iron and Wine, and the Tucson band Calexico released an EP they recorded together, “In the Reins,” giving Mr. Beam’s songs some of Calexico’s Southwestern, country-mariachi flavor. Christmastime brings family reunions, and for its annual Holiday Cheer benefit concert, on Tuesday night at the Beacon Theater, the Americana-loving public radio station WFUV (90.7 FM) brought Iron and Wine and Calexico back together, adding other sometime collaborators and kindred spirits: Kathleen Edwards, Beth Orton, Nick Lowe, Glen Hansard and Amos Lee. Calexico backed them all, jovial and versatile.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Serving Up Folky Americana With Holiday Toppings', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Serving Up Folky Americana With Holiday Toppings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WFUV', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Calexico (Music Group)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-11T22:38:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name':