 new team to sign an accord with the Bloomberg administration that would involve tax breaks, public land and public financing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The owners of New York’s new professional soccer team and the Bloomberg administration are nearing a tentative agreement to build the city’s first soccer-only venue: a $350 million, 28,000-seat stadium near Yankee Stadium in the Bronx.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/nyregion/12stadium-map/12stadium-map-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 286, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/nyregion/12stadium-map/12stadium-map-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 286, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/nyregion/12stadium-map/12stadium-map-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/12/nyregion/12stadium-map/12stadium-map-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/nyregion/12stadium-map/12stadium-map-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Deal for Bronx Soccer Stadium in Works as Clock Ticks', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Soccer Team and City May Sign Stadium Deal Before de Blasio Takes Office', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value'