’s ties to Bernard L. Madoff. Some of the emails surfaced in a lawsuit filed by the trustee for Mr. Madoff’s victims.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/12/12/business/dealbook/12bank-documents.html', 'snippet': 'A series of internal JPMorgan emails suggesting that employees had concerns about the bank’s ties to Bernard L. Madoff. Some of the emails surfaced in a lawsuit filed by the trustee for Mr. Madoff’s victims.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A series of internal JPMorgan emails suggesting that employees had concerns about the bank’s ties to Bernard L. Madoff. Some of the emails surfaced in a lawsuit filed by the trustee for Mr. Madoff’s victims.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Madoff Trustee’s 2010 JPMorgan Suit', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Madoff, Bernard L', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-12T03:10:53+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Business Day', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'DealBook', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/a6a4fcfb-cb3e-5b3d-8e35-6152b0dce7db', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/a6a4fcfb-cb3e-5b3d-8e35-6152b0dce7db'}, {'abstract': 'A House committee hearing showed little sign that the bipartisan effort to build a women’s history museum in Washington is gaining the momentum it needs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/us/slow-progress-on-support-for-womens-museum.html', 'snippet': 'A House committee hearing showed little sign that the bipartisan effort to build a women’s history museum in Washington is gaining the momentum it needs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A House committee hearing on Wednesday to consid