e': 'Sharma', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/3e01951e-99d2-5b7d-a304-8865d8b5f93f', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/3e01951e-99d2-5b7d-a304-8865d8b5f93f'}, {'abstract': 'These chic, comfortable shoes are the stylish descendants of the clunky clogs and granola flip-flops of yore.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/t-magazine/a-new-wave-of-bold-flat-sandals.html', 'snippet': 'These chic, comfortable shoes are the stylish descendants of the clunky clogs and granola flip-flops of yore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Retailers are stocked to the gills with warm-weather wear from resort collections, including this new breed of chic yet comfortable sandals. Perfect for a tropical escape, they are the bold, stylish descendants of Japanese geta clogs and crunchy Birkenstocks. Simple, shiny versions from Céline and Chloé go well with any look, while printed options from Giambattista Valli and Givenchy are enough to make an outift. Crisscrossed straps get the leather-and-lace treatment thanks to Marc Jacobs, Robert Clergerie and No. 21. But the crystal-embellished slides from Marni and plush, allover-velvet shoes from Sonia Rykiel are true standouts in this utilitarian category of style.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/t-magazine/12market-barsamian/12market-barsamian-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 341, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/12/t-magazine/12market-barsamian/12market-barsamian-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 341}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/t-magazine/12market-barsamian/12market-barsamian-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 582, 'width': 1024, 'subType': '