g from subject of sympathy to target of vitriol by millions of Chinese Internet users who had seen photographs of him hitting a woman pedestrian with his scooter, a foreign resident of Beijing has been detained, fined and now faces deportation. It was just the latest case of the whirlwind rush to judgment and a tendency to stake out extremes frequently seen in Chinese cyberspace.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Foreigner Faces Deportation Over Scooter Incident', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beijing News, The', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-12T14:27:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mia Li', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Li', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9410588c-abb1-5b29-acaf-82bfa8247b98', 'word_count': 547, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9410588c-abb1-5b29-acaf-82bfa8247b98'}, {'abstract': 'The people who cheered a Delhi High Court ruling in 2009 that decriminalized homosexuality mourned the reversal of that landmark decision.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/for-gay-rights-advocates-jubilation-of-four-years-turns-to-shock/', 'snippet': 'The people who cheered a Delhi High Court ruling in 2009 that decriminalized homosexuality mourned the reversal of that landmark decision.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI—On Wednesday morning, Abhina Aher, a transgender activist, woke up early and dressed in her best sari. She would have loved to be present at the Supreme Court to witness history in the making. But passes for the court hearing were limited, so Ms. Aher waited impatiently in front of the television.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/asia/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/12/world/asia/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/asia/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/asia/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1384, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/asia/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/12/world/asia/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/world/asia/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk/12-Gay-parade-IndiaInk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Gay Rights Advocates, Jubilation of Four Years Turns to Shock', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-12T14:53:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vaibhav Vats', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vaibhav', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vats', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c927114-dc97-52f6-8b3e-41552c0097d0', 'word_count': 1084, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c927114-dc97-52f6-8b3e-41552c0097d0'}, {'abstract': 'In the Disney movie “Saving Mr. Banks,” Walt Disney is — spoiler alert — a nice guy trying to win over the uptight creator of “Mary Poppins,” P. L. Travers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/13/movies/saving-mr-banks-with-tom-hanks-and-emma-thompson.html', 'snippet': 'In the Disney movie “Saving Mr. Banks,” Walt Disney is — spoiler alert — a nice guy trying to win over the uptight creator of “Mary Poppins,” P. L. Travers.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Saving Mr. Banks,” released by Disney, is a movie about the making of a Disney movie (“Mary Poppins”), in which Walt Disney himself (played by Tom Hanks) is a major character. It includes a visit to Disneyland and, if you look closely, a teaser for its companion theme park in Florida (as yet unbuilt, when the story takes place). A large Mickey Mouse plush toy appears from time to time to provide an extra touch of humor and warmth. But it would be unfair to dismiss this picture, directed by John Lee Hancock from a script by Kelly Marcel and Sue Smith, as an exercise in corporate self-promotion. It’s more of a mission statement.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13mrbanks-1/13mrbanks-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13mrbanks-1/13mrbanks-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13mrbanks-1/13mrbanks-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13mrbanks-1/13mrbanks-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13mrbanks-1/13mrbanks-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13mrbanks-1/13mrbanks-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13mrbanks-1/13mrbanks-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Unbeliever in Disney World', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Unbeliever in Disney World', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Saving Mr. Banks (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hanks, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, Emma', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hancock, John Lee', 'ran