pots, diners can find both a lively atmosphere and satisfying food.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tucked away in the Gare St.-Lazare, in the Eighth Arrondissement of Paris, is the restaurant Lazare. This new spot from Eric Frechon, the chef who earned three Michelin stars at Epicure, is charming and satisfying. But it’s notable for another reason: It’s leading a revival of the Parisian brasserie. That’s good news for anyone who loves the fast-paced restaurants that once epitomized glamour while offering good simple Gallic grub and first-rate people-watching, but in recent years have gained a reputation for mediocrity after many became part of restaurant chains more interested in the bottom line than good cooking.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/15/travel/15-choice-span/15-choice-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/15/travel/15-choice-span/15-choice-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 441}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/15/travel/15-choice-span/15-choice-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/15/travel/15-choice-span/15-choice-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1505, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/15/travel/15-choice-span/15-choice-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/15/travel/15-