et us know what you think.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SPECIAL POST — Today we would like to introduce a potential new version of the New York Times crossword web app. We have read your feedback over the past year, and this is only the beginning of a new, faster development process on the games team. Please understand that this is a beta project and there may be issues that need to be addressed, but we aim to be very responsive to your feedback, whether they are problems you find or suggestions you may have.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Try a New Version of Our Crossword Web App', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-12T17:00:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe7dd6a1-7176-5f7b-85cb-fb67eed170d9', 'word_count': 336, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe7dd6a1-7176-5f7b-85cb-fb67eed170d9'}, {'abstract': 'A weekly capsule of events around the globe curated by our writers and editors.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/calendar-coming-events-in-rotterdam-new-york-california/', 'snippet': 'A weekly capsule of events around the globe curated by our writers and editors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'S.H.O.E.S. Head Over Heels, Rotterdam', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Calendar:  Coming Events in Rotterdam; New York; California', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rotterdam (Netherlands)', 'rank': 2, 'major'