3', 'word_count': 467, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14173fca-360a-52d3-94fd-851335c66993'}, {'abstract': 'Ronald D. Liebowitz, who has greatly expanded the reach of Middlebury College, will step down in 2015, after 11 years as president, he said Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/13/education/president-of-middlebury-college-says-he-will-leave.html', 'snippet': 'Ronald D. Liebowitz, who has greatly expanded the reach of Middlebury College, will step down in 2015, after 11 years as president, he said Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ronald D. Liebowitz, who has greatly expanded the reach of Middlebury College, will step down in 2015, after 11 years as president, he said Thursday. Under Dr. Liebowitz, Middlebury, a selective small college in rural Vermont, took over the Monterey Institute of International Studies in California, opened new schools overseas and expanded its summer language schools. Dr. Liebowitz said a major remaining concern is enrollment of minority and low-income students, where Middlebury trails most other elite colleges. Middlebury also announced a governance overhaul, giving each trustee broader oversight duties.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'President of Middlebury College Says He Will Leave', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vermont: Middlebury President to Step Down', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liebowitz, Ronald D', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Middlebury College', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-12T19:35:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Pérez-Peña', 'pe