s to Play in Liberty Global Talks', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABN AMRO HOLDING NV', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ziggo B V', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Netherlands', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-12T19:54:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Quentin Webb', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Quentin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Webb', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e4ec7a75-68ac-5bbd-99fd-0238d37c9e64', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e4ec7a75-68ac-5bbd-99fd-0238d37c9e64'}, {'abstract': 'The fighting in the Central African Republic has left many civilians in need of aid.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/reports-on-central-african-republics-humanitarian-needs/', 'snippet': 'The fighting in the Central African Republic has left many civilians in need of aid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Journalists and international humanitarian workers who have been extensively covering the conflict in Central African Republic have highlighted the desperate need for aid for the more than half a million people who have been displaced by the fighting.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reports on Central African Republic’s Humanitarian Needs', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLIFTS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subj