iginal': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manohla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dargis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/b985f057-45ec-5736-b928-4d827ea435ad', 'word_count': 1323, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b985f057-45ec-5736-b928-4d827ea435ad'}, {'abstract': 'Sotheby’s and art dealers at the European Fine Art Fair had been in talks about holding a high-end art and antiques fair in China.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/plan-for-art-and-antiques-fair-in-china-falls-through/', 'snippet': 'Sotheby’s and art dealers at the European Fine Art Fair had been in talks about holding a high-end art and antiques fair in China.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It looks as though Sotheby’s and the art dealers who show up at the European Fine Art Fair every March in Maastricht, the Netherlands, are not such great pals after all.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Plan for Art and Antiques Fair in China Falls Through', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Fine Art Fair', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sotheby's", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Maastricht (Netherlands)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-12T20:38:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e737a6db-9329-5117-9ecb-f1575a7999a9', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e737a6db-9329-5117-9ecb-f1575a7999a9'}, {'abstract': 'The actor and writer was on his way to receiving an award for outstanding contribution to British comedy when he found out about his Golden Globe nomination for writing the drama “Philomena.”', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/12/steve-coogan-gets-a-comedy-award-and-a-drama-nod/', 'snippet': 'The actor and writer was on his way to receiving an award for outstanding contribution to British comedy when he found out about his Golden Globe nomination for writing the drama “Philomena.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s been a full day of celebrating for Steve Coogan, the British actor and writer known to American audiences mostly for his comedic turns in films like “Hamlet 2” and “Night at the Museum.” (In Britain, it’s his fictional broadcaster, the pompous Alan Partridge, that he’s best known for.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/arts/bagger-coogan/bagger-coogan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/12/arts/bagger-coogan/bagger-coogan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/arts/bagger-coogan/bagger-coogan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/arts/bagger-coogan/bagger-coogan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/12/arts/bagg