e_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/e64a7cc9-62e3-5629-ac1e-af641f0fe735', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/e64a7cc9-62e3-5629-ac1e-af641f0fe735'}, {'abstract': 'From the Times photography archive, images of ice yachting, a sport that was popular when cold winters could be relied upon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/13/sports/ice-yachting-when-cold-winters-could-be-relied-upon.html', 'snippet': 'From the Times photography archive, images of ice yachting, a sport that was popular when cold winters could be relied upon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The mercury plummeted to below freezing on Thursday, and most people bundled up to avoid the cold. But for a certain branch of sailors, these temperatures are ideal. With the right conditions and a sustained cold snap, rivers and lakes freeze over, providing the perfect surface for ice yachting, a sport in which sailors navigate vessels across the ice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Waiting for Ice, and a Winter Breeze', 'kicker': 'Photos', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sailboats and Sailing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-12T21:23:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Samantha Storey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Samantha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Storey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3455f61a-eebb-5d7e-84fa-117fe5f17bd1', 'word_count': 249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3455f61a-eebb-5d7e-84fa-117fe5f17bd1'}, {'abstract': 'Six finalists, including three women and the film director Steve McQueen (“12 Years a Slave”), have been named finalists for the Hugo Boss Prize.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/13/arts/design/steve-mcqueen-among-6-hugo-boss-prize-finalists.html', 'snippet': 'Six finalists, including three women and the film director Steve McQueen (“12 Years a Slave”), have been named finalists for the Hugo Boss Prize.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Six finalists have been named for the 2014 Hugo Boss Prize, the Solomon R. Guggenheim Foundation has announced. The $100,000 award, named for the German men’s wear company that sponsors it, is given every two years to an artist making significant contributions in contemporary art. Besides cash, the winner’s work receives an exhibition at the Guggenheim Museum in New York.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13VOGEL/13VOGEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13VOGEL/13VOGEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 644}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13VOGEL/13VOGEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 954, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13VOGEL/13VOGEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1908, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13VOGEL/13VOGEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13VOGEL/13VOGEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'cap