o “The Godfather: Part II.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/13/movies/friend-2-the-legacy-gangsters-in-south-korea.html', 'snippet': '“Friend 2: The Legacy,” a sequel to a popular gangster tale in South Korea, is full of nods to “The Godfather: Part II.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The South Korean director Kwak Kyung-taek is from Busan, the setting for much of the action in “Friend 2: The Legacy,” a sequel to his breakout gangster hit from 2001. Unlike the hardscrabble characters in his new movie, Mr. Kwak is from a family of doctors. He abandoned medical school to study film at New York University, and both his style and themes seem indebted to New York-based films by his fellow alumnus Martin Scorsese and by Francis Ford Coppola.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13RDP_FRIENDALT_SPAN/FRIENDALT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13RDP_FRIENDALT_SPAN/FRIENDALT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 439}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13RDP_FRIENDALT_SPAN/FRIENDALT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 749, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13RDP_FRIENDALT_SPAN/FRIENDALT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1499, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/arts/13RDP_FRIENDALT_SPAN/13RDP_FRIENDALT_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy'