08-ae00c70d0aab', 'word_count': 746, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b543632-e8e9-5011-b708-ae00c70d0aab'}, {'abstract': 'Chemical weapons were used repeatedly in the Syria conflict this year, not only in a well-documented Aug. 21 attack but also in four other instances, a United Nations panels said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/13/world/middleeast/un-confirms-repeated-chemical-arms-use-in-syria.html', 'snippet': 'Chemical weapons were used repeatedly in the Syria conflict this year, not only in a well-documented Aug. 21 attack but also in four other instances, a United Nations panels said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNITED NATIONS — Chemical weapons were used repeatedly in the Syria conflict this year, not only in a well-documented Aug. 21 attack near Damascus but also in four other instances, including two subsequent attacks that targeted soldiers, the United Nations said in a report released Thursday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chemical Arms Used Repeatedly in Syria, U.N. Says', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Reports Attacks Using Chemicals In Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Biological and Chemical Warfare', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-13T00:47:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta and Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0227b2e6-2223-5de4-a162-6abf1ee20b70', 'word_count': 705, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0227b2e6-2223-5de4-a162-6abf1ee20b70'}, {'abstract': 'Jim Freeman, the founder of Conviction Yoga, now leads yoga classes at four rural prisons in Texas and hopes to expand the program to all 109 prison units in the state.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/13/us/if-the-sun-salutation-has-to-fit-into-a-cell.html', 'snippet': 'Jim Freeman, the founder of Conviction Yoga, now leads yoga classes at four rural prisons in Texas and hopes to expand the program to all 109 prison units in the state.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PALESTINE — Quiet is hard to find in prison. But in the Powledge Unit gym on Tuesday afternoon, the silence was interrupted only by the sounds of breathing, toes on sticky yoga mats and occasional moans from nine men in white uniforms as they sank deeper into pigeon pose.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/us/13ttYoga/13ttYoga-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 371, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/13/us/13ttYoga/13ttYoga-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 371}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/us/13ttYoga/13ttYoga-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/us/13ttYoga/13ttYoga-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1265, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013