ue': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Child, Julia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Willan, Anne', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mah, Ann', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barr, Luke', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-13T16:02:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Muhlke', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Muhlke', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/c19b7a11-3146-5494-b4c1-2f20f45ac334', 'word_count': 1136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c19b7a11-3146-5494-b4c1-2f20f45ac334'}, {'abstract': 'The designer Laetitia Trouillet offers advice for bargaining, avoiding buyer’s remorse and exploring shops beyond the souks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/15/travel/tips-for-smart-shopping-in-marrakesh.html', 'snippet': 'The designer Laetitia Trouillet offers advice for bargaining, avoiding buyer’s remorse and exploring shops beyond the souks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The souks in Marrakesh have long charmed visitors with miles of closet-size shops selling Skittles-colored slippers; carpets intricately woven from camel wool and cactus silk; embroidered, buttery soft leather purses; and other wares that mark the city’s distinctive style.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/15/travel/15-qna-span/15-qna-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 525, 'width': 429, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype'