uits-after-3rd-profit-warning.html', 'snippet': 'RSA also said it needed additional reserves for its Irish operations, which faces an accounting investigation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The chief executive of the British insurer RSA Group stepped down on Friday after the company said for the second time in just over a month that it would have to significantly increase the reserves for its Irish business and for the third time in six weeks warned that its profit would be lower.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chief at British Insurer Quits after 3rd Profit Warning', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chief Executive of British Insurer to Depart', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bray, Chad', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'RSA Insurance Group', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Simon (1961- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-13T17:36:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chad Bray', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bray', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/442473e9-d2d7-5cb8-aa5f-e92f5b1d7479', 'word_count': 612, 'uri': 'nyt://article/442473e9-d2d7-5cb8-aa5f-e92f5b1d7479'}, {'abstract': 'A new analysis also found that papers that list men as the dominant author are more likely to be cited.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/science/men-surpass-women-in-publishing-research.htm