he way they confront joint obstacles like substance abuse or military deployment can affect their relationships.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/15/fashion/weddings/individual-problems-joint-solutions.html', 'snippet': 'For many couples, marriage is equal parts romance and support network. The way they confront joint obstacles like substance abuse or military deployment can affect their relationships.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Couples who are about to marry often share tales about how the things they have in common — whether cultural, religious or personality-wise — have brought them together and sustained their relationships. But there’s a special subset: those whose bonds were forged in part by mutual problems, some quite serious, that they’ve agreed to face together. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/15/fashion/weddings/15FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/15FIELDNOTES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/15/fashion/weddings/15FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/15FIELDNOTES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/15/fashion/weddings/15FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/15FIELDNOTES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/15/fashion/weddings/15FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/15FIELDNOTES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1329, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/15/fashion/weddings/15FIELDNOTES1_SPAN/15FIELDNOTES1-thumbStanda