cade. In “The Life and Death of Marina Abramovic,” a new music-theater piece being presented through Saturday in the Drill Hall of the Park Avenue Armory, Ms. Abramovic is lying plushly in state on a giant stage draped in black and lit by glowing white neon bars.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The End, if It’s Up to You', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The End, if It’s Up to You', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABRAMOVIC, MARINA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Robert (1941- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dafoe, Willem', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Funerals and Memorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Park Avenue Armory (NYC)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-15T23:14:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Theater Reviews', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charles Isherwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charles', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Isherwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/20ca7d74-8d40-56eb-952d-9c530feb974b', 'word_count': 1269, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20ca7d74-8d40-56eb-952d-9c530feb974b'}, {'abstract': 'The insider trading trial of Michael S. Steinberg, of SAC Capital, is expected to finish, and BlackBerry is set to post third-quarter results on Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/16/business/economic-reports-for-the-week-of-dec-16.html', 'snippet': 'The insider trading trial of Michael S. Steinberg, of SAC Capital, is expected to finish, and BlackBerry is set to post third-quarter results on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EURO ZONE European Union finance officials begin convening in Brussels on Tuesday in an attempt to create a system to wind down failed banks, known as the Single Resolution Mechanism. Officials were unable to reach a deal last week amid disagreement on crucial issues of funding and resolution authority. Heads of state will be in town Thursday and Friday to sign off on any final agreement. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/business/16Ahead/16Ahead-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/16/business/16Ahead/16Ahead-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/business/16Ahead/16Ahead-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 923, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/business/16Ahead/16Ahead-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 923, 'width': 923, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/business/16Ahead/16Ahead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/16/business/16Ahead/16Ahead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/business/16Ahead/16Ahead-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType