s’s appearance, whenever her name was mentioned — by a live being like Elvis Duran, host of the Z100 “Morning Show,” or in a recorded announcement — the massed screaming had something extra, a sound of acrid immediacy, released into the air of Madison Square Garden like the smell of burning wires.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bad Girl Meets Bad Santa', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bad Girl Meets Bad Santa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cyrus, Miley', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gomez, Selena', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Macklemore (Rapper)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fall Out Boy (Music Group)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-15T23:17:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Ratliff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ratliff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/ecfab294-a241-5f95-bb1d-1e29a699abc1', 'word_count': 819, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ecfab294-a241-5f95-bb1d-1e29a699abc1'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the Museum of the Moving Image’s new exhibition of “local multiplayer” games.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/12/16/arts/video-games/20131216VIDEOGAME.html', 'snippet': 'A look at the Museum of the Moving Image’s new exhibition of “local multiplayer” games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A look at the Museum of the Moving Image’s new exhibition of “local multiplayer” games.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarg