 explain it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After working on our health insurance renewals for more than a month, I finally presented my findings to my workers the first week in December. Like many people, I have never paid much attention to how health insurance works. It was a challenge to understand it and an even bigger challenge to explain it. I needed to find language that conveys the essence of our system without getting too technical. If you are trying to do the same with your employees, the following recap may be helpful.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What the New Health Insurance Law Means for My Workers', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Downs, Paul', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'HealthCare.gov', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paul Downs Cabinetmakers', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philadelphia (Pa)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-16T12:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Downs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Downs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e60f517-0690-571f-9016-e15e92092