ned Allen & Gerritsen, Boston, in a new post, senior vice president for media strategy. He had most recently been vice president and account director at the Boston office of Havas Media, part of Havas.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Accounts and People of Note in the Advertising Industry', 'kicker': 'Webdenda', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Relations and Publicity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-16T18:02:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e8a495e-a9a9-53bd-b694-0307fd544868', 'word_count': 1052, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e8a495e-a9a9-53bd-b694-0307fd544868'}, {'abstract': 'The Feast of the Seven Fishes, an Italian tradition, is novel and refreshing in a season dominated by roasted fowl and hearty braised meats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/18/dining/surfs-up-on-christmas-eve.html', 'snippet': 'The Feast of the Seven Fishes, an Italian tradition, is novel and refreshing in a season dominated by roasted fowl and hearty braised meats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This may seem odd coming from a Jewish woman from Brooklyn, but I love celebrating Christmas Eve with a feast of the seven fishes.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/dining/18APPE_SPAN/18APPE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_nam