{'abstract': 'The director says “American Hustle” wasn’t necessarily a comedy, but left it to his marketing team to decide whether to put the film up for Golden Globes for humor or drama.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/16/david-o-russell-on-which-category-makes-sense/', 'snippet': 'The director says “American Hustle” wasn’t necessarily a comedy, but left it to his marketing team to decide whether to put the film up for Golden Globes for humor or drama.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even in limited distribution, “American Hustle” had a hot opening weekend, topping other limited-release films like “Inside Llewyn Davis” and drawing the best per-screen average of David O. Russell’s career, even as it was a late entry to the season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/arts/davidorussell/davidorussell-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 792, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/16/arts/davidorussell/davidorussell-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 792}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/arts/davidorussell/davidorussell-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 776, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/arts/davidorussell/davidorussell-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1551, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/arts/davidorussell/davidorussell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/16/arts/davidorussell/davidorussell-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/arts/davidorussell/davidorussell-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'David O. Russell on Which Category Makes Sense', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golden Globes (Awards)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Russell, David O', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-16T18:15:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/32ae7771-6035-5c14-8726-ca58e3c13580', 'word_count': 397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32ae7771-6035-5c14-8726-ca58e3c13580'}, {'abstract': 'A new report from the United States Copyright Office says the government should consider ways to give painters, sculptors and other artists a financial interest in the future sale of their work.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/16/copyright-office-calls-for-congress-to-reconsider-royalties-for-artists/', 'snippet': 'A new report from the United States Copyright Office says the government should consider ways to give painters, sculptors and other artists a financial interest in the future sale of their work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last time the United States Copyright Office examined the issue of whether visual artists should receive a share of the profits\xa0when their work is resold, in 1992, it concluded that resale royalties — known internationally by the French term\xa0 droit de suite — were not a good idea. Now, after a recent re-examination of the issue, the Copyright Office has reversed itself. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Copyright Office Calls for Congress to Reconsider Royalties for Artists', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Copyrights and Copyright Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Royalties', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Copyright Office', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-16T18:27:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1cbea0f9-5658-5c15-91be-84e594833e55', 'word_count': 228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1cbea0f9-5658-5c15-91be-84e594833e55'}, {'abstract': 'Mushroom ragoût forms the basis for delicious quesadillas that can be assembled in no time.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/20/health/quesadilla-with-mushroom-ragout-and-chipotles.html', 'snippet': 'Mushroom ragoût forms the basis for delicious quesadillas that can be assembled in no time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mushroom ragoût accepts chipotles willingly. I made a delicious and substantial quesadilla dinner with the ragoût, two tortillas and a bit of cheese in under three minutes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/science/20recipehealth/20re