e': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/37b358c5-8507-5f4c-9fb2-41e9fcb964db', 'word_count': 249, 'uri': 'nyt://article/37b358c5-8507-5f4c-9fb2-41e9fcb964db'}, {'abstract': 'Reports by the Syrian Observatory for Human Rights and others said helicopters dropped barrels filled with TNT and shrapnel on 13 neighborhoods.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/world/middleeast/syria-activists-say-dozens-killed-in-aleppo-air-assault.html', 'snippet': 'Reports by the Syrian Observatory for Human Rights and others said helicopters dropped barrels filled with TNT and shrapnel on 13 neighborhoods.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Syrian antigovernment activist groups on Monday reported what appeared to be a major escalation of the military’s prolonged siege of Aleppo, with video and witness accounts of a helicopter gunship attack in which crews dropped explosive barrels filled with TNT and shrapnel on more than 13 rebel-held neighborhoods.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/world/middleeast/17syria/17syria-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/17/world/middleeast/17syria/17syria-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/world/middleeast/17syria/17syria-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/world/middleeast/17syria/17syria-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subTyp