rabic and used stock images of foreigners.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Updated, Tuesday, 12:37 p.m. | A campaign to win support for a draft of Egypt’s new constitution got off to a rocky start on Sunday, one month ahead of a referendum, when observers noticed that a banner promoting the document misspelled the word for “Egyptians” in Arabic and used stock images of foreigners to stand in for representative citizens.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Egyptians Mock Ads Promoting New Constitution With Typos and Stock Images', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cairo (Egypt)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-16T21:37:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0dd1ae7d-635f-50c5-9943-e0df2dca4d5c', 'word_count': 797, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0dd1ae7d-635f-50c5-9943-e0df2dca4d5c'}, {'abstract': 'The sedans will be recalled for a suspension problem; and a suspension-related investigation into Vipers is closed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/automobiles/acura-recalls-7400-rlx-sedans-nhtsa-concludes-viper-investigation.html', 'snippet': 'The sedans will be recalled for a suspension problem; and a suspension-related investigation into Vipers is closed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nearly 7,400 Acura RLX sedans from the 2014 model year will be recalled because of a rear suspension problem that can make the vehicle diffic