eff4878c9c'}, {'abstract': 'Putting that advertising in perspective.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/16/health-expenditure-is-really-really-big-a-clarifying-note/', 'snippet': 'Putting that advertising in perspective.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OK, for some reason I didn’t see that coming. But when I pointed out that insurers are getting ready to lay out around $500 million to promote policies via the Affordable Care Act — which I see as very good news — a fair number of readers were outraged. Insurers are spending all that money on advertising, when they should be spending it on health care!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Expenditure Is Really Really Big (A Clarifying Note)', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-16T22:04:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5ff3413-2afe-56ca-b5b1-e93cdf04771f', 'word_count': 164, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5ff3413-2afe-56ca-b5b1-e93cdf04771f'}, {'abstract': 'In Hell’s Kitchen last Friday, the 67-year-old director kicked off “A John Waters Christmas,” a brief comedy tour, with a performance in which little was off-limits and everyone was a fair target.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/16/after-hours-john-waters-has-lumps-of-coal-for-all-this-christmas/', 'snippet': 'In Hell’s Kitchen last Friday, the 67-year-old director kicked off “A John Waters Christmas,” a brief comedy tour, with a performance in which little was off-limits and everyone was a fair target.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cult filmmaker John Waters is like that lovably abrasive uncle you only see on holidays —\xa0the one who tells the same offensive jokes year after year, a few of which are still funny enough to earn a belly laugh, or perhaps a wan smile. That’s a bit what “A John Waters Christmas” felt like Friday night at the very-far-west Stage 48, where the crowd looked like the adult version of the misfit teens who go to “The Rocky Horror Picture Show” every Friday at midnight.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/t-magazine/16waters-yablonsky/16waters-yablonsky-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/16/t-magazine/16waters-yablonsky/16waters-yablonsky-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/t-magazine/16waters-yablonsky/16waters-yablonsky-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/t-magazine/16waters-yablonsky/16waters-yablonsky-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1250, 'width': 1875, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/t-magazine/16waters-yablonsky/16waters-yablonsky-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/16/t-magazine/16waters-yablonsky/16waters-yablonsky-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/16/t-magazine/16waters-yablonsky/16waters-y