ountry Strike of 1913,” a PBS documentary, revisits a 1913 mining strike in Michigan that involved a tragic Christmas Eve stampede.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/arts/television/red-metal-on-pbs-revisits-a-1913-mining-strike.html', 'snippet': '“Red Metal: The Copper Country Strike of 1913,” a PBS documentary, revisits a 1913 mining strike in Michigan that involved a tragic Christmas Eve stampede.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This has been a year of notable 50th anniversaries, but time didn’t begin in 1963. A sorrowful PBS documentary on Tuesday night notes the 100th anniversary of an event forgotten by much of the country but not by the people of Michigan’s Upper Peninsula: a miners’ strike that led to a catastrophic stampede in which 73 people died, most of them children.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/arts/redmetal/redmetal-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 363, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/17/arts/redmetal/redmetal-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 363}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/arts/redmetal/redmetal-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 619, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/arts/redmetal/redmetal-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1239, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/arts/redmetal/redmetal-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/17/