rimination against a legacy of good works?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/opinion/boylan-a-transgender-volunteer-for-the-salvation-army.html', 'snippet': 'How do you weigh discrimination against a legacy of good works?', 'lead_paragraph': 'BELGRADE LAKES, Me. — I GOT to the Waterville mall a few minutes early. My shift began at 11, and snow was falling from a pewter sky onto the parking lot. I’d been having a hard time. This was about four Christmases ago, a few years after I’d come out as transgender. In the aftermath of that unveiling, I’d lost a couple of important friendships. Getting into the spirit of the season had been a struggle. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/08/04/opinion/BOYLAN_NEW/BOYLAN_NEW-articleLarge-v6.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/08/04/opinion/BOYLAN_NEW/BOYLAN_NEW-articleLarge-v6.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/08/04/opinion/BOYLAN_NEW/BOYLAN_NEW-jumbo-v7.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/08/04/opinion/BOYLAN_NEW/BOYLAN_NEW-superJumbo-v6.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/08/04/opinion/BOYLAN_NEW/BOYLAN_NEW-thumbStandard-v7.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/08/04/opinion/BOYLAN_NEW/BOYLAN_NEW-thumbStandard-v7.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'th