rom college on a Friday, started work that following Monday, and three weeks later my boss told me I was going to Europe on a business trip to sell tennis broadcast rights. I was 22 years old and I thought going on a business trip was great since I loved to travel. That was nearly 30 years ago.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/business/subFlier/subFlier-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/17/business/subFlier/subFlier-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/business/subFlier/subFlier-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/business/subFlier/subFlier-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/business/subFlier/subFlier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/17/business/subFlier/subFlier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/business/subFlier/subFlier-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Getting Off to a Harmonious Start in Hong Kong', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Getting Off to a Harmonious Start in Hong Kong', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Travel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ONE World Sports', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Sandy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-17T01:33:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sandy Brown', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sandy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brown', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6ae9a4f-802d-5b75-aa91-f7eb4e6ae593', 'word_count': 592, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6ae9a4f-802d-5b75-aa91-f7eb4e6ae593'}, {'abstract': 'The ratification of a new agreement between Major League Baseball and Nippon Professional Baseball sets the stage for a battle over pitcher Masahiro Tanaka, if his team actually posts him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/sports/baseball/after-a-deal-over-posting-questions-about-tanaka.html', 'snippet': 'The ratification of a new agreement between Major League Baseball and Nippon Professional Baseball sets the stage for a battle over pitcher Masahiro Tanaka, if his team actually posts him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new posting agreement between Major League Baseball and Nippon Professional Baseball was completed Monday when the executive committees of both leagues ratified the deal, perhaps paving the way for the right-handed pitcher Masahiro Tanaka, the most prized Japanese player since Yu Darvish two years ago, to finally be posted.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013