abstract': 'Will athletes be able to wear a rainbow-colored armband or a pin to show support of gay rights at the Winter Olympics in Russia?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/opinion/discrimination-in-sochi.html', 'snippet': 'Will athletes be able to wear a rainbow-colored armband or a pin to show support of gay rights at the Winter Olympics in Russia?', 'lead_paragraph': 'While Vladimir Putin turns Russia into an increasingly dangerous place for gays and lesbians, the Winter Olympics in the Russian resort city of Sochi will soon begin drawing athletes and fans from around the world. There will certainly be gay athletes. And there will be thousands of spectators who come from countries where it is not a crime to love someone of the same sex. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Discrimination in Sochi', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Discrimination in Sochi', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Olympic Committee', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sochi (Russia)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-17T02:17:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/bba275e2-7bd7-52a9-b0c9-c0f070e01d22', 'word_count': 48