, a judge said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PROVIDENCE, R.I. — Joseph Caramadre contends he was a philanthropist and a clever lawyer, offering $2,000 payments to people who were dying. The United States attorney contends that he was a scam artist, preying on the very ill and getting rich by defrauding insurance companies.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Prison for Rhode Island Lawyer in Tale of Insurance and Death', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prison for Rhode Island Lawyer In Tale of Insurance and Death', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bidgood, Jess', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caramadre, Joseph', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Life Insurance', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-17T02:25:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e50a9d3c-c890-5d91-8a50-b1a5630c58b4', 'word_count': 990, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e50a9d3c-c890-5d91-8a50-b1a5630c58b4'}, {'abstract': 'With 15 days left in office, Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg will be crisscrossing New York City’s five boroughs to highlight his administration’s successes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/nyregion/bloomberg-focuses-on-his-legacy-in-farewell-tour-across-the-city.html', 'snippet': 'With 15 days left in office, Mayor Michael