.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/sports/basketball/johnsons-10-3-pointers-propels-the-nets-to-a-rout-of-the-76ers.html', 'snippet': 'Joe Johnson tied the N.B.A. record for 3-pointers in a quarter, giving the Nets a much-needed win during a week when they can do some repair work on their record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There were 28 seconds remaining in the third quarter Monday night when Joe Johnson found himself with the ball in front of the visitors’ bench at Barclays Center. James Anderson of the Philadelphia 76ers had smothered him into the corner, behind the 3-point line, but Johnson rose and flung up a shot anyway.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/sports/NETS/NETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/17/sports/NETS/NETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 672}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/sports/NETS/NETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 914, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/sports/NETS/NETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1824, 'width': 1628, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/sports/NETS/NETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/17/sports/NETS/NETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i