t': 'When it comes to Iran, the United States and Israel claim they agree on the strategy but differ on the tactics. Not so.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — President Barack Obama, speaking earlier this month at the Brookings Institution’s Saban Center for Middle East Policy in Washington, described the two countries’ “different tactical perspectives.” Similarly, Secretary of State John Kerry has said: “While we may sometimes favor a different tactical choice — tactical — the United States and Israel have always shared the same fundamental strategic goal.” And that common goal, according to Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu, is “making sure that Iran doesn’t have nuclear weapons.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tactical Obfuscation', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-17T12:49:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shmuel Rosner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shmuel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0731a0be-1e61-572f-ab19-be3cdbf83ad7', 'word_count': 474, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0731a0be-1e61-572f-ab19-be3cdbf83ad7'}, {'abstract': 'The family of Dr. Abbas Khan had been expecting his release this week but was informed that he had died.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/18/world/middleeast/syria.html', 'snippet': 'The family of Dr. Abbas Khan had been expecting his release this week but was informed that he had died.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Britain warned Syria on Tuesday that it would hold the government of President Bashar al-Assad responsible if a British surgeon incarcerated for more than a year for treating civilians in the Syrian civil war had died mysteriously in prison, as his family asserted.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/18/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/18/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/world/SYRIA/SYRIA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Britain Warns Syria After Report of Imprisoned Doctor’s Death', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain Warns Syria After Report of Imprisoned Doctor’s Death', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khan, Abbas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-17T12:54:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Cowell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a53630c4-a0f7-5e09-9dd9-a27849c74aae', 'word_count': 792, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a53630c4-a0f7-5e09-9dd9-a27849c74aae'}, {'abstract': 'All those bad dates, but then I am often lured into thinking that a man might actually be younger and thinner in reality as he looks in his profile photo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/booming/how-i-found-love-and-companionship-online.html', 'snippet': 'All those bad dates, but then I am often lured into thinking that a man might actually be younger and thinner in reality as he looks in his profile photo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I am in my late 50s and should be a better shopper by now. But the word “sale” still seduces me and although men are not exactly on sale on Match.com they are, in effect, for sale. Match.com is ubiquitous with millions of registered singles and although it is easy to weed out the ones with certain politics, geographical areas, and the ones who have been on Match.com for years, I am easily seduced by a reasonable photo and a humorous profile.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': '