bstract': 'New research finds that both women and their partners experience desire for sex and intimacy differently after childbirth.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/talking-sex-after-childbirth-and-after-children/', 'snippet': 'New research finds that both women and their partners experience desire for sex and intimacy differently after childbirth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How soon after the birth of your children did you and your partner have sex — and what does sex mean, in that new context? Do you, or did you, start with cuddling, or with other intimate acts? Did oral sex come first, or penetration?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/style/motherlode-family-bed/motherlode-family-bed-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/style/motherlode-family-bed/motherlode-family-bed-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/style/motherlode-family-bed/motherlode-family-bed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/09/27/style/motherlode-family-bed/motherlode-family-bed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/09/27/style/motherlode-family-bed/motherlode-family-bed-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Talking Sex After Childbirth, and After Children', 'kicker