ed States so far this year was down about 22 percent, while volume was $1.1 trillion, up about 15 percent from last year but still below the level in the years before the financial crisis. . Despite the relative doldrums, there were still some highlights and lowlights. Here are some of them:', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/business/dbpix-dealprof/dbpix-dealprof-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/18/business/dbpix-dealprof/dbpix-dealprof-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/business/dbpix-dealprof/dbpix-dealprof-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/business/dbpix-dealprof/dbpix-dealprof-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1092, 'width': 1092, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/business/dbpix-dealprof/dbpix-dealprof-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/18/business/dbpix-dealprof/dbpix-dealprof-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/business/dbpix-dealprof/dbpix-dealprof-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Despite Doldrums in Deal Activity, a Few Highlights This Year', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Despite Deal Activity Doldrums, a Few Highlights This Year', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shareholder Rights and Activism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-17T20:04:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Davidoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Davidoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/619e95e4-0931-56a5-863b-5b9376487d90', 'word_count': 1303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/619e95e4-0931-56a5-863b-5b9376487d90'}, {'abstract': 'A day in the life of armed America.', 'web_url': 'https://nocera.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/the-gun-report-december-17-2013/', 'snippet': 'A day in the life of armed America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The F.B.I. says it has prevented nearly 150 shootings and violent attacks this year, in part by steering potential gunmen toward mental health professionals, the Associated Press has reported.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gun Report: December 17, 2013', 'kicker': 'Joe Nocera', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-17T20:08:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Mascia', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mascia', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec99a7be-17be-50a3-9363-f399ed3e9280', 'word_count': 1530, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec99a7be-17be-50a3-9363-f399ed3e9280'}, {'abstract': 'This foolproof dessert isn’t too sweet, and satisfies in a single bite.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/18/dining/from-france-a-dessert-for-the-easy-bake-oven.html', 'snippet': 'This foolproof dessert isn’t too sweet, and satisfies in a single bite.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Time after time, the students in my cooking classes in Paris or Provence tell me “I don’t bake.” These same students are often delighted when I assign them a dessert, for they know that they will at least learn to make one wonderful sweet. I think that they also secretly hope that by week’s end, they may actually get over their fear of baking.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/dining/18HONEYSQUARES_SPAN/18HONEYSQUARES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/18/dining/18HONEYSQUARES_SPAN/18HONEYSQUARES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/dining/18HONEYSQUARES_SPAN/18HONEYSQUARES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/dining/18HONEYSQUARES_SPAN/18HONEYSQUARES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/dining/18HONEYSQUARES_SPAN/18HONEYSQUARES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 