 euro.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — European Union finance officials began meeting here again on Tuesday, hoping finally to agree on a system for winding down failing euro zone banks, which would be a pillar of the bloc’s efforts to construct a full banking union.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Europe Tries Again to Address Weak Banks', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Europe Tries Again to Address Weak Banks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jolly, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Euro (Currency)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Parliament', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Monetary Union', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-17T20:21:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Jolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jolly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f386519-01a2-589b-a3c0-042265dfc75c', 'word_count': 698, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f386519-01a2-589b-a3c0-042265dfc75c'}, {'abstract': 'Tiny Plane, a video game app that uses a plush toy as a controller, is made by ZowPow Toys and aimed at children as young as 3 years old.', 'web_url': 'https://www.