, after video showed asylum seekers being forced to stand naked outdoors as guards hosed them down.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/17/outrage-in-italy-over-degrading-treatment-of-migrants-caught-on-video/', 'snippet': 'Italian officials promised to stop the “degrading treatment” of migrants held in a detention center on the island of Lampedusa, after video showed asylum seekers being forced to stand naked outdoors as guards hosed them down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A senior Italian official on Tuesday called for an end to the “degrading treatment” of migrants held in a detention center on the island of Lampedusa, one day after video obtained by the state broadcaster showed asylum seekers being forced to stand naked outdoors as guards hosed them down.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Outrage in Italy Over ‘Degrading’ Treatment of Migrants Caught on Video', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lampedusa (Italy)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-18T01:27:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/79b16916-15c1-5ac7-b109-72bcbc778ca7', 'word_count': 424, 'uri': 'nyt://article/79b16916-15c1-5ac7-b109-72bcbc778ca7'}, {'abstract': 'Scott T. Lewis was given 120 years in prison after he was convicted of a double homicide, but a federal judge ruled that evidence about a key witness had been withheld.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/18/nyregion/judge-orders-freedom-or-retrial-for-connecticut-man-jailed-since-95.html', 'snippet': 'Scott T. Lewis was given 120 years in prison after he was convicted of a double homicide, but a federal judge ruled that evidence about a key witness had been withheld.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After spending nearly two decades in prison, a man convicted of a double homicide in New Haven in 1990 was ordered freed by a federal judge, who ruled this week that the prosecution had withheld evidence of his innocence.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Orders Freedom or Retrial for Connecticut Man Jailed Since ’95', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Free or Retry Man Jailed Since ’95, U.S. Judge Rules', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Habeas Corpus', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Witnesses', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Haven (Conn)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haight, Charles S Jr', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ruiz, Ovil', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Raucci, Vincent M Jr', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morant, Stefon', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'L