': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ostreicher, Jacob', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berger, Joseph', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bolivia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Santa Cruz (Bolivia)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Money Laundering', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-18T01:52:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joseph Berger and William Neuman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neuman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/130b2370-d5dc-59a4-bd56-c57141aa7c2e', 'word_count': 1026, 'uri': 'nyt://article/130b2370-d5dc-59a4-bd56-c57141aa7c2e'}, {'abstract': 'There is a lot on the line with his relentless campaign in the Middle East.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/18/opinion/friedman-secretary-kerrys-derring-do.html', 'snippet': 'There is a lot on the line with his relentless campaign in the Middle East.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I don’t know whether Secretary of State John Kerry will succeed in his two big chosen priorities: trying to forge an Israeli-Palestinian peace and a détente with Iran that deprives it of a nuclear weapon. But I admire his relentlessness. I admire the way he dares to fail — the only way to become a consequential secretary of state. And I admire his strategy: trying to construct a diplomacy that makes it impossible for Israel, the Palestinians and Iran to continue avoidi