ct': 'A definitive decision on a telephone surveillance effort seems likely, but much else is unclear, as Supreme Court opinions have pointed in opposite directions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/18/us/politics/after-ruling-critical-of-nsa-uncertain-terrain-for-appeal.html', 'snippet': 'A definitive decision on a telephone surveillance effort seems likely, but much else is unclear, as Supreme Court opinions have pointed in opposite directions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As Judge Richard J. Leon heard arguments last month in a challenge to a National Security Agency program, he said only one thing was certain.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/us/NSA_1/NSA-1387324184880-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 861, 'width': 574, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/us/NSA_1/NSA-1387324184880-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 861, 'width': 574, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Ruling Critical of N.S.A., Uncertain Terrain for Appeal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Ruling Critical of N.S.A., Uncertain Terrain for Appeal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leon, Richard J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fourth Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-18T02:06:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '