-faced and silent while senior officials made speeches paying homage to his father and vowing fealty to him. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'North Korea: A Pageant of Power', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Asia', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'North Korea: A Pageant of Power', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Korea', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kim Jong-un', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jang Song-Thaek', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-18T04:41:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Choe Sang-Hun', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Choe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sang-Hun', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/197f88bc-011f-5e87-8e60-f845d90fb4f3', 'word_count': 128, 'uri': 'nyt://article/197f88bc-011f-5e87-8e60-f845d90fb4f3'}, {'abstract': 'Florida jumped ahead but had to hold off Memphis in the closing seconds to win in the Jimmy V Classic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/18/sports/ncaabasketball/college-basketball-roundup.html', 'snippet': 'Florida jumped ahead but had to hold off Memphis in the closing seconds to win in the Jimmy V Classic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a tight, highly entertaining matchup in the Jimmy V Classic at Madison Square Garden on Tuesday night, No. 16 Florida held off No. 15 Memphis, 77-75, for its second consecutive win over a ranked opponent.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/18/sports/basketball/18hoops-1/18hoops-1