ins tumbling in one of its biggest markets globally.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/19/business/international/china-bitcoin-exchange-ends-renminbi-deposits.html', 'snippet': 'BTC China, the country’s biggest Bitcoin exchange, stopped taking deposits in the Chinese currency, sending the price of Bitcoins tumbling in one of its biggest markets globally.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — China’s biggest Bitcoin exchange was forced to stop accepting deposits in the Chinese currency on Wednesday, sending the price of the virtual money tumbling in one of its biggest markets globally.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bitcoin Value Sinks After Chinese Exchange Move', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bitcoin Value Sinks After Chinese Exchange Move', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bitcoin (Currency)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-18T08:04:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Gough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/35d350e9-f02b-5526-9a7b-27e62564508f', 'word_count': 364, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35d350e9-f02b-5526-9a7b-27e62564508f'}, {'abstract': 'The physician’s family accused the British Foreign Office of failing to support him or to help obtain his release.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/19/world/middleeast/syria.html', 'snippet': 'The physician’s family accused the British Foreign Office of failing to support him or to help o