icide near his London home sent Antonio Zazueta Olmos in search of the crime scene. A man had stabbed his girlfriend to death, the local newspaper said, and he then took his own life by jumping in front of a train. But when Mr. Olmos got to the block he found nothing: no police tape, no flowers, no candles.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/blogs/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/13/blogs/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/blogs/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/blogs/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/blogs/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/13/blogs/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/13/blogs/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I/2013121-lens-olmos-slide-DX1I-