'Goltz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4bb5717c-eeba-5bde-9480-a5803efa5039', 'word_count': 928, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4bb5717c-eeba-5bde-9480-a5803efa5039'}, {'abstract': 'The Paris Opera Ballet chooses a very French take on sexual desire as its seasonal theme, presenting Angelin Preljocaj’s “Le Parc.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/19/arts/dance/pleasures-of-chase-and-conquest-are-always-in-season-in-paris.html', 'snippet': 'The Paris Opera Ballet chooses a very French take on sexual desire as its seasonal theme, presenting Angelin Preljocaj’s “Le Parc.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — It’s nice to know that not every ballet company in the world feels obliged to program “The Nutcracker” over the Christmas season. Instead of cute children, mice and sugar plums, the Paris Opera Ballet has sexual desire as its seasonal theme (and why not?) at the Palais Garnier, where the choreographer Angelin Preljocaj’s “Le Parc” is running through Tuesday. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/arts/19iht-leparc19-inline/19iht-leparc19-inline-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 431, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/19/arts/19iht-leparc19-inline/19iht-leparc19-inline-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 431}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/arts/19iht-leparc19-inline/19iht-leparc19-inline-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/arts/19iht-leparc19-inline/19iht-le