“the greatest near-term threat” to Western interests in Africa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/19/world/africa/state-dept-warns-of-new-terrorist-group-posing-threat-to-us-interests-in-africa.html', 'snippet': 'The State Department warned that a new terrorist group linked to an Algerian militant has emerged as “the greatest near-term threat” to Western interests in Africa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The State Department warned Wednesday that a new terrorist group linked to an Algerian militant has emerged as “the greatest near-term threat to U.S. and Western interests” in the Sahel region of Africa. The State Department’s move underscored the resilience of the militant factions and their ability to forge new terrorist alliances, even in the face of Western pressure.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'State Dept. Warns of New Terrorist Group Posing Threat to U.S. Interests in Africa', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'State Dept. Warns of New Terrorist Group Posing Threat to U.S. Interests in Africa', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon, Michael R', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Belmokhtar, Mokhtar', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Al Murabitoun', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFRICA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALGERIA', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mujao (Movement for Oneness and Jihad in West Africa)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-19T03:07:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'n