k as United States envoy to China, has deep experience in working on United States-China trade issues.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/18/obamas-choice-for-china-envoy-a-longtime-free-trade-advocate/', 'snippet': 'Senator Max Baucus, President Obama’s pick as United States envoy to China, has deep experience in working on United States-China trade issues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Senator Max Baucus, who has been chosen by President Obama as the new ambassador to China, is a free trade proponent whose chief China concerns have been lifting restrictions on the sale of American beef from his home state, Montana, to the Chinese market.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obama’s Choice for China Envoy a Longtime Free Trade Advocate', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mad Cow Disease (Bovine Spongiform Encephalopathy)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bader, Jeffrey A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baucus, Max', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cui Tiankai', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Locke, Gary', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Xi Jinping', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carnegie Endowment for International Peace', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Trade Organization', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Beijing (China)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name