3/12/19/sports/football/week-16-nfl-game-probabilities-playoff-percentages.html', 'snippet': 'The Bears-Eagles game is the most meaningful one this week. Its outcome will affect two division races in the N.F.C. as well as the conference’s wild-card race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the playoff field narrows with two games remaining, we can use what’s known as a Monte Carlo simulation to play out the remainder of the season several thousand times, weighting the game outcomes according to the game probabilities produced by the Advanced NFL Stats efficiency model.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/sports/football/19nflodds-1/19nflodds-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 477, 'width': 375, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/sports/football/19nflodds-1/19nflodds-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 477, 'width': 375, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/sports/football/19nflodds-1/19nflodds-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/19/sports/football/19nflodds-1/19nflodds-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/sports/football/19nflodds-1/19nflodds-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Week 16 N.F.L. Game Probabilities: Playoff Percentages', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': '