umbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/business/dbpix-henning2/dbpix-henning2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/business/dbpix-henning2/dbpix-henning2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/20/business/dbpix-henning2/dbpix-henning2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/business/dbpix-henning2/dbpix-henning2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Gains Confidence With Insider Trading Victory', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Insider Trading', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Securities and Commodities Violations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cohen, Steven A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steinberg, Michael Saren', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SAC Capital Advisors', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-19T16:02:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter J. Henning', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Henning', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ad052d4b-9a13-51c6-881f-e10378850f8e', 'word_count': 995, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ad052d4b-9a13-51c6-881f-e10378850f8e'}, {'abstract': 'After Texas, the Sunshine State was the South’s main source of beef — and the Union did everything to shut it down.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/19/floridas-cattle-wars/', 'snippet': 'After Texas, the Sunshine State was the South’s main source of beef — and the Union did everything to shut it down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fall of Vicksburg in July 1863, which gave the Union control of the Mississippi River, not only cut the Confederacy in half, but it cut off the supply of Texas cattle from reaching hungry troops to the east (and federal blockaders patrolling the Gulf of Mexico prevented delivery by ship). Consequently, the Confederacy increasingly looked to a seemingly unlikely source, Florida, as a source of beef for its armies. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Florida’s Cattle Wars', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cattle', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Livestock', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fort Myers (Fla)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-19T16:09:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phil Leigh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leigh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/029b6930-bfb4-5fa7-b4d9-8ef6e5e9ecc0', 'word_count': 1448, 'uri': 'nyt://article/029b6930-bfb4-5fa7-b4d9-8ef6e5e9ecc0'}, {'abstract': 'Don’t assume your child knows the differences between collaborating and cheating, or paraphrasing and plagiarism.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/19/talking-to-children-about-cheating-dishonesty-is-worse-than-a-bad-grade/', 'snippet': 'Don’t assume your child knows the differences between collaborating and cheating, or paraphrasing and plagiarism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve had cheating on the brain this week because I’ve been researching an article about creating cheating-free classrooms. A few friends asked me to write about how parents can best address the topic of academic dishonesty with children. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/style/motherlode-dickens-cheating/motherlode-dickens-cheating-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/19/style/motherlode-dickens-cheating/motherlode-dickens-cheating-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/style/motherlode-dickens-cheating/motherlode-dickens-cheating-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/style/motherlode-dickens-cheating/motherlode-dickens-cheating-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/19/style/motherlode-dickens-cheating/motherlode-dickens-cheating-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail'