th knives and a meat cleaver face life in prison.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/20/world/europe/2-found-guilty-in-killing-of-british-soldier.html', 'snippet': 'The British-born converts to Islam who ran over a soldier and hacked him with knives and a meat cleaver face life in prison.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Two British-born converts to Islam were found guilty on Thursday of the murder of a British soldier who was run over with a car on a London street and then hacked with knives and a meat cleaver as closed-circuit cameras recorded parts of the grisly scene.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2 Found Guilty in Grisly Killing of British Soldier', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Britain: 2 Men Are Convicted Of Killing of a British Soldier', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Benhold, Katrin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adebolajo, Michael', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adebowale, Michael', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rigby, Lee', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-19T18:31:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katrin Bennhold', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katrin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bennhold', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': N