g, according to a report in Bloomberg Businessweek on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Painter of Works Sold as Masterpieces Says He Too Was Duped', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Painter of ‘Masterpieces’ Says He Was Duped, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forgery', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Qian, Pei-Shen', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosales, Glafira', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bloomberg BusinessWeek', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Knoedler & Co', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Queens (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shanghai (China)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-19T19:49:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patricia Cohen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patricia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cohen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a129b46-170e-50a5-95fb-a6e62f0ba06a', 'word_count': 346, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a129b46-170e-50a5-95fb-a6e62f0ba06a'}, {'abstract': 'This winter’s new equipment includes everything from skis to help smooth your ride to a camera that will record it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/22/travel/new-ski-gear-from-head-to-toe-and-below.html', 'snippet': 'This winter’s new equipment includes everything from skis to help smooth your ride to a camera that will record it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Remember how, in nearly every Bond 