r 30 consecutive hours, prompting criticism of the industry’s workaholic culture.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/21/world/asia/death-of-indonesian-copywriter-brings-scrutiny-on-advertising-industry.html', 'snippet': 'Ananda Pradnya Paramita, 27, died shortly after posting on Twitter that she had worked for 30 consecutive hours, prompting criticism of the industry’s workaholic culture.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JAKARTA, Indonesia — The death of an Indonesian copywriter has generated a surge of anger in Indonesia, turning the young woman into an inadvertent symbol of the grueling, workaholic culture of the advertising world.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Death, Indonesian Ad Industry Scrutinized', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Death, Ad Industry Scrutinized', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Working Hours', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indonesia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Y&R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WPP', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-20T07:57:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Lamb', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lamb', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2c30c0b-f5f2-533a-83d3-91317e1b52e6', 'word_count': 544, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2c30c0b-f5f2-533a-83d3-91317e1b52e6'}, {'abstract': 'The popular Gallardo is on its way out after 10 years, and Lamborghini has a more powerful, more efficient, all-new model to take its place.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/20/automobiles/introducing-the-huracan-lamborghinis-gallardo-successor.html', 'snippet': 'The popular Gallardo is on its way out after 10 years, and Lamborghini has a more powerful, more efficient, all-new model to take its place.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lamborghini today released images and specifications for its successor to the V10-powered Gallardo, since 2004 the junior model to the automaker’s flagship nameplates – first the Murciélago, then the Aventador. Following the Lamborghini tradition of christening cars with names associated with Spanish bullfighting, the new model will be called the Huracán 610-4, after a bull that fought valiantly in Alicante in the late 19th century. The Huracán will make its public debut at the GenevaMotor Show inMarch.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/automobiles/20LAMBO-1/20LAMBO-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/20/automobiles/20LAMBO-1/20LAMBO-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/automobiles/20LAMBO-1/20LAMBO-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/automobiles/20LAMBO-1/20LAMBO-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/automobiles/20LAMBO-1/20LAMBO-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height