ired of one of the most important collections still in private hands of Deccan and Mughal painting from India’s major Islamic courts of the 16th century through the late 18th century.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cleveland Museum Acquires a Collection of Indian Islamic Art', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cleveland Museum of Art', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-20T17:20:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Randy Kennedy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Randy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kennedy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/974fce9e-c6fb-58e3-884c-aa7d79dede43', 'word_count': 334, 'uri': 'nyt://article/974fce9e-c6fb-58e3-884c-aa7d79dede43'}, {'abstract': 'When his back pain returned after more than 25 years, Tony Schwartz writes, he decided it was time to address his fears directly.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/12/20/to-break-the-cycle-of-pain-its-mind-over-matter/', 'snippet': 'When his back pain returned after more than 25 years, Tony Schwartz writes, he decided it was time to address his fears directly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two months ago, I stepped into a shower in a hotel room in Baton Rouge, La., and felt a slight twinge in my back. I didn’t pay it much mind. I’ve experienced twinges from time to time, but for more than 25 years, I have been essentially free of back pain.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'capt