ew York Times photography archive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/21/sports/the-mighty-mighty-cheerleaders.html', 'snippet': 'Images through the years (stomp-stomp-clap) of sports teams’ most vocal supporters (stomp-stomp-clap), from the New York Times photography archive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ready? O.K.! You’ve heard it a thousand times. At your son’s high school basketball game, your daughter’s homecoming football game at college and, of course, ubiquitously throughout the classic cheerleading movie, “Bring It On.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mighty, Mighty Cheerleaders', 'kicker': 'Photos', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stamp-Stamp-Clap: Firing Up Crowds Through the Years', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Storey, Samantha', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheerleaders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-20T17:55:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Samantha Storey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Samantha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Storey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/947aa337-85eb-528a-b09d-05e0b5f1d0dc', 'word_count': 257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/947aa337-85eb-528a-b09d-05e0b5f1d0dc'}, {'abstract': 'Nine films advance for the foreign-language Oscar, and there are many surprises.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/20/academy-releases-foreign-language-shortlist-2/', 'snippet': 'Nine films advance for the foreign-language Oscar, and there are many surprises.', 'lead_paragraph': '