. Khodorkovsky released a statement from Berlin, along with an image of himself free for the first time in 10 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Updated, 7:20 p.m. | Hours after his sudden release from prison on Friday, the Russian dissident Mikhail Khodorkovsky released a statement from Berlin, along with an image of himself being greeted at the airport by Hans-Dietrich Genscher, a former German foreign minister who helped arrange his travel, as my colleagues Steven Lee Myers and David Herszenhorn report.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/world/europe/20lede_khodorkovsky/20lede_khodorkovsky-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/20/world/europe/20lede_khodorkovsky/20lede_khodorkovsky-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 676}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/world/europe/20lede_khodorkovsky/20lede_khodorkovsky-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/world/europe/20lede_khodorkovsky/20lede_khodorkovsky-superJumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/world/europe/20lede_khodorkovsky/20lede_khodorkovsky-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/20/world/europe/20lede_khodorkovsky/20lede_khodorkovsky-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'cap