s to make the Navy less vulnerable to fraud.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/21/us/politics/amid-scandal-navy-secretary-announces-contracting-overhaul.html', 'snippet': 'As allegations of overbilling for supplies expand, Navy Secretary Ray Mabus said he had ordered a team of officials to come up with changes to make the Navy less vulnerable to fraud.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Navy Secretary Ray Mabus on Friday acknowledged gaps in the Navy’s oversight of the companies that provide supplies for the nation’s warships across the world and announced wide-ranging plans to revamp contracting practices that experts say have made it far too easy for businesses to defraud the service out of tens of millions of dollars.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/us/NAVY/NAVY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/21/us/NAVY/NAVY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 716}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/us/NAVY/NAVY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 859, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/us/NAVY/NAVY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1566, 'width': 1313, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/us/NAVY/NAVY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/21/us/NAVY/NAVY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype':