books, selling over 450 million copies, and eight films. Now Harry Potter will apparate into the West End in 2015, in a new play about the early years of J. K. Rowling’s boy wizard, before his years at Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry. Ms. Rowling will collaborate on the play with an as-yet unnamed playwright; she will also be a co-producer, she told The Daily Mail on Thursday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/arts/20artsbeat-rowling/20artsbeat-rowling-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 892, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/20/arts/20artsbeat-rowling/20artsbeat-rowling-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 892}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/arts/20artsbeat-rowling/20artsbeat-rowling-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 689, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/arts/20artsbeat-rowling/20artsbeat-rowling-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1378, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/arts/20artsbeat-rowling/20artsbeat-rowling-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/20/arts/20artsbeat-rowling/20artsbeat-rowling-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/20/arts/20artsbeat-rowling/20artsbeat-rowling-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_n