777ef2c7-17ce-5cc1-a40b-08fb298d47cd', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/777ef2c7-17ce-5cc1-a40b-08fb298d47cd'}, {'abstract': 'Before the Bagger takes off for the holidays, here’s a dance video from the Oscar machine.', 'web_url': 'https://carpetbagger.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/20/dancing-our-way-to-a-holiday-break/', 'snippet': 'Before the Bagger takes off for the holidays, here’s a dance video from the Oscar machine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Academy has started the promotional reel for its March 2 telecast in a major way, with the host Ellen DeGeneres dancing down the street, trailed by a crowd of men and women clad in tuxedos. The trailer, released on Thursday and scheduled to play in theaters next month, was conceived and directed by Paul Feig, the “Bridesmaids” and “Heat” filmmaker, and set to new music by Fitz and the Tantrums. The dancer and choreographer Stephen (tWitch) Boss, a judge on the TV show “So You Think You Can Dance,” was responsible for the moves in the video.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dancing Our Way to a Holiday Break', 'kicker': 'Carpetbagger', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DeGeneres, Ellen', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Feig, Paul', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fitz and the Tantrums (Music Group)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-20T19:48:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melena Ryzik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melena', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ryzik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc768e10-5350-5beb-aed3-2d336a6c4e17', 'word_count': 219, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc768e10-5350-5beb-aed3-2d336a6c4e17'}, {'abstrac