h is not a gravy at all but a mushroom ragoût, or stew. I always make too much. I double the recipe if we are going to be a dozen people, which we usually are during holiday gatherings, even though I know that nobody will have enough room on their plates for more than a spoonful. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/science/recipehealthpromo/recipehealthpromo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/17/science/recipehealthpromo/recipehealthpromo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/science/recipehealthpromo/recipehealthpromo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/science/recipehealthpromo/recipehealthpromo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1389, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/science/recipehealthpromo/recipehealthpromo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/17/science/recipehealthpromo/recipehealthpromo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/17/science/recipehealthpromo/recipehealthpromo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'One Mushroom Ragoût, Five Meals', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mushrooms', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetarianism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-20T22:17:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha Rose Shulman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': 'Rose', 'lastname': 'Shulman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3252ed1d-e2d1-5db8-8296-4904eb62c4c3', 'word_count': 268, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3252ed1d-e2d1-5db8-8296-4904eb62c4c3'}, {'abstract': 'The pace at Octopus Garden, a Brooklyn store, turns frenzied before Christmas Eve when Italian-Americans celebrating the Feast of Seven Fishes crave octopus, cuttlefish and calamari.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/12/22/nyregion/20131222JOINTss.html', 'snippet': 'The pace at Octopus Garden, a Brooklyn store, turns frenzied before Christmas Eve when Italian-Americans celebrating the Feast of Seven Fishes crave octopus, cuttlefish and calamari.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pace at Octopus Garden, a Brooklyn store, turns frenzied before Christmas Eve when Italian-Americans celebrating the Feast of Seven Fishes crave octopus, cuttlefish and calamari.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/22/nyregion/20131222JOINTss-slide-BUUG/20131222JOINTss-slide-BUUG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/22/nyregion/20131222JOINTss-slide-BUUG/20131222JOINTss-slide-BUUG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheig