ophy is awarded to the player who wins the most masterpoints during the Fall North American Championships.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/21/crosswords/bridge/agustin-madala-wins-the-goren-trophy.html', 'snippet': 'The Goren Trophy is awarded to the player who wins the most masterpoints during the Fall North American Championships.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Goren Trophy is awarded to the player who wins the most masterpoints during the Fall North American Championships. This year’s winner was Agustin Madala, who hails from Argentina but represents Italy. He amassed 402.22 points, 83.32 more than Steve Weinstein of Andes, N.Y.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/crosswords/bridge/21cards/21cards-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 529, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/crosswords/bridge/21cards/21cards-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1074, 'width': 554, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/crosswords/bridge/21cards/21cards-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/21/crosswords/bridge/21cards/21cards-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/crosswords/bridge/21cards/21cards-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Agustin Madala Wins the Goren Trophy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_