l only briefly papered over the party’s destructive political tactics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/21/opinion/return-to-regular-gop-programming.html', 'snippet': 'The budget deal only briefly papered over the party’s destructive political tactics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The budget deal that Congress approved and sent to President Obama on Wednesday may bring some relief to agencies burdened by sequester cuts all year, but it does nothing to bring the two political parties closer together. Republicans immediately reverted to their obstructionist agenda, making it clear that the budget compromise with Democrats was a brief aberration.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Return to Regular G.O.P. Programming', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Return to Regular G.O.P. Programming', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Paul D Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-21T02:32:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/c77aa350-6efc-5855-adad-5ffa73a7fae9', 'word_count': 519, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c77aa350-6efc-5855-adad-5ffa73a7fae9'}, {'abstract': 'Despite being born without a left hand and forearm, Zach Hodskins has a guaranteed roster spot with the Florida Gators next season, an affirmation of his basketball skill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/21/sports/basketball/one-handed-basketball-player-gets-shot-with-florida.html', 'snippet': 'Despite being born without a left hand and forearm, Zach Hodskins has a guaranteed roster spot with the Florida Gators next season, an affirmation of his basketball skill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILTON, Ga. — A referee’s whistle halted play during a recent game at Milton High, a school situated among horse farms in an affluent area north of Atlanta. A foul had been called, leaving the culprit’s coach mystified.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/y-jp-gators/y-jp-gators-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/y-jp-gators/y-jp-gators-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/y-jp-gators/y-jp-gators-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/y-jp-gators/y-jp-gators-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1248, 'width': 1983, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/y-jp-gators/y-jp-gators-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/21/sp