, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0db0a7e-4e79-5ae1-9bb4-cbb95f0dadbe'}, {'abstract': 'Friday’s game between the Anaheim Ducks and the New Jersey Devils likely marked the last time Teemu Selanne would play in the N.H.L. against Jaromir Jagr.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/21/sports/hockey/a-final-meeting-perhaps-for-two-ageless-stars.html', 'snippet': 'Friday’s game between the Anaheim Ducks and the New Jersey Devils likely marked the last time Teemu Selanne would play in the N.H.L. against Jaromir Jagr.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWARK — The Finnish Flash rolled through New Jersey one last time on Friday, and as with all the stops on Teemu Selanne’s N.H.L. farewell tour, it was a special occasion. The game between the Anaheim Ducks and the Devils was the last regular-season appearance for Selanne, 43, in the metropolitan area and, almost certainly, the last time he would play in the N.H.L. against Jaromir Jagr, 41, the league’s other ageless wonder. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/oldguys2/oldguys2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/oldguys2/oldguys2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/oldguys2/oldguys2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/oldguys2/oldguys2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1257, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image