ns', 'value': 'Williams, Deron', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pierce, Paul (1977- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-21T04:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/665df80e-9120-51dd-9dca-d70a35a35ca6', 'word_count': 737, 'uri': 'nyt://article/665df80e-9120-51dd-9dca-d70a35a35ca6'}, {'abstract': 'These early contests offer intriguing matchups pitting some of the nation’s best college football players.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/21/sports/ncaafootball/early-bowl-games-to-watch.html', 'snippet': 'These early contests offer intriguing matchups pitting some of the nation’s best college football players.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who says all the good bowl games are in January? Bowl season has already started, and while the AdvoCare V100 Bowl on Dec. 31 may not have the cachet of the Rose Bowl, it will feature two of the best running backs in the nation. And that is just one of the intriguing matchups to watch before the end of 2013. This may be your last chance to see quarterbacks Teddy Bridgewater, Johnny Manziel and Jordan Lynch before they start playing on Sundays.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/ncaafootball/21games2/21games2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 950, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/21/sports/ncaafootball/21games2/21games2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 950}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'ju