and which often embody the spirit of amateurism in college sports are being cut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/23/sports/demise-of-rowing-at-temple-is-harsh-blow-for-amateurs.html', 'snippet': 'Unlike football and basketball, sports that do not generate revenue and which often embody the spirit of amateurism in college sports are being cut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’ve ever taken a train out of Philadelphia, you may have seen Boathouse Row, a strip of 15 Victorian boathouses on the banks of the Schuylkill that look made of gingerbread. Those buildings and that river have been the center of rowing in the United States for generations.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/sports/macur/macur-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/23/sports/macur/macur-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/sports/macur/macur-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 754, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/sports/macur/macur-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1507, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/sports/macur/macur-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/23/sports/macur/macur-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,