'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shaanxi Province (China)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sichuan Province (China)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': "Yan'an (China)", 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Yunnan Province (China)', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-23T08:56:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Didi Kirsten Tatlow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Didi', 'middlename': 'Kirsten', 'lastname': 'Tatlow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f9ff29d-1751-526c-8322-afb01620d83c', 'word_count': 939, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f9ff29d-1751-526c-8322-afb01620d83c'}, {'abstract': 'Helmut Schmidt has not led his country for more than 30 years, but he still commands attention — a poll has even named him Germany’s most significant chancellor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/24/world/europe/helmut-schmidt-former-chancellor-of-germany.html', 'snippet': 'Helmut Schmidt has not led his country for more than 30 years, but he still commands attention — a poll has even named him Germany’s most significant chancellor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HAMBURG, Germany — When he was born, World War I had just ended. He was German chancellor for eight years, roughly as long as he served in Hitler’s Wehrmacht. And now, in a country where old men are much revered, Helmut Schmidt is turning 95, and his nation is reflecting on a politician once renowned if feared for his sharp tongue but now elevated to the status of icon.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24