 the spotlight from engineers in Silicon Valley, where tech companies are placing a higher priority on beauty and ease of use, not just efficiency and function.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/23/silicon-valleys-new-obsession-with-beauty/', 'snippet': 'Designers are stealing the spotlight from engineers in Silicon Valley, where tech companies are placing a higher priority on beauty and ease of use, not just efficiency and function.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Silicon Valley has always been obsessed with efficiency. But lately, it is also obsessed with beauty.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/technology/23bits-design/23bits-design-articleLarge.png', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/23/technology/23bits-design/23bits-design-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/technology/23bits-design/23bits-design-jumbo.png', 'height': 960, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/technology/23bits-design/23bits-design-superJumbo.png', 'height': 960, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/technology/23bits-design/23bits-design-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/23/technology/23bits-design/23bits-design-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/technology/23bits-design/23bits-design-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Silicon Valley’s New Obsession With Beauty', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-23T12:30:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Cain Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': 'Cain', 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6ece146-b78a-5c79-aa9d-e1dc0f06f46c', 'word_count': 527, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6ece146-b78a-5c79-aa9d-e1dc0f06f46c'}, {'abstract': 'On the flat lava plain of Reykjanesbaer, Iceland, near the Arctic Circle, you can find the Bitcoin mines. | The Federal Reserve moved to curb a maneuver that banks can exploit to make themselves look stronger. | A deal by Carl C. Icahn illustrates the growth of an obscure but increasingly popular securities structure. | The Fed has allowed JPMorgan into a variety of markets for basic goods.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/12/23/morning-agenda-the-bitcoin-mines-of-iceland/', 'snippet': 'On the flat lava plain of Reykjanesbaer, Iceland, near the Arctic Circle, you can find the Bitcoin mines. | The Federal Reserve moved to curb a maneuver that banks can exploit to make themselves look stronger. | A deal by Carl C. Icahn illustrates...', 'lead_paragraph': 'INTO THE BITCOIN MINES \xa0|\xa0 On the flat lava plain of Reykjanesbaer, Iceland, near the Arctic Circle, you can find the Bitcoin mines, Nathaniel Popper reports in DealBook. There, more than 100 whirring silver computers, each in a locked cabinet and each cooled by blasts of Arctic air, are the laborers of the virtual mines where Bitcoins are unearthed. The custom-built machines, running an open-source Bitcoin program, perform complex algorithms 24 hours a day, seeking to win a block of 25 new Bitcoins from the virtual currency’s decentralized network.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Bitcoin Mines of Iceland', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-23T12:35:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b79e4e2-525d-5077-8679-7d1f774126a7', 'word_count': 2436, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b79e4e2-525d-5077-8679-7d1f774126a7'}, {'abstract': 'A day in the life of armed America.', 'web_url': 'https://nocera.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/23/the-gun-report-december-23-2013/', 'snippet': 'A day in the life of armed America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Claire Davis, 17, who was shot at Arapahoe High School in Colorado last week, died Saturday. She had been in critical condition since the shooting. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gun Report: December 23, 2013', 'kicker': 'Joe Nocera', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-23T13:00:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Mascia', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mascia', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/