'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/23/accepting-the-holes-we-cant-fill-with-gifts/', 'snippet': 'This is the first Christmas our five children will spend all together since before we adopted them; since they were separated into different foster homes four years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Christmas comes with paradoxes. This year will be the first time our five children will spend it together since they were separated into different foster homes four years ago (we first adopted the younger three in 2010, the next one in 2011, and the last one in November of this year). So on the one hand, while we are all ecstatic for this continuing reunion, we’re also painfully aware of all they have lost.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-five-gifts/motherlode-five-gifts-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-five-gifts/motherlode-five-gifts-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-five-gifts/motherlode-five-gifts-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-five-gifts/motherlode-five-gifts-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1224, 'width': 1632, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-five-gifts/motherlode-five-gifts-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 