 such marriages.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/24/us/judge-allows-same-sex-weddings-to-continue-in-utah.html', 'snippet': 'A federal judge in Utah found that gay marriages could proceed while under appeal, and a judge in Ohio struck down part of the state’s ban on such marriages.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DENVER — In decisions that supporters of same-sex marriage hailed as two important legal victories, a federal judge in Utah allowed hundreds of gay couples to continue exchanging vows on Monday, while a federal judge in Ohio invalidated part of that state’s ban on same-sex marriage.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/business/24UTAH2/24UTAH2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/24/business/24UTAH2/24UTAH2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/business/24UTAH2/24UTAH2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/business/24UTAH2/24UTAH2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1291, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/business/24UTAH2/24UTAH2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/24/business/24UTAH2/24UTAH2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image