ct': 'Lila Abu-Lughod discusses her latest book, and the gap between what she learned in her anthropological work and the rhetoric surrounding the U.S. war in Afghanistan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/books/review/100000002617743/the-read-around-lila-abu-lughod.html', 'snippet': 'Lila Abu-Lughod discusses her latest book, and the gap between what she learned in her anthropological work and the rhetoric surrounding the U.S. war in Afghanistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lila Abu-Lughod discusses her latest book, and the gap between what she learned in her anthropological work and the rhetoric surrounding the U.S. war in Afghanistan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/multimedia/books-abulughod/books-abulughod-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/23/multimedia/books-abulughod/books-abulughod-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/multimedia/books-abulughod/books-abulughod-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/multimedia/books-abulughod/books-abulughod-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1012, 'width': 1625, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/multimedia/books-abulughod/books-abulughod-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/23/multimedia/books-abulughod/books-abulughod-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 't