e', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Exclusive Airport Lounge Where Rank Is Secondary', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Exclusive Airport Lounge Where Rank Is Secondary', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharkey, Joe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Service Organizations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRPORTS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-23T20:10:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Sharkey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sharkey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a9df6bdd-389d-5937-88d0-6670b2b5aeb1', 'word_count': 952, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a9df6bdd-389d-5937-88d0-6670b2b5aeb1'}, {'abstract': 'The veteran comedian, actress and singer previews her annual holiday residency at Joe’s Pub, discusses her surprising relationship with Rahm Emanuel and reveals which TV show she’d love to land a part on.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/23/q-a-sandra-bernhard-on-how-she-rings-in-the-new-year/', 'snippet': 'The veteran comedian, actress and singer previews her annual holiday residency at Joe’s Pub, discusses her surprising relationship with Rahm Emanuel and reveals which TV show she’d love to land a part on.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Once again this holiday season, Sandra Bernhard will take to the intimate stage of Joe’s Pub for “Sandyland,” the annual residency she has been doing there for four years, in which she will tweak, in monologue and song, the cultural milestones and missteps of 2013. The past year has been a bright one for the mouthy comedian, actress and singer, 58, who landed a recurring role as an art teacher on ABC Family’s “Switched at Birth.” “Sandyland” already enjoyed a successful run this month at the Museum of Contemporary Art in Chicago, where the local critic wrote, “Few performers are as vulnerable,” as Bernhard, “nor as indomitably strong.” Bernhard chatted to T about what audiences can expect from the show and what her ambitions are for 2014.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/t-magazine/23bernhard-murphy/23bernhardt-murphy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/23/t-magazine/23bernhard-murphy/23bernhardt-murphy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 663}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/t-magazine/23bernhard-murphy/23bernhardt-murphy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 927, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/t-magazine/23bernhard-murphy/23bernhardt-murphy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1488, 'width': 1346, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/t-magazine/23bernhard-murphy/23bernhardt-murphy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/23/t-magazine/23bernhard-murphy/23bernhardt-murphy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 