andate, the heart of the whole system.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/23/weak-kneed-on-the-health-care-mandate/', 'snippet': 'The White House’s recent concession chips away at the individual mandate, the heart of the whole system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If the website malfunctions in October and November were infuriating to supporters of health care reform, the continuing parade of delays that followed it have simply been depressing. They have contributed to the impression that the Obama administration is desperately trying to keep the new system from spinning out of control, countering the good news that 1.2 million people have signed up for insurance through the federal and state exchanges.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weak-Kneed on the Health Care Mandate', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-23T21:11:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Firestone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Firestone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/74903df3-78b3-5fca-9e37-26d3f70b18fa', 'word_count': 510, 'uri': 'nyt://article/74903df3-78b3-5fca-9e37-26d3f70b18fa'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers at the University of California, San Diego, took a close look at today’s uptalk, popularized during the 1980s as Valley Girl Speak.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/23/overturning-the-myth-of-valley-girl-speak/', 'snippet': 'Researchers at the University of California, San Diego, took a close look at today’s uptalk, popularized during the 1980s as Valley Girl Speak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Are you still making fun of young women for talking like Valley Girls?', 'sour