ing.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/24/yorkshire-pudding-once-for-nine-now-for-four/', 'snippet': 'A long-standing Christmas Eve family tradition changes as adult children don’t come home for the holidays, but four parents celebrate for themselves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This Christmas the Yorkshire pudding will be smaller than usual. For the last 20 years, Christmas Eve has meant a holiday feast at our dear friends Linda and Dick’s home across the street. Their two boys and our three children grew up as close as siblings, sharing backyard and basement adventures from preschool through high school. Linda and Dick’s family celebrates both Christmas and Hanukkah; our family celebrates Hanukkah. But on Christmas Eve, all the action was across the street.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1632, 'width': 1224, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding/motherlode-yorkshire-pudding-thumbStandard.jpg', '