4-392be076191c'}, {'abstract': 'Last season, seven N.F.L. coaches were fired on the day after the regular season. This season, Houston has already fired Gary Kubiak, and many more coaches could exit Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/25/sports/football/forecasting-the-firings-on-black-monday.html', 'snippet': 'Last season, seven N.F.L. coaches were fired on the day after the regular season. This season, Houston has already fired Gary Kubiak, and many more coaches could exit Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last season, seven N.F.L. coaches were fired on the day after the regular season ended, also known as Black Monday, with Jacksonville dismissing Mike Mularkey a couple of weeks later. This season, Houston has already dismissed Gary Kubiak, and as many as 10 more coaches could be fired Monday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/sports/NFLSCORE-3/NFLSCORE-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/25/sports/NFLSCORE-3/NFLSCORE-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 833}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/sports/NFLSCORE-3/NFLSCORE-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/sports/NFLSCORE-3/NFLSCORE-3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1917, 'width': 1380, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/sports/NFLSCORE-3/NFLSCORE-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'th