eing treated for wounds.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In South Sudan, Reports of Massacres and Mass Graves', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pillay, Navi', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sudan People's Liberation Army", 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Juba (South Sudan)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Sudan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-24T17:51:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2053452a-e664-52c0-a46c-97795acf2cd2', 'word_count': 602, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2053452a-e664-52c0-a46c-97795acf2cd2'}, {'abstract': 'The cable company announced that it had reached a multiyear agreement to renew distribution for Viacom Inc., whose networks include MTV, Comedy Central and Nickelodeon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/25/business/media/time-warner-cable-and-viacom-extend-deal.html', 'snippet': 'The cable company announced that it had reached a multiyear agreement to renew distribution for Viacom Inc., whose networks include MTV, Comedy Central and Nickelodeon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SpongeBob SquarePants will continue to