of the most recognized voices on the radio for more than 40 years.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/24/remembering-a-voice-for-the-region/', 'snippet': 'Stan Brooks, a legendary icon on New York’s first all-news radio station, 1010 WINS, was one of the most recognized voices on the radio for more than 40 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One day during Edward I. Koch’s third term, when allegations of corruption were swirling around mayoral allies like Donald R. Manes, the Queens borough president, the radio reporter Stan Brooks stopped Mr. Koch at City Hall. Mr. Brooks, as always, had his microphone in his hand and his tape recorder running.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/nyregion/24cityroom-brooks/24cityroom-brooks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 821, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/25/nyregion/24cityroom-brooks/24cityroom-brooks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 821}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/nyregion/24cityroom-brooks/24cityroom-brooks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 749, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/nyregion/24cityroom-brooks/24cityroom-brooks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1497, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/nyregion/24cityroom-brooks/24cityroom-brooks-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/25/nyregion/24cityroom-brooks/24cityroom-brooks-thumbStandard