, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/ca64ee51-fca1-50ec-b53d-d6cc097d5683', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/ca64ee51-fca1-50ec-b53d-d6cc097d5683'}, {'abstract': 'New Year’s Eve is an occasion to revisit the looks that “American Hustle” embraces. Check out our how-to videos.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/26/fashion/New-Years-Eve-American-Hustle-70s-makeup-70s-hair.html', 'snippet': 'New Year’s Eve is an occasion to revisit the looks that “American Hustle” embraces. Check out our how-to videos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For New Year’s Eve inspiration this year, one might look to Amy Adams’s glamorous ’70s makeover on “American Hustle” (the beauty equivalent of the plunging sequined minidress). Herein, the film’s hair and makeup experts, along with Gina Brooke, Madonna’s makeup artist, and Michael Angelo, a favorite hairstylist of New York social swans, tell how to get the look you want to know better.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For One Night, a Trip Back in Time', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For One Night, a Trip Back in Time', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shapiro, Bee', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New Year', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'American Hustle (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cosmetics and Toiletries', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nineteen Hundred Seventies', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-24T23:40:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'or