actually reduce crucial food assistance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is a harsh season for Americans struggling to afford food. Last month, the long lines at food pantries across the country grew longer with the expiration of the boost to food stamp benefit levels included in the 2009 economic stimulus plan. Those lines are apt to grow even longer thanks to the refusal of House Republicans to renew extended unemployment benefits as part of the recent budget deal. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Hunger for the Poorest Americans', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Hunger for the Poorest Americans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Stamps', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Banks and Pantries', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Farm Bill (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment Insurance', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crop Controls and Subsidies', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-25T02:02:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/99781cfc-04a5-5a53-b6ac-75f047306f5e', 'word_count': 593, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99781cfc-04a5-5a53-b6ac-75f047306f5e'}, {'abstract': 'Supporters of same-sex marriage say victory in a generally conservative place would mark a turning point in a fight that has largely been waged in more left-leaning states or in the courts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/25/us/indiana-ponders-vote-to-buck-trend-on-same-sex-marriage.html', 'snippet': 'Supporters of same-sex marriage say victory in a generally conservative place would mark a turning point in a fight that has largely been waged in more left-leaning states or in the courts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'INDIANAPOLIS — Dominated by Republicans and steeped in traditional values, Indiana seemed among the least likely places to become a battleground in the nation’s debate over same-sex marriage when the legislature overwhelmingly chose in 2011 to push forward a state constitutional amendment barring gay couples from marrying.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/us/jp-INDIANA-1/jp-INDIANA-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/25/us/jp-INDIANA-1/jp-INDIANA-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/us/jp-INDIANA-1/jp-INDIANA-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/us/jp-INDIANA-1/jp-INDIANA-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1332, 'width': 1999, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/25/us/jp-INDIANA-1/jp-INDIANA-1-thu