tion': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5deb948d-3a3d-5d29-a954-817c0979b50d', 'word_count': 1027, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5deb948d-3a3d-5d29-a954-817c0979b50d'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the day for Wednesday, December 25, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/25/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-wednesday-december-25-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Wednesday, December 25, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': '“When you’re younger, you have everything — you have the flexibility, you have no fear. But you don’t savor every step, every movement of every fingertip, every beat of the music. I feel like I’m tasting food for the first time.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, December 25, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-25T04:42:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/43b7f103-8c64-5573-9281-a67ccea32bce', 'word_count': 52, 'uri': 'nyt://article/43b7f103-8c64-5573-9281-a67ccea32bce'}, {'abstract': 'The lesson that seemed to emerge most persistently from the fitness-related studies published this year was that intensity matters, especially if you wish to complete your workout quickly.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/25/for-fitness-intensity-matters/', 'snippet': 'The lesson that seemed to emerge most persistently from the fitness-related studies published this year was that intensity matters, especially if you wish to complete your workout quickly.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year, exercise science expanded and fine-tuned our understanding of how physical activity affects our brains, joints, hear