became-a-baseball-town-once-again.html', 'snippet': 'Pirates fans had endured 2o losing seasons, but they were ready to unleash their passion again when the team took on the Cincinnati Reds in the National League playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For many years, the Pittsburgh Pirates played their home games at Three Rivers Stadium, a home they shared with the Steelers at the confluence of the Allegheny, Ohio and Monongahela Rivers. It was a picturesque setting, except that the upper bowl encircled the ballpark and blotted out any sense of place.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/kepner/kepner-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 287, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/kepner/kepner-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 287}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/kepner/kepner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 490, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/kepner/kepner-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 979, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/kepner/kepner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/kepner/kepner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/kepner/kepner-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Night Pittsburgh Became a Baseball Town Once Again', 'kicker': '2013: A Look Back, and Beyond', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Night Pittsburgh Became a Baseball Town Once Again', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kepner, Tyler', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pittsburgh Pirates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cincinnati Reds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-26T01:17:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d5c560e0-a2ee-5746-8251-74e0036b4af9', 'word_count': 490, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d5c560e0-a2ee-5746-8251-74e0036b4af9'}, {'abstract': 'Suzann Pettersen of Norway did not reach No. 1 even as she won four tournaments, a testament to how competitive the L.P.G.A. has become.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/26/sports/golf/pettersen-stars-in-a-supporting-role.html', 'snippet': 'Suzann Pettersen of Norway did not reach No. 1 even as she won four tournaments, a testament to how competitive the L.P.G.A. has become.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Suzann Pettersen of Norway won four tournaments, including her second major at the Evian Championship. She recorded two third-place finishes and a tie for fourth in three of the year’s other majors, faltering only at the United States Women’s Open, where she missed the cut. She had 10 top-three finishes on the L.P.G.A. Tour and was on the victorious Solheim Cup team, which in any other year would have won her mountains of attention and possibly the Player of the Year award. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/crouse/crouse-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/crouse/crouse-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/crouse/crouse-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/crouse/crouse-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/crouse/crouse-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/crouse/crouse-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/sports/crouse/crouse-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pettersen Stars in a Supporting Role', 'kicker': '2013: A Look Back, and Beyond', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pettersen Stars in a Supporting Role', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pettersen, Suzann', 'rank