. His skin had been cracking and inflamed for months, but we had taken such pains with it — daily applications of heavy cream and austere dietary restrictions — in anticipation of introducing him to his relatives in Turkey.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Eczema and Holy Water', 'kicker': 'Private Lives', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eczema', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion and Belief', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Istanbul (Turkey)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-26T01:59:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mert Erogul', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erogul', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b069668-6104-5761-98f6-d9c72cad883d', 'word_count': 742, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b069668-6104-5761-98f6-d9c72cad883d'}, {'abstract': 'Last May, Robinette Christian, 64, lost her partner of 37 years, but even before the death, Ms. Christian had a tenuous grip on happiness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/26/nyregion/through-art-coping-with-depression-and-a-death.html', 'snippet': 'Last May, Robinette Christian, 64, lost her partner of 37 years, but even before the death, Ms. Christian had a tenuous grip on happiness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Disorder has come to characterize Robinette Christian’s life of late.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/nyregion/NEEDIEST/NEEDIEST-articleLa