ial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/744d0d06-182c-5fa8-8055-499677411e6a', 'word_count': 401, 'uri': 'nyt://article/744d0d06-182c-5fa8-8055-499677411e6a'}, {'abstract': 'Despite the winter wonderland outside, it’s decidedly tropical in stores thanks to the bright colors and warm-weather prints in this season’s resort collections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/26/t-magazine/tropical-prints-that-transport.html', 'snippet': 'Despite the winter wonderland outside, it’s decidedly tropical in stores thanks to the bright colors and warm-weather prints in this season’s resort collections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite the winter wonderland outside, it’s decidedly tropical in stores thanks to the bright colors and warm-weather prints in this season’s resort collections. The chic grandchildren of the Hawaiian shirt, statement separates like a colorful, palm-printed skirt from Fausto Puglisi beg to be paired with basic palettes and clean lines. And from the bright stones on an Annelise Michelson necklace, an upscale version of Panamanian street market finds, to the sandy-colored backdrop on a Prada bag emblazoned with a vintage hula girl, the often-kitschy theme is being reinvented into a motif that the modern woman can get behind without having to travel to a hot and humid destination.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/t-magazine/26market-barsamian/26market-barsamian-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/26/t-magazine/26market-barsamian/26market-barsamian-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/t-magazine/26market-barsamian/26market-barsamian-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 