dn’t have to figure it out on their own.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/26/supporting-child-support/', 'snippet': 'Millions of people in the United States owe money for child support from former marriages, and want to be involved with the children’s lives. One divorced entrepreneur thinks they shouldn’t have to figure it out on their own.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Getting divorced, particularly when children are involved, can be a hard and messy business, rife with mediators, lawyers and courts. It’s little remarked how hard the realities of the situation can be afterward, when people are on their own.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/technology/24bits-supportpay/24bits-supportpay-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/24/technology/24bits-supportpay/24bits-supportpay-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/technology/24bits-supportpay/24bits-supportpay-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/technology/24bits-supportpay/24bits-supportpay-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/technology/24bits-supportpay/24bits-supportpay-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/24/technology/24bits-supportpay/24bits-supportpay-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 