'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/27/movies/august-osage-county-with-meryl-streep-and-julia-roberts.html', 'snippet': 'The word “acting” is inadequate for what the cast of “August: Osage County” is doing. It’s more of a thespian cage match.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sam Shepard kicks off the screen adaptation of “August: Osage County” with a foggy reference to T. S. Eliot and a succinct account of some of the family pathology that will occupy his kin (and the audience) for the next couple of hours. “My wife takes pills,” he says, “and I drink.” Mr. Shepard is Beverly Weston, a poet living in a big, faded farmhouse in northeastern Oklahoma. Beverly’s wife, Violet, soon makes her wobbly, cackling entrance in the person of Meryl Streep. She takes pills. He drinks. And then Mr. Shepard quits the scene. You will miss him. You might also envy him.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Home Fires, Acridly Burning', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Home Fires, Acridly Burning', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'August: Osage County (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Streep, Meryl', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Letts, Tracy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wells, John', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-26T15:07:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/238967c3-6949-5d18-ad0e-2220a9d2fd06', 'word_count': 955, 'uri': 'nyt://article/238967c3-6949-5d18-ad0e-2220a9d2fd06'}, {'abstract': 'Exploring alternatives to shopping one’s way through life.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/26/alternatives-to-shopping-til-youre-dropping/', 'snippet': 'Exploring alternatives to shopping one’s way through life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the holiday daze upon us, I thought it worth posting a Dot Earth reader on alternatives to shopping until you’re dropping. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/nyregion/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/24/nyregion/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/nyregion/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/nyregion/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/nyregion/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/24/nyregion/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA/25PACKAGES-slide-VEGA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/24/nyregion/2