', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 233, 'width': 225, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Acupuncture, Real or Not, Eases Side Effects of Cancer Drugs', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Regimens: Acupuncture for Side Effects?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACUPUNCTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Breast Cancer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cancer (Journal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-26T16:51:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bakalar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/22675a00-68db-5e5b-a3b4-00a3e1c21f99', 'word_count': 219, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22675a00-68db-5e5b-a3b4-00a3e1c21f99'}, {'abstract': 'Heather Kravas weaves themes of labor and repetition in “a quartet,” choreography that blends folk dance and ballet, at the Coil Festival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/29/arts/dance/heather-kravass-a-quartet-coming-to-the-kitchen.html', 'snippet': 'Heather Kravas weaves themes of labor and repetition in “a quartet,” choreography that blends folk dance and ballet, at the Coil Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whether it rises to the surface or not, the notion of labor usually lurks somewhere in a Heather Kravas dance, in which repeated steps and patterns are knitted together with such exactitude that the results blend vulnerability with steely tenacity. It’s an idea that she extends to herself, especially now as she prepares to unveil “a quartet,” her latest, at the Kitchen in Chelsea beginning Jan. 8.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29KRAVAS1_SPAN/29KRAVAS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29KRAVAS1_SPAN/29KRAVAS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29KRAVAS1_SPAN/29KRAVAS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29KRAVAS1_SPAN/29KRAVAS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29KRAVAS1_SPAN/29KRAVAS1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29KRAVAS1_SPAN/29KRAVAS1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai