https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/27/nyregion/museum-of-the-city-of-new-yorks-gelato-giveaway.html', 'snippet': 'Free gelato and hands-on activities at Museum of the City of New York and free concerts at Brooklyn Night Bazaar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At no other time of year is the Miser’s mom repaid more kindly than over the Christmas holiday, while watching, with a level of glee only an act of cosmic justice could occasion, her eldest child attempt to manage the perfectly unmanageable hopes, desires and vestigial energies of his own little angels.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Museum of the City of New York’s Gelato Giveaway', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Museum of the City of New York’s Gelato Giveaway', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Museum of the City of New York', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-26T18:22:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By A. C. Lee', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Lee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/75f94336-4b14-5394-b27c-3aeb50ab5ec4', 'word_count': 426, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75f94336-4b14-5394-b27c-3aeb50ab5ec4'}, {'abstract': 'Running the Grand Tier Restaurant in the Metropolitan Opera House requires a nimble stage management all its own.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/27/nyregion/a-nights-meal-at-the-opera.html', 'snippet': 'Running the Grand Tier Restaurant in the Metropolitan Opera House requires a nimble stage management all its own.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN I was growing up, most girls I knew went to Lincoln Center for “The Nutcracker.” I went to the opera. Specifically, to Metropolitan Opera rehearsals with my father, who didn’t think twice about pulling me out of school. The first one, when I was in fifth grade, was “Madama Butterfly,” with Teresa Stratas. Let other children tarry with visions of the Sugar Plum Fairy. We cut straight to heartbreak and suicide. I loved it. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27JPCHAT_SPAN/27JPCHAT_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 382, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27JPCHAT_SPAN/27JPCHAT_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 382}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27JPCHAT_SPAN/27JPCHAT_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27JPCHAT_SPAN/27JPCHAT_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1303, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27JPCHAT_SPAN/27JPCHAT_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27JPCHAT_SPAN/27JPCHAT_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27JPCHAT_SPAN/27JPCHAT_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Night’s Meal at the Opera', 'kicker': 'Chat & Chow', '