ticle/fe145f6c-9bae-5f59-bc04-da461fbb3088', 'word_count': 437, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe145f6c-9bae-5f59-bc04-da461fbb3088'}, {'abstract': '“Fruitvale Station,” about the killing of a young African-American on an Oakland, Calif., subway platform, has lifted the actor Michael B. Jordan a few rungs on the ladder of stardom.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/29/movies/michael-b-jordan-on-his-role-in-fruitvale-stationmichael-b-jordan-on-his-role-in-fruitvale-station.html', 'snippet': '“Fruitvale Station,” about the killing of a young African-American on an Oakland, Calif., subway platform, has lifted the actor Michael B. Jordan a few rungs on the ladder of stardom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The “B.” in Michael B. Jordan stands for “Bakari,” which in Swahili means “of noble promise.” For Mr. Jordan, the 26-year-old star of “Fruitvale Station,” 2013 has been the year in which potential — “I’ve been walking in it since I was born” he said of the pressure embodied in his middle name — fully blossomed into reality.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29JORDAN/29JORDAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 872, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29JORDAN/29JORDAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 872}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29JORDAN/29JORDAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 705, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29JORDAN/29JORDAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1410, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29JORDAN/29JORDAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29JORDAN/29JORDAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29JORDAN/29JORDAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Michael B. Jordan on His Role in ‘Fruitvale Station’', 'kicker': 'The Disrupters | The Conscience', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Michael B. Jordan, 26 The Conscience', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jordan, Michael B', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Fruitvale Station (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coogler, Ryan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-26T19:34:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry Rohter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2e7d49d-b694-5bce-aa35-b843d97c226d', 'word_count': 482, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2e7d49d-b694-5bce-aa35-b843d97c226d'}, {'abstract': 'Miley Cyrus, pop’s enfant terrible of 2013, answers critics, and says, “I’m telling women be whoever you want to be.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/29/arts/music/miley-cyrus-on-her-jump-to-sexy-twerker.html', 'snippet': 'Miley Cyrus, pop’s enfant terrible of 2013, answers critics, and says, “I’m telling women be whoever you want to be.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2013, Miley Cyrus wagged her tongue and set tongues wagging. Thanks to a handful of steamy videos, some outrageous wardrobe choices and an erotic comedic performance at the MTV Video Music Awards, Ms. Cyrus took the warp-speed path from directionless ex-child star (as the Disney Channel’s Hannah Montana) to the most directional of pop stars, sliding easily into the role of pop’s enfant terrible. Her album “Bangerz” (RCA) — for which she’ll begin touring in February — was notable for its risk-taking attitude in a year when her competition played it frustratingly smooth.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29SUBMILEY/29SUBMILEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29SUBMILEY/29SUBMILEY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 801}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29SUBMILEY/29SUBMILEY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29SUBMILEY/29SUBMILEY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1535, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29SUBMILEY/29SUBMILEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29SUBMILEY/29SUBMILEY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29SUBMILEY/29SUBMILEY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Miley Cyrus on Her Jump to Sexy Twerker', 'kicker': 'The Disrupters | The Provocateur', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Miley Cyrus, 21 The Provocateur', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cyrus, Miley', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-26T19:34:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Caramanica', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Caramanica', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4cb89168-6455-54d0-a3a4-06be4eaf560e', 'word_count': 1348, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4cb89168-6455-54d0-a3a4-06be4eaf560e'}, {'abstract': 'Nicholas Shakespeare tries to separate fact from fiction in a new book about his aunt Priscilla.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/27/books/in-priscilla-nicholas-shakespeare-looks-at-family-mystery.html', 'snippet': 'Nicholas Shakespeare tries to separate fact from fiction in a new book about his aunt Priscilla.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The mythical status of Nicholas Shakespeare’s aunt Priscilla, the subject of this biographical memoir, took shape in his family on her return to London after the liberation of Paris. A glamorous survivor of four years as a British enemy alien in France during World War II, married to a French viscount, astonishingly and adulterously dating the British movie star Robert Donat. The family’s image couldn’t have been how she saw herself, as the once-adored daughter of a father she barely glimpsed after she was swept off to Paris by a mother she described (seemingly accurately) as “a selfish, vain, stupid woman,” next as an aspiring ballet dancer crippled by illness, then a shy 20-year-old whose parents wouldn’t support her, and — on her way to have a French abortion — a pickup by the viscount.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27bookshakespeare1/27bookshakespeare1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 434, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27bookshakespeare1/27bookshakespeare1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 434, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27bookshakespeare1/27bookshakespeare1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27bookshakespeare1/27bookshakespeare1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/arts/27bookshakespeare1/27bookshakespeare1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Portrait of an Aunt With Dark Secrets', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Portrait of an Aunt With Dark Secrets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shakespeare, Nicholas', 