', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/29/arts/music/lordes-royals-is-class-conscious.html', 'snippet': 'Ella Yelich-O’Connor, better known as Lorde, delivered her class-conscious critique to listeners around the world this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A flourishing teen-pop industry thinks it knows what teenagers care about: crushes, breakups, clothes, parties, perhaps an occasional glimmer of rebellion or idealism. It dispenses songs that are calculated to suit that market. But in 2013, a songwriter who is an actual teenager emerged from the far side of the planet with something smarter and deeper: a class-conscious critique of pop-culture materialism that’s so irresistible it became a No. 1 pop single.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29LORDE/29LORDE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29LORDE/29LORDE-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 960}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29LORDE/29LORDE-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 641, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29LORDE/29LORDE-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1281, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29LORDE/29LORDE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/29/arts/29LORDE/29LORDE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, '