.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/26/a-chinese-homeowners-cannons-warn-demolition-teams-no-closer/', 'snippet': 'Determined to protect his home from being razed, a man in Henan Province has stationed six “cannons” outside it. They apparently cannot be fired, but they are drawing attention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With hundreds of homes around him demolished, and fearing for his own, Zhou Jianbang, a man in Xingyang city, Henan Province, has built a half-dozen black “cannons” and stationed them around his house as warning to demolition teams to stay away, a state-run news agency reported.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Homeowner’s ‘Cannons’ Warn Demolition Teams: No Closer', 'kicker': 'Sinosphere', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demolition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Henan Province (China)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-26T23:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Didi Kirsten Tatlow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Didi', 'middlename': 'Kirsten', 'lastname': 'Tatlow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/770b982d-103c-5c85-bbe3-fbfcbde84df8', 'word_count': 374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/770b982d-103c-5c85-bbe3-fbfcbde84df8'}, {'abstract': 'Just a couple of years after she first opened an Instagram account, Liz Eswein has built a successful business on helping brands use the service.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/26/an-interview-with-liz-eswein-instagram-user-turned-entrepreneur/', 'snippet': 'Just a couple of years after she first opened an Instagram account, Liz Eswein has built a successful business on helping brands use the service.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We often read about how the founders of start-ups become rich and famous, but sometimes, users of new web services also find a way to benefit financially. Take Liz Eswein. Just a couple of years ago, she signed up to Instagram while a senior at New York University. Then she managed to turn that account into an Instagram-based business called The Mobile Media Lab, which has generated more than $1 million in revenue by helping brands use the service. The following is an edited interview with Ms. Eswein.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/technology/bits-liz/bits-liz-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 195, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/technology/bits-liz/bits-liz-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 195, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/technology/bits-liz/bits-liz-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/26/technology/bits-liz/bits-liz-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/26/technology/bits-liz/bits-liz-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'th