rned to his Cleveland and became a broadcaster.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/27/sports/baseball/mike-hegan-baseball-player-and-broadcaster-dies-at-71.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Hegan, who played for several teams in the major leagues, including the Yankees, returned to his Cleveland and became a broadcaster.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mike Hegan, the scion of a Cleveland baseball family who played a dozen seasons elsewhere in the big leagues but returned to his hometown as a longtime broadcaster for the Indians, died on Wednesday in Hilton Head, S.C. He was 71. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/sports/HEGAN-obit-web/HEGAN-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 493, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/27/sports/HEGAN-obit-web/HEGAN-obit-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 493}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/sports/HEGAN-obit-web/HEGAN-obit-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 842, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/sports/HEGAN-obit-web/HEGAN-obit-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1683, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/sports/HEGAN-obit-web/HEGAN-obit-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/27/sports/HEGAN-obit-web/HEGAN-obit-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'captio