and propriety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Frederick Fox, who was 9 when he began designing hats for his mother and sisters to wear to church in their tiny Australian cattle town and grew up to become milliner to Diana, Princess of Wales, and Queen Elizabeth II of England, died on Dec. 11 in London. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/world/FOX-1-obit/FOX-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/27/world/FOX-1-obit/FOX-1-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/world/FOX-1-obit/FOX-1-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/world/FOX-1-obit/FOX-1-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1288, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/world/FOX-1-obit/FOX-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/27/world/FOX-1-obit/FOX-1-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/world/FOX-1-obit/FOX-1-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Frederick Fox, Milliner to Royals, Dies at 82', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'pri