gs.nytimes.com/2013/12/27/no-gifts-please-just-praise-my-good-intentions/', 'snippet': 'If a child chooses donations for a charity instead of gifts for her birthday, does seeking praise for her generosity negate her good intentions?', 'lead_paragraph': 'For her 11th birthday, Madison Helm of Marlton, N.J., had a few requests. She wanted to hold a slumber party for six of her closest friends. She wanted them to bring an item on the Animal Welfare Association’s wish list instead of a gift. She also, at an age her parents deem too young to have her own Facebook account, wanted her mother to publish a status update on the social networking site immediately to give her family and friends the chance to applaud her charitable affair.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-dogs/motherlode-dogs-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-dogs/motherlode-dogs-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-dogs/motherlode-dogs-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-dogs/motherlode-dogs-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1632, 'width': 1224, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-dogs/motherlode-dogs-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/23/style/motherlode-dogs/mo