ticle/8359a505-412e-5c11-a8ce-1830d72986d8'}, {'abstract': 'At the least, “Justin Bieber’s Believe” is an acknowledgment that the days of pure fluff are over, that Mr. Bieber needs to be understood as both an idol and a target.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/28/movies/justin-biebers-believe-directed-by-jon-m-chu.html', 'snippet': 'At the least, “Justin Bieber’s Believe” is an acknowledgment that the days of pure fluff are over, that Mr. Bieber needs to be understood as both an idol and a target.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The key moment in “Justin Bieber’s Believe,” the new hagiographical film, comes in the second half, in a segment that touches ever so lightly upon Mr. Bieber’s tumultuous public image over the last year. The scene is London, last March: A small cluster of paparazzi is egging Mr. Bieber on, and he takes the bait, jumping at the photographers and being held back by a bodyguard. At least half of the conversation (on both sides) is bleeped.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/movies/justin-span/justin-span-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 320, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/27/movies/justin-span/justin-span-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 320}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/movies/justin-span/justin-span-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/movies/justin-span/justin-span-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 