anization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/78375fa2-e30b-5272-a077-071cf2466498', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/78375fa2-e30b-5272-a077-071cf2466498'}, {'abstract': 'According to studies released this year, piracy of video content continued to rise during 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/27/2013-sees-an-increase-in-illegal-video-downloads/', 'snippet': 'According to studies released this year, piracy of video content continued to rise during 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are some lists where you don’t want to be crowned as the winner: most likely not to succeed, for example, or most boring person of the year. And if you own a company that makes and sells TV shows, having one of your creations at the top of the Most Pirated Show on Television list probably isn’t something you’d stick on your fridge.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/technology/bits-game/bits-game-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/technology/bits-game/bits-game-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 592, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/technology/bits-game/bits-game-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/27/technology/bits-game/bits-game-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/27/technology/bits-game/bits-game-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Illegal Video Downloads Continue Upward Trajectory', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Copyrights and Copyright Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-27T17:21:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7af336ee-a9ad-5ffb-8e90-042e4c4b712f', 'word_count': 648, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7af336ee-a9ad-5ffb-8e90-042e4c4b712f'}, {'abstract': 'The items — a Norman Rockwell painting and a life preserver taken from a dive bar — seem to have nothing in common, except that they’re both missing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/28/nyregion/still-no-end-to-the-tales-of-a-1-million-painting-and-a-dusty-preserver.html', 'snippet': 'The items — a Norman Rockwell painting and a life preserver taken from a dive bar — seem to have nothing in common, except that they’re both missing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a perfect world, or at least a perfect newspaper story, the two objects, each of extreme value in its own way, would not only turn up, but would be discovered in the same place — a breathtaking trove. In this scenario, a master thief has stashed them away in his underground lair, where he gazes upon them from time to time, chuckling over a Cognac. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/nyregion/crimescene/crimescene-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/28/nyregion/crimescene/crimescene-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/nyregion/crimescene/crimescene-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 638, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/nyregion/crimescene/crimescene-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 638, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/nyregion/crimescene/crimescene-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/28/nyregion/crimescene/crimescene-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/nyregion/crimescene/crimescene-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Taking Stock of 2 Thefts With Little in Common Except Their Status: Unsolved', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Taking Stock of 2 Thefts With Little in Common Except Their Status: Unsolved', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wilson, Michael', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam