 'images/2013/12/28/business/28audi-span/28audi-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/business/28audi-span/28audi-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1919, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/business/28audi-span/28audi-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/28/business/28audi-span/28audi-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/business/28audi-span/28audi-span-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Sign of Strength, Audi Steps Up Investments', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Audi to Spend 22 Billion Euros in Expansion Push', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Audi Division of Volkswagen AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-27T17:56:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Ewing', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6275af0-d8e1-59e3-aa29-0846e4a54619', 'word_count': 540, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6275af0-d8e1-59e3-aa29-0846e4a54619'}, {'abstract': 'Although it is improved in almost every way, the new Soul retains the mojo that made it a strong seller to begin with.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/28/automobiles/autoreviews/video-the-next-generation-kia-soul-keeps-its-soul.html', 'snippet': 'Although it is improved in almost every way, the new Soul retains the mojo that made it a strong seller to begin with.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Kia introduced the first-generation Soul for the 2010 model year, many dismissed it as a blatant rip-off of the Scion xB. Perhaps, but Soul went on to outsell the xB six to one. Who knew hamsters had that kind of disposable income (or could reach the pedals)?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video: The Next-Generation Kia Soul Keeps Its Soul', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kia Motors Corp', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-27T17:58:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'subsection_name': 'New Cars', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Voelk', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Voelk', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/30cff5ce-b4d9-5bdf-9a10-e806ca246523', 'word_count': 391, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30cff5ce-b4d9-5bdf-9a10-e806ca246523'}, {'abstract': 'A decision on the timing of a €3 billion share issue at the Italian bank, which is also the world’s oldest, was delayed after too few shareholders turned up to vote.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/28/business/international/vote-on-monte-dei-paschis-future-is-postponed.html', 'snippet': 'A decision on the timing of a €3 billion share issue at the Italian bank, which is also the world’s oldest, was delayed after too few shareholders turned up to vote.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SIENA, Italy — The latest chapter in the saga of Monte dei Paschi di Siena, the world’s oldest bank, ended inconclusively Friday after a decision on a rescue plan was postponed amid a quarrel between top management and the bank’s largest shareholder.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vote on Monte dei Paschi’s Future Is Postponed', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Monte dei Paschi di Siena SpA', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Profumo, Alessandro', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-27T18:07:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gaia Pianigiani and Jack Ewing', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gaia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pianigiani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31459dc7-7b95-510d-832d-15791501c46a', 'word_count': 813, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31459dc7-7b95-510d-832d-15791501c46a'}, {'abstract': 'Interior designers, better known for individual homes or stores and restaurants, create the look inside high-end residential condos.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/29/realestate/the-stars-inside-the-building.html', 'snippet': 'Interior designers, better known for individual homes or stores and restaurants, create the look inside high-end residential condos.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The real estate industry in New York City continues to produce pricey new condominiums, seemingly at the rate of tennis balls spit out of a ball launcher. This market revival has pushed the role of the boldface architect back into the spotlight, although that position may have to be shared this time around with interior designers. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/realestate/29DEAL3/29DEAL3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/29/realestate/29DEAL3/29DEAL3-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/realestate/29DEAL3/29DEAL3-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/realestate/29DEAL3/29DEAL3-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/realestate/29DEAL3/29DEAL3-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/29/realestate/29DEAL3/29DEAL3-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/realestate/29DEAL3/29DEAL3-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy':