r Kommersant.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Arrest Warrant for Hédiard Owner Is Revoked', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Court Revokes Arrest Warrant for Hédiard Owner', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Luxury Goods and Services', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hediard', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pugachev, Sergei', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-27T21:07:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew E. Kramer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Kramer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c377437-5a00-53a6-ac93-3c4f0278c91b', 'word_count': 200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c377437-5a00-53a6-ac93-3c4f0278c91b'}, {'abstract': 'Jennifer Holliday performs “And I Am Telling You I’m Not Going” and other songs at her new show at 54 Below.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/28/arts/music/jennifer-holliday-at-54-below.html', 'snippet': 'Jennifer Holliday performs “And I Am Telling You I’m Not Going” and other songs at her new show at 54 Below.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been 32 years since Jennifer Holliday unleashed on the world her version of “And I Am Telling You I’m Not Going,” in the original Broadway production of “Dreamgirls,” and pop-gospel belting hasn’t been the same since. Like the sound of thunder rolling off a mountain, its echoes cascading for miles, Ms. Holliday’s voice resounded with a power that combined the range of Sarah Vaughan with the fervor of Aretha Franklin. And at Thursday’s sensational opening-night show of her debut at 54 Below, Ms. Holliday infused that howl of refusal with the same defiant, fearsome intensity she displayed onstage three decades earlier. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/arts/28JENNIFER/28JENNIFER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 496, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/28/arts/28JENNIFER/28JENNIFER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 496}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/arts/28JENNIFER/28JENNIFER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 846, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/arts/28JENNIFER/28JENNIFER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1692, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/arts/28JENNIFER/28JENNIFER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/28/arts/28JENNIFER/28JENNIFER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/arts/28JENNIFER/28JENNIFER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Refusal Stands Strong, 32 Years Later', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Refusal Stands Strong, 32 Years Later', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': '54 Below (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, Etta', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-27T21:09:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/df4ff98f-7f72-56be-a6f5-426af4ff8d78', 'word_count': 374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df4ff98f-7f72-56be-a6f5-426af4ff8d78'}, {'abstract': 'As it backs away from consumer electronics, Panasonic is focusing on two less visible but more profitable areas — homes and cars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/28/business/international/to-reinvent-itself-panasonic-moves-beyond-the-living-room.html', 'snippet': 'As it backs away from consumer electronics, Panasonic is focusing on two less visible but more profitable areas — homes and cars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FUJISAWA, Japan — Panasonic used to make televisions, refrigerators and computer monitors in this suburb of Tokyo. Now, six years after closing its factories in Fujisawa, the company is building homes on the site, which is sandwiched between Mount Fuji and the Pacific.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/business/PANASONIC/PANASONIC-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/28/business/PANASONIC/PANASONIC-article