icy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/28/business/international/spain-orders-smaller-price-increase-for-electricity.html', 'snippet': 'The government’s unprecedented intervention has underlined the fragile regulations of Spain’s electricity market and the conflicting interests driving its energy policy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID — The Spanish government decreed on Friday that the country’s utilities could charge consumers only 2.3 percent more for their electricity next month after accusing utilities of manipulating a recent auction to win a price increase of 11 percent.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spain Orders Smaller Price Increase for Electricity', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spain Orders Smaller Price Increase for Electricity', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Energy and Power', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Solar Energy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Renewable Energy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric Light and Power', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-27T21:15:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raphael Minder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raphael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Minder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6e1caebb-da63-553b-bdf5-52b9eccde3cc', 'word_count': 716, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6e1caebb-da63-553b-bdf5-52b9eccde3cc'}, {'abstract': 'The Heckscher Museum of Art is exhibiting an unusual mix of prints, photographs and paintings with one common theme: rabble-rousing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/29/nyregion/rabble-rousers-art-dissent-and-social-commentary-at-the-heckscher-museum-of-art.html', 'snippet': 'The Heckscher Museum of Art is exhibiting an unusual mix of prints, photographs and paintings with one common theme: rabble-rousing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A disturbing image or a discordant style, or both, might have qualified a work to be included in “Rabble-Rousers: Art, Dissent, and Social Commentary” at the Heckscher Museum of Art in Huntington. ', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/nyregion/29ARTSLI3_SPAN/29ARTSLI3_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/29/nyregion/29ARTSLI3_SPAN/29ARTSLI3_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/nyregion/29ARTSLI3_SPAN/29ARTSLI3_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/nyregion/29ARTSLI3_SPAN/29ARTSLI3_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1441, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/29/nyregion/29ARTSLI3_SPAN/29ARTSLI3_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/29/nyregion/29ARTSLI3_SPAN/29ARTSLI3_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.