ht end in N.F.L. history and second only to Jerry Rice in receptions by a player at any position.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — In his final season, Atlanta Falcons tight end Tony Gonzalez found something else to help him improve. He started stretching at night. He was 37 and had worked 17 years in the N.F.L. Enshrinement in the Hall of Fame was all but assured, yet he added to his routine. Even with just four months left in a career that started in 1997, he pushed himself to achieve more with his nightly workout. It was a push for new heights.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/sports/Y-FALCONS/Y-FALCONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/30/sports/Y-FALCONS/Y-FALCONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/sports/Y-FALCONS/Y-FALCONS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/sports/Y-FALCONS/Y-FALCONS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1379, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/sports/Y-FALCONS/Y-FALCONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/30/sports/Y-FALCONS/Y-FALCONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/sports/Y-FALCONS/Y-FALCONS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1,325 Catches Later, Gonzalez Wraps Up His Career', 'kicker': 'Panthers 21, Falcons 20', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '1,325 Catches Later, Gonzalez Wraps Up His Career', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glier, Ray', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Falcons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gonzalez, Tony', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carolina Panthers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-30T02:56:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ray Glier', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ray', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glier', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/436e2399-a23d-5d61-ae7e-407310dbc80b', 'word_count': 906, 'uri': 'nyt://article/436e2399-a23d-5d61-ae7e-407310dbc80b'}, {'abstract': 'No corrections appeared in print on December 30, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/30/pageoneplus/no-corrections-december-30-2013.html', 'snippet': 'No corrections appeared in print on December 30, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times welcomes comments and suggestions, or complaints about errors that warrant correction. Messages on news coverage can be e-mailed to nytnews@nytimes.com or left toll-free at 1-888-NYT-NEWS (1-888-698-6397). Comments on editorials may be e-mailed to letters@nytimes.com or faxed to (212) 556-3622.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Corrections: December 30, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_k