 Russell begins to do that in the latter half of ‘Three Kings,’ his film begins homing in on the political and moral conundrums that were always at the heart of this material.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on Monday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Monday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-30T05:22:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/e43285c6-0001-57b8-89a0-7dd7bac0b4b5', 'word_count': 741, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e43285c6-0001-57b8-89a0-7dd7bac0b4b5'}, {'abstract': 'The Warriors, making their first extended trip east this season, have the speed and size to give the Heat trouble.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/30/sports/basketball/nba-game-of-the-week-coast-to-coast-clash.html', 'snippet': 'The Warriors, making their first extended trip east this season, have the speed and size to give the Heat trouble.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every week, The New York Times will choose one essential game to watch, highlighting hot teams, winning and losing streaks, and statistical intrigue in the N.B.A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.B.A. Game of the Week: Coast-to-Coast Clash', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'N.B.A. Game of the Week: Coast-to-Coast Clash', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Golden State Warriors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 