o use will be any more effective than previous efforts.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/30/china-orders-officials-to-stop-smoking-in-public/', 'snippet': 'Smoking is one of China’s most serious public health problems, and critics ask if the latest move to curb tobacco use will be any more effective than previous efforts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'China is stepping up efforts to ban smoking in public places by ordering Communist Party officials to “lead by example” and refrain from smoking in government offices, schools, hospitals, sports and cultural venues and on public transport. Party officials have also been ordered to ask others not to smoke in public.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/world/30sino-smoking/30sino-smoking-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/30/world/30sino-smoking/30sino-smoking-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/world/30sino-smoking/30sino-smoking-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/world/30sino-smoking/30sino-smoking-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/world/30sino-smoking/30sino-smoking-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/30/world/30sino-smoking/30sino-smoking-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thum