kdowns of financial crimes, particularly with insider trading cases, crowdfunding frauds and settlements involving interest-rate manipulation, Peter J. Henning writes in the White Collar Watch column.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/12/30/regulators-have-new-cases-of-frauds-and-abuses-to-tackle/', 'snippet': 'The new year will likely bring novel crackdowns of financial crimes, particularly with insider trading cases, crowdfunding frauds and settlements involving interest-rate manipulation, Peter J. Henning writes in the White Collar Watch column.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Goodbye 2013 frauds; welcome 2014 abuses.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/business/dbpix-preet-wcw/dbpix-preet-wcw-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/31/business/dbpix-preet-wcw/dbpix-preet-wcw-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/business/dbpix-preet-wcw/dbpix-preet-wcw-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/business/dbpix-preet-wcw/dbpix-preet-wcw-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/business/dbpix-preet-wcw/dbpix-preet-wcw-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/31/business/dbpix-preet-wcw/dbpix-preet-wcw-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank