 said he would end, at least for now, the practice of closing low-performing schools.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/nyregion/31chancellor_cnd/31chancellor_cnd-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/31/nyregion/31chancellor_cnd/31chancellor_cnd-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/nyregion/31chancellor_cnd/31chancellor_cnd-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/nyregion/31chancellor_cnd/31chancellor_cnd-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/nyregion/31chancellor_cnd/31chancellor_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/31/nyregion/31chancellor_cnd/31chancellor_cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/nyregion/31chancellor_cnd/31chancellor_cnd-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'De Blasio Recognizes Obstacles Standing in Way of Schools Plan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'De Blasio Recognizes Obstacles Standing in Way of Schools Plan', 'name