on of some components will be delayed for up to two months after a blaze destroyed one of its Swiss workshops.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/31/business/international/fire-at-swatch-workshop-causes-delays.html', 'snippet': 'The Swatch Group says production of some components will be delayed for up to two months after a blaze destroyed one of its Swiss workshops.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MADRID — The Swatch Group, the world’s largest watchmaker, said on Monday that production of some watch components would be delayed for as long as two months after a fire destroyed one of its Swiss workshops.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fire at Swatch Workshop Causes Production Delays', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fire at Swatch Workshop Causes Production Delays', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Swatch Group', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Switzerland', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Watches and Clocks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-30T19:11:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Raphael Minder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Raphael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Minder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/479cf3ec-b0e0-5b4a-b099-9bafa41e0dc1', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/479cf3ec-b0e0-5b4a-b099-9bafa41e0dc1'}, {'abstract': 'Two million here, four million there, and soon you’re talking about real effects.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/30/obamacare-not-a-total-disaster-continued/', 'snippet': 'Two million here, four million there, and soon you’re talking about real effects.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perceptions about health reform are in an interesting place. Just about everyone on the right is still living in October, the annus horribilis of Obamacare (yes, I know it was just a month, and I don’t care), and is waiting to move in for the kill after the whole thing collapses. Meanwhile, a funny thing has been happening: enrollments surged this month, to such an extent that the original expectation of 7 million people signed up via the exchanges by the end of March no longer looks crazy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Obamacare Not A Total Disaster, Continued', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-12-30T19:20:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0f525bb-a08b-59d2-9093-1ba2927ec631', 'word_count': 251, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0f525bb-a08b-59d2-9093-1ba2927ec631'}, {'abstract': 'Eddie George, who retired from the NFL in 2005, is playing the title role in the Nashville Shakespeare Festival’s production of “Othello.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/12/30/and-now-the-starting-lineup-as-othello-a-63-running-back-no-27-eddie-george/', 'snippet': 'Eddie George, who retired from the NFL in 2005, is playing the title role in the Nashville Shakespeare Festival’s production of “Othello.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Eddie George retired from football in 2005, after nine years as an N.F.L. running back, he was 32 years old and had racked up some enviable statistics: 130 consecutive regular-season game starts, 10,441 rushing yards and 68 touchdowns, along with the Heisman Trophy he won at Ohio State University in 1995. Since then, he has started a string of businesses, including fitness programs and a landscape architecture company, opened a sports-themed restaurant and been a motivational speaker.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/arts/30artsbeat-george/30artsbeat-george-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 861, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/30/arts/30artsbeat-george/30artsbeat-george-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 861}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/arts/30artsbeat-george/30artsbeat-george-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 714, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/arts/30artsbeat-george/30artsbeat-george-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1393, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/arts/30artsbeat-george/30artsbeat-george-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/30/arts/30artsbeat-george/30artsbeat-george-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/30/arts/30artsb