2013/12/31/us/us-population-rises-just-0-72-percent-census-bureau-finds.html', 'snippet': 'An outside demographer said last year’s growth rate was the lowest in more than seven decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States population grew only 0.72 percent last year, to 316,128,839 in July from 313,873,685 a year earlier, according to figures released Monday by the Census Bureau.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Population Up Just 0.7%, Census Finds', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Population Up Just 0.7%, Census Finds', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Population', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Census Bureau', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-30T19:42:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tamar Lewin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tamar', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lewin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3467b1e3-22ff-5aed-8ae4-fed928b3d8d3', 'word_count': 439, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3467b1e3-22ff-5aed-8ae4-fed928b3d8d3'}, {'abstract': 'This year’s financial news had some important themes, but it is up to the individual investor to decide whether to act on them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/30/your-money/reading-between-the-lines-of-2013s-big-stories.html', 'snippet': 'This year’s financial news had some important themes, but it is up to the individual investor to decide whether to act on them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When we see a story in the news repeatedly, we have a tendency to think it must be important. Thinking something is important often means we fe