eer bottles in appreciation. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/arts/31GUITARISTjp/31GUITARISTjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 311, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/31/arts/31GUITARISTjp/31GUITARISTjp-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 311}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/arts/31GUITARISTjp/31GUITARISTjp-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 530, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/arts/31GUITARISTjp/31GUITARISTjp-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1061, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/arts/31GUITARISTjp/31GUITARISTjp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/31/arts/31GUITARISTjp/31GUITARISTjp-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/arts/31GUITARISTjp/31GUITARISTjp-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From Billy Joel Tribute Band to the Real Thing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Billy Joel Tribute Band to the Real Thing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Joel, Billy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DelGuidice, Mike', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-30T22:29:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0813d77a-badc-5483-ae54-3e83baedf691', 'word_count': 1172, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0813d77a-badc-5483-ae54-3e83baedf691'}, {'abstract': 'Truvada’s use to prevent H.I.V. has been approved by the F.D.A. and hailed by experts. But the pill has been slow to catch on among healthy gay men.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/31/health/a-resisted-pill-to-prevent-hiv.html', 'snippet': 'Truvada’s use to prevent H.I.V. has been approved by the F.D.A. and hailed by experts. But the pill has been slow to catch on among healthy gay men.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Over a cup of tea at a downtown Starbucks, Michael Rubio recalled how four friends became H.I.V. positive through unprotected sex, all within a year. The news shocked Mr. Rubio, a 28-year-old gay man, into trying a controversial new form of H.I.V. prevention: a daily pill that studies show is highly effective in protecting people from infection.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/science/31JPPREP_SPAN/31JPPREP-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/31/science/31JPPREP_SPAN/31JPPREP-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/