he snow on the steepest mountain slopes without sliding off, they turn to winch cats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/31/automobiles/winch-cats-are-the-ultimate-off-road-vehicles.html', 'snippet': 'When ski areas need machines that can groom the snow on the steepest mountain slopes without sliding off, they turn to winch cats.', 'lead_paragraph': "All-wheel-drive cars, such as 4-wheel-drive S.U.V.'s, are capable snow machines — to an extent. Then there are snowcats, with tracked wheels and plow blades that enable them to go pretty much anywhere.", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/automobiles/31SNOW-image/31SNOW-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/31/automobiles/31SNOW-image/31SNOW-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/automobiles/31SNOW-image/31SNOW-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/automobiles/31SNOW-image/31SNOW-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/31/automobiles/31SNOW-image/31SNOW-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/12/31/automobiles/31SNOW-image/31SNOW-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image'