061-71e5-50ac-8082-914903fba2f1', 'word_count': 166, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f4cb061-71e5-50ac-8082-914903fba2f1'}, {'abstract': 'India’s Right to Education Act guarantees a free education for children ages 6 to 14. But as the law is carried out, many fear the standards will be too tough for many existing schools to stay open.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/asia/100000002624357/in-india-complications-for-education.html', 'snippet': 'India’s Right to Education Act guarantees a free education for children ages 6 to 14. But as the law is carried out, many fear the standards will be too tough for many existing schools to stay open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'India’s Right to Education Act guarantees a free education for children ages 6 to 14. But as the law is carried out, many fear the standards will be too tough for many existing schools to stay open.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/multimedia/india-education-act/india-education-act-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/12/28/multimedia/india-education-act/india-education-act-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/multimedia/india-education-act/india-education-act-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/multimedia/india-education-act/india-education-act-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/12/28/multimedia/india-