ly 43 percent now endorsing the theory — a drop of 11 points since 2009. Most Democrats are steady believers, with 67 percent in favor, a rise of three points. What all this means for social issue politicking in the new year remains to be seen. But the net effect is a remarkable 24-point evolution credibility gap between the two parties, more than double the 10-point gap of four years earlier.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Grand Old Primate Party?', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evolution (Biology)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pew Research Center', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-12-31T18:31:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Francis X. Clines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Francis', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Clines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ebbb8334-684b-5945-b562-4e134edc1fd3', 'word_count': 229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ebbb8334-684b-5945-b562-4e134edc1fd3'}, {'abstract': 'Locker-room footwear becomes street-worthy; Electric Nest is an eclectic new boutique in Williamsburg; Pret-à-Surf teams up with Thakoon Panichgul on bikinis and crop tops turn up in the winter, too.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/02/fashion/Trendy-Shoes-Slides-Flip-Flops-Fashion-Designers.html', 'snippet': 'Locker-room footwear becomes street-worthy; Electric Nest is an eclectic new boutique in Williamsburg; Pret-à-Surf teams up with Thakoon Panichgul on bikinis and crop tops turn up in the winter, too.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yes, 2013 was the year that Adidas shower slides became an acceptable form of fashion footwear. The onetime locker-room essential was taken up by cool kids on the street, was adopted by the singer Grimes, and even invaded Fashion Week, on Alexander Wang’s niece, who proved a most stylish street-style star when she wore a Nike version to her uncle’s show. Designers quickly took note, offering a slew of interpretations for 2014. These rubber Chloés from the resort collection, now on pre-order at a whopping $840, are said to be selling out fast. For styling, take a cue from the Joseph spring show (above), where slides were shown with sporty-sleek trousers, relaxed blazers and anoraks.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/fashion/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-copy/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/01/02/fashion/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-copy/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/fashion/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-copy/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/fashion/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-copy/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/02/fashion/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-copy/02BROWSESLIDES_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/02/fash